eated_at": "2025-08-25T14:48:35", "owner": "mugi_536", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18055976471421904, "text": "我的大脑被知识强奸了", "created_at": "2025-08-24T09:32:22", "owner": "skiesfaith_", "likes": 63}, {"id": 18040709372693499, "text": "比較想換個男的看看😌", "created_at": "2025-09-19T07:06:28", "owner": "hoihoi_hk", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18108656599551627, "text": "很難分清楚誰是誰吧", "created_at": "2025-08-24T12:54:09", "owner": "lovesunny0706", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17936344584076350, "text": "下次要藏好", "created_at": "2025-08-22T19:06:25", "owner": "straightup_ji", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17983684733728078, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-11T04:36:10", "owner": "keelongxu", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18078204680092227, "text": "明明就是看到老婆要一起在车上用的", "created_at": "2025-09-27T20:55:05", "owner": "_ginn.wav__", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18045124232391296, "text": "美婭很漂亮", "created_at": "2025-10-15T18:52:33", "owner": "sofubii", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17854480836513803, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-25T17:09:21", "owner": "twasd80602", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18310968439245005, "text": "猜到了前面沒想到後面還有", "created_at": "2025-08-26T12:10:29", "owner": "yehyide", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17890702494246218, "text": "😮我刚刚是不是学习了", "created_at": "2025-11-23T06:36:35", "owner": "octus1919", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18056640014133440, "text": "🔥🙌", "created_at": "2025-08-24T10:00:59", "owner": "leo_09041216", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18138566554425805, "text": "這不是抄襲國外的段子嗎😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-28T11:54:27", "owner": "igusernamedax", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18086901223995933, "text": "小姨子的诱惑", "created_at": "2025-12-17T04:02:26", "owner": "a12202926", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18419998852096662, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-24T13:46:13", "owner": "n7t0s2", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18061201418611905, "text": "我屌", "created_at": "2025-08-26T05:56:45", "owner": "ryan._.ddos", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18099683737729337, "text": "女生的ig有嗎😍", "created_at": "2025-10-04T06:39:45", "owner": "connor_cheung", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18406873021119786, "text": "咦", "created_at": "2025-08-24T14:56:22", "owner": "_yoyoyoko._____._", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18027449837735423, "text": "每日被扇😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-08T06:26:08", "owner": "woweinehase", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18318501427209887, "text": "我diu~", "created_at": "2025-08-25T13:57:23", "owner": "lizi.1644", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18099874471611296, "text": "你为了然后我记住我叼 真是有心了😍", "created_at": "2025-08-26T12:22:54", "owner": "briellegloww", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18142920160417748, "text": "@yixior 看到最后", "created_at": "2025-08-24T12:09:27", "owner": "kebei_w_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18314793703175852, "text": "i need girl name plz", "created_at": "2025-10-12T07:23:28", "owner": "uyern127", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18418290322108458, "text": "一种很不体面的方式学会了这个词🥲", "created_at": "2025-08-27T10:38:49", "owner": "yuligukill", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18062520926071758, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-13T02:30:40", "owner": "c02nut", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18070051547128807, "text": "那個是什麼", "created_at": "2025-08-22T23:53:16", "owner": "bri_an091", "likes": 202}, {"id": 18058463459381724, "text": "看完也很懵逼，你这是咋想的呢，喝的菌菇汤肯定没熟吧，多high才能想出这思路", "created_at": "2025-08-23T04:00:56", "owner": "lingpan9999", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18290424070248339, "text": "打得不够狠啊，打得够狠还能教英语吗。", "created_at": "2025-08-25T03:29:27", "owner": "angousiba", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18362105332154373, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-27T04:33:02", "owner": "jony__ch4", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18073486439017684, "text": "还演这种剧吗？我出200", "created_at": "2025-08-27T06:25:56", "owner": "johnny__qiao", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17877358311285620, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-08-28T09:07:03", "owner": "kensonwch", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082693222917541, "text": "@mycs_boon 🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-28T13:28:37", "owner": "rairai_02092k", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17982837116854669, "text": "别看了😂他是来教英语的", "created_at": "2025-08-28T16:57:13", "owner": "x7x7lei", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17963755112951079, "text": "language:0% understanding:90%", "created_at": "2025-08-28T22:35:38", "owner": "otto_gloria_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057047741386542, "text": "上次跟哥們教的\n得慢點 demand", "created_at": "2025-08-29T01:21:42", "owner": "lachowskic.t", "likes": 10}, {"id": 17978024849871689, "text": "這樣也可以😮", "created_at": "2025-08-28T23:51:29", "owner": "adaiaiai.810", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18518297848024155, "text": "傑克揚升你也有一個教英語的頻道啊？😂", "created_at": "2025-08-29T03:52:06", "owner": "jackhana2022", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18078501844786950, "text": "冷知識：套子不能放車上，會劣化", "created_at": "2025-08-29T08:16:41", "owner": "raylin_0617", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17856498558506629, "text": "刚才才背到这个单词😂笑死", "created_at": "2025-09-03T23:37:00", "owner": "lanlan.yan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17842449756570480, "text": "看了二遍才看懂，保險套放車上會壞掉吧", "created_at": "2025-08-30T11:26:00", "owner": "joe_kaiser_alfonso", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086289634888047, "text": "通常沒有就算了！😂", "created_at": "2025-09-04T10:23:27", "owner": "hsinchih.lin.610", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067037705335546, "text": "我知道一个解决办法，把小姨子介绍给我😍", "created_at": "2025-09-05T07:10:04", "owner": "jt52110", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18058473077596227, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-09T08:12:35", "owner": "_a.lo_999_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17920523004080083, "text": "我叼～學會了", "created_at": "2025-09-09T13:04:55", "owner": "neilx0x", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17880989532384065, "text": "建議納入國際教材", "created_at": "2025-09-08T06:53:28", "owner": "kyrierrr0503", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17958542145002288, "text": "又没防住", "created_at": "2025-09-10T06:42:07", "owner": "leokw_02", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17914830411082683, "text": "雙包ig??", "created_at": "2025-09-09T17:09:17", "owner": "holalaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17904844866248679, "text": "Ordeal學到了", "created_at": "2025-09-11T09:41:00", "owner": "tmy8564", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18317638294212916, "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-09-12T06:29:43", "owner": "woshinengdie8", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18107544883578073, "text": "爹！ 求这女生IG", "created_at": "2025-09-12T05:42:51", "owner": "liang_darren", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18051403886636732, "text": "每次到了结尾才想起这是教学片😂", "created_at": "2025-09-13T01:14:58", "owner": "jacky_liu0_0", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17853772638534876, "text": "ORDEAL 我刁", "created_at": "2025-09-13T01:43:43", "owner": "tienjoseph", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18068235905184491, "text": "每次都猝不及防", "created_at": "2025-09-13T15:56:44", "owner": "jonathan14461", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057967514575973, "text": "所以我叼是什麼？", "created_at": "2025-09-15T17:39:46", "owner": "lin_allen950731", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18025752197736946, "text": "我都来这里了你还是没有放过我nooooo！", "created_at": "2025-09-15T14:53:41", "owner": "diorpursefans", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17917167678178033, "text": "我屌！", "created_at": "2025-09-13T16:04:18", "owner": "nuhc.ak", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18402191653138884, "text": "你為什麼一直出現 強迫我學習英文！", "created_at": "2025-09-18T04:13:04", "owner": "tonytonychopa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18311017543171186, "text": "知識以一種卑鄙的方式進入到我的腦子裡了😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-09-18T04:52:55", "owner": "amagx3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17918001195177496, "text": "@verity6119", "created_at": "2025-09-18T15:16:24", "owner": "alyssacurtisaa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082719730746872, "text": "想不到", "created_at": "2025-09-19T10:20:53", "owner": "stanley_zizi_881212", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18018102041765182, "text": "可以分享下你的化妆技巧么", "created_at": "2025-09-20T21:19:13", "owner": "danielxpeng", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18531636967054009, "text": "跟她說我是雙胞胎哥哥、那個是「我弟喔」就不會被打了", "created_at": "2025-09-24T01:12:52", "owner": "biasyumin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18020710868773125, "text": "我還以為是姊姊假扮妹妹誘惑 其實車裡的是妹妹 測試忠誠之餘看能否分辨出女友", "created_at": "2025-09-25T02:23:20", "owner": "derekwolf78", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17984842517728973, "text": "ordeal", "created_at": "2025-09-21T05:51:05", "owner": "hk_fishkami", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078212480049623, "text": "作为视频来说，在放回药之后就应该特写结束了，最后结局真的多余啊，扣分不少", "created_at": "2025-09-25T07:14:07", "owner": "riveryellow2023", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18088776703862266, "text": "吧啦吧啦屌", "created_at": "2025-09-26T04:40:27", "owner": "seanlifemore", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17927521281107306, "text": "起码真的有学黑几个字😂", "created_at": "2025-09-25T12:09:55", "owner": "bleachbyakuya", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17963597744831209, "text": "請問「我叼」是啥", "created_at": "2025-09-30T14:32:53", "owner": "gwoa_gwoa", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17939409147073806, "text": "这个梗至少二十年了，我最早在故事会的前篇笑话里看到，写的也是姐妹，不过在车里的是岳父。", "created_at": "2025-10-03T12:12:32", "owner": "ff287143739", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076382093030041, "text": "我就知道", "created_at": "2025-10-03T22:40:50", "owner": "ethannnathann", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17949269421025061, "text": "@147_0714", "created_at": "2025-10-03T15:56:33", "owner": "instammyard", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17858222235521280, "text": "要閉眼睛的程度，好歹是穿內衣的級數，很出戲", "created_at": "2025-10-04T01:55:39", "owner": "leofok78", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18092607502823265, "text": "知識以奇怪的方式進到我腦袋裡了", "created_at": "2025-10-08T02:31:45", "owner": "jon.22.tw", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077480207014813, "text": "我吸", "created_at": "2025-10-06T15:05:01", "owner": "_ethan_huan67", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18141854035437589, "text": "屁啦😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-10T09:26:32", "owner": "bydayright", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18071084462246676, "text": "知识就这样进入我脑子里了", "created_at": "2025-10-20T05:06:01", "owner": "yi.ye.zhi.qiu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18111470776570776, "text": "不是哥们 用这个词儿的时候还得回想起整个情景喜剧怎么着", "created_at": "2025-10-23T21:45:08", "owner": "rainmaker.404", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18023431517781071, "text": "知識以一種我想像不到的方式進入了我的腦袋裡", "created_at": "2025-10-24T13:57:31", "owner": "iam_cute_cumber", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17906784405128371, "text": "雖然很難救但是還是可以救\n答案：nonono,我知道那是你妹妹所以我努力的克制住慾望來車上見你，俗話說：停車做愛楓林晚。我這不是想要跟你嗎", "created_at": "2025-11-02T08:17:51", "owner": "nazuna_1314", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18047092487430745, "text": "我去", "created_at": "2025-11-13T22:31:35", "owner": "yiyang2846", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17927793216152128, "text": "居然是教英语的", "created_at": "2025-11-05T11:55:39", "owner": "clarysage1123", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17851011732579502, "text": "刚刚是学习了一下", "created_at": "2025-11-03T16:47:59", "owner": "aimtsunxinan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18530803498012005, "text": "真得控制你了", "created_at": "2025-10-16T14:01:04", "owner": "potatofei_168", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18416794699129320, "text": "懂了，以後就買特斯拉", "created_at": "2025-09-22T03:19:46", "owner": "sh22751wm", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18036097835700351, "text": "知识以一种卑鄙的方式进入了我的脑子。", "created_at": "2025-09-05T14:15:25", "owner": "guozonghuan", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18146303023433140, "text": "知识以可恶的形式进入了我的脑海", "created_at": "2025-12-19T14:13:19", "owner": "irina_ruoruo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976316907953343, "text": "此状况是我认识凯文唯一的方式", "created_at": "2025-12-13T06:53:44", "owner": "chuyx20110318", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18558880504021589, "text": "@anchor3093575118 将军！圣上在家吗😨😨😨", "created_at": "2025-12-10T07:28:01", "owner": "samhansen020510", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540758257001053, "text": "谁教你这么传授单词的😢", "created_at": "2025-12-10T06:11:23", "owner": "shangdi707", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18342499459237364, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T02:19:51", "owner": "philip_yau67", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032075183738680, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T13:30:59", "owner": "michael_2023326", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051545837370075, "text": "这些畜生官二代富二代其实就是支那国那些剥削底层牛马换来的", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:41:42", "owner": "tonyaamir", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057851147301621, "text": "哎又学了一个新单词🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:14:16", "owner": "illion6666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051630104370365, "text": "我好像記住了...", "created_at": "2025-11-30T02:45:02", "owner": "zhouchenhaozhou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155354053409408, "text": "又学到一个单词", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:36:17", "owner": "vlia_xo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088869635500402, "text": "被知識強姦", "created_at": "2025-11-23T02:42:00", "owner": "___.cheukkiiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086853238810872, "text": "我刚刚是不是学习了？", "created_at": "2025-11-23T01:49:05", "owner": "ma.jerryma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076044971350221, "text": "知识可以被老师硬塞进脑子，可以被我学进脑子，但是不能用这种方式进来😡", "created_at": "2025-11-18T12:54:17", "owner": "amun.tong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18195800764325922, "text": "我學會一個單詞這哥們至少挨一巴掌  這是我學英文的義父", "created_at": "2025-11-17T15:17:10", "owner": "qqwwjoe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100549141737265, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T00:56:57", "owner": "patricia5046rodriguez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006082043662831, "text": "我居然學廢了😂", "created_at": "2025-11-15T07:39:44", "owner": "world_peace0_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940409661960629, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-15T05:48:49", "owner": "mi.628_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077525456334353, "text": "对不起已经认出你了", "created_at": "2025-11-14T13:32:49", "owner": "ycw141314", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059927336216425, "text": "我叼", "created_at": "2025-11-14T12:51:38", "owner": "22imks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099381892772662, "text": "我丢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-14T09:27:10", "owner": "naixixixixixixixixi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081016123890728, "text": "我叼是啥意思", "created_at": "2025-11-11T00:44:25", "owner": "fark567890", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17893121211339938, "text": "但是 我叼是什麼 🤔🤔🤔", "created_at": "2025-10-04T02:39:13", "owner": "dingu0826", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18055120901240686, "text": "袋子不是應該放錢包嗎？", "created_at": "2025-09-30T01:46:20", "owner": "ironray31", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17917096152193487, "text": "你长得蛮像rain的。", "created_at": "2025-09-29T20:09:51", "owner": "nicoledakotaw", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18088616494874611, "text": "這個有點凹", "created_at": "2025-09-29T16:28:43", "owner": "nicksu6688", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18078174286999886, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-25T04:16:07", "owner": "tang.rosy", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18020238587565569, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-11T16:10:08", "owner": "forrestlcl", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17893516950301679, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-11T16:03:02", "owner": "djdcdndskzn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17979286085874890, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-29T09:00:58", "owner": "futing_tsai", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18173704957345083, "text": "自從追蹤你 我學到不少新單詞", "created_at": "2025-08-27T11:53:11", "owner": "hin_bb1314", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18172714195353654, "text": "又抄", "created_at": "2025-08-24T14:28:53", "owner": "sssing_w", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17920011840113557, "text": "😍😍😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-08-24T03:34:28", "owner": "ohmegaan", "likes": 2}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["新概念英文", "英文", "學英文", "學習", "努力", "上進", "日常", "真實", "台灣", "搞笑", "搞笑影片"]},
