{"media_id": 3762840364047507445, "shortcode": "DQ4S1_tjZ_1", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DQ4S1_tjZ_1/", "taken_at": "2025-11-10T14:41:46", "caption": "@_ashbyflorence_ my good little kitten", "owner_username": "haleyybaylee", "owner_id": "197441822", "likes": 200051, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0005_DQ4S1_tjZ_1\\DQ4S1_tjZ_1_20251110_144146.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18084605140992000, "text": "and then you gotta wait behind them the whole time and act like nothing's wrong 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-10T14:44:53", "owner": "breakableheavenss", "likes": 25153}, {"id": 17878705794427182, "text": "Lmao this is me and I don't care 😂.", "created_at": "2025-11-10T14:48:30", "owner": "peaceteaqueen73", "likes": 2002}, {"id": 18039976304496024, "text": "The person behind you guys laughing in shock is so real😭", "created_at": "2025-11-10T16:06:19", "owner": "kaelie.ross", "likes": 4111}, {"id": 17974501859954239, "text": "I thought this is so cringe (like the head on shoulders or hugging from behind) but now I'm in love and we did it too and I loved every second of it 😌", "created_at": "2025-11-13T12:08:48", "owner": "rebecka_x3", "likes": 626}, {"id": 18143341774443773, "text": "Oh my goddd", "created_at": "2025-11-10T17:33:03", "owner": "jacknewsome", "likes": 84}, {"id": 18111073564597445, "text": "theme park love is so real 😂❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-18T13:40:26", "owner": "clarinsusa", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18029944775542608, "text": "am I the only person that thinks this isn't that bad? they aren't touching anything inappropriate, they aren't shoved their tongues down each other's throats, I mean some of these like the ledge one was a little extreme fs but I feel like people are making it seem like a bigger deal than it is 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-12T17:15:16", "owner": "peytonrose2157", "likes": 962}, {"id": 18057168647285998, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-10T15:35:16", "owner": "alexketchem", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18069481412590636, "text": "THE CAPTION OMG", "created_at": "2025-11-10T15:06:41", "owner": "carterkench", "likes": 739}, {"id": 18077152988516911, "text": "The second-hand embarrassment is real😭", "created_at": "2025-11-10T14:42:57", "owner": "bee_saley", "likes": 14536}, {"id": 18047057585392620, "text": "So many lonely people", "created_at": "2025-11-10T19:12:00", "owner": "tyler_skennedys", "likes": 418}, {"id": 17842062276618862, "text": "I don't go that crazy but if im in a 2hr+ line- ima lean on my man😭", "created_at": "2025-11-11T19:31:03", "owner": "gabrielle.ecmm", "likes": 630}, {"id": 18083862335016796, "text": "LMFAOOOO i lost it when ashby was on the ledge 😂😭", "created_at": "2025-11-10T14:51:39", "owner": "paigeslayton_", "likes": 1988}, {"id": 17930916030103977, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-10T14:51:37", "owner": "younes.mennane", "likes": 1482}, {"id": 18327085066214883, "text": "You sniffing her neck was the most accurate part 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-10T15:14:41", "owner": "theneonbarbie", "likes": 179}, {"id": 18122604613522367, "text": "you forgot to put your hands down each others thongs 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T12:35:41", "owner": "internet.pixie", "likes": 22}, {"id": 18113573425583378, "text": "what’s cringe is people projecting their loneliness onto the internet for validation cause they’re single and aren’t interested. God forbid a couple is in love and happy. ofc i don’t agree w the excessive dry humping and making out but as long as their happy i don’t see how any of its an issue😂😂😂 but ya funny asffffffff for this", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:28:53", "owner": "zoeerossse", "likes": 146}, {"id": 17997538652835487, "text": "@haleyybaylee so I was behind this one couple in the ride queue. And the man was with his mother and gf. He was kissing his gf every 2 mins! Itv got so out of hand, THAT HIS MOM SLAPPED HIM ON THE HEAD!! 🤣🤣🤣\n\nMy friend and I were like “thank God!” 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-10T16:12:44", "owner": "realmaryamrahman", "likes": 578}, {"id": 18144549811429710, "text": "The Lorax looks different here", "created_at": "2025-11-10T14:45:21", "owner": "thatonegirl1767", "likes": 1070}, {"id": 18065694311152156, "text": "I just feel bad for anyone waiting 2 hours to ride Mine-Cart Madness, that coaster kinda sucks.", "created_at": "2025-12-02T02:28:09", "owner": "bryan_with_the_beard", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17866688370481021, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-10T20:29:36", "owner": "redwifeyrosie", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17932454163137352, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-07T12:02:51", "owner": "pantherawrneo", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17903188569161477, "text": "Then you gotta act like it’s too much but deep down you’re like “hey what did i do wrong with my ex, could be us”", "created_at": "2025-12-04T07:36:43", "owner": "camtajoiee", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18099019963697185, "text": "Me because physicsl touch yesss", "created_at": "2025-12-07T16:50:22", "owner": "kouhai.cos", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18078693827274974, "text": "I'm all for showing affection to your partner in public, but it legit gets to a point. ESPECIALLY if you're at or in a place/area that has children.", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:05:12", "owner": "rumii_kuu", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18102750985708479, "text": "@ash.tr.ay", "created_at": "2025-12-08T13:19:53", "owner": "microwavedicecream_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134234155474645, "text": "And they always look 14", "created_at": "2025-11-10T22:18:26", "owner": "andrea.s_adventures", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17899896354317603, "text": "Always the teenage one", "created_at": "2025-11-10T23:23:44", "owner": "bilious.me", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18041345387708280, "text": "@valevalrt 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-14T22:13:49", "owner": "felipe.rivelles", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17875943655435352, "text": "It’s so embarrassing 🥲", "created_at": "2025-11-10T14:43:20", "owner": "rubymatthews990", "likes": 207}, {"id": 18070246031455868, "text": "@pa8trisha nosotres", "created_at": "2025-12-08T20:29:17", "owner": "nemterest", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085616432051737, "text": "there were in their CRINGE mode😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-12T00:56:58", "owner": "monsieurkiann", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17918210583194463, "text": "Nooooooo the final pose is so cringe. Get a room!!", "created_at": "2025-11-11T00:00:49", "owner": "sandy_heim", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18100936069775234, "text": "Why do gay guys get looked at for even just holding hands when couples are Fr like this ;-;", "created_at": "2025-12-03T17:50:21", "owner": "raynomat99", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17991576674850873, "text": "Social anxiety found hiding in corner", "created_at": "2025-11-11T02:13:10", "owner": "chaemonduh", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18084925625490597, "text": "Ima do all of these and make you lonely people feel lonelier", "created_at": "2025-12-08T02:45:48", "owner": "hectorizzle", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085306387993682, "text": "GUILTY 🙂", "created_at": "2025-11-10T14:53:40", "owner": "fedoua_gil", "likes": 556}, {"id": 18021897320786232, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-10T14:56:59", "owner": "_ocea3n", "likes": 489}, {"id": 18102706897639941, "text": "Honestly they’d be doing it if they could lmao", "created_at": "2025-11-10T20:50:40", "owner": "stinky_yellow_triangle", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17900411790182619, "text": "absolutely no self control. front on butt action in front of the kids.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T15:55:42", "owner": "thee.bagel", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084068474496219, "text": "만국공통", "created_at": "2025-11-13T13:36:07", "owner": "imdangerousgirl_", "likes": 123}, {"id": 18050534810667608, "text": "Guilty 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-10T15:17:05", "owner": "nicmarievee", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17850868329583473, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-10T18:45:05", "owner": "codingmermaid.ai", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17943248994079103, "text": "ooops", "created_at": "2025-11-12T09:11:23", "owner": "dianeadinh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17935192044106492, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T19:02:03", "owner": "durusainz55", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17961980301005002, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-11T06:13:15", "owner": "jimenamuchsel", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17944035114073509, "text": "LAST SLIDE IS DIABOLICAL AT DISNEYLAND 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T05:01:02", "owner": "dohngnzls__", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18084220745032365, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:39:44", "owner": "kelvia.sousza", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087887143800727, "text": "Involuntary 3rd wheel", "created_at": "2025-12-04T08:44:45", "owner": "alexis.phamvn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18033205028725676, "text": "Real love baby", "created_at": "2025-11-11T01:07:58", "owner": "briallis", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18087980779766336, "text": "they cheat and then show their love in public place. around all singles. 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-10T15:41:13", "owner": "_jjj_71", "likes": 636}, {"id": 18533080768009963, "text": "The Nightmare Before Christmas is their entire personality", "created_at": "2025-11-10T21:21:45", "owner": "lemtorch", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18114528721574409, "text": "kalian bgt vibes nya @ceo_toyota @ccarrottme_", "created_at": "2025-12-04T04:12:30", "owner": "loveelirna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095852926841596, "text": "yes i stand infront of them in close proximity, waiting for them to remove their loose items 🙂", "created_at": "2025-11-13T15:56:17", "owner": "marie_the_human", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18045636104460239, "text": "Spot on 😂 move forward please", "created_at": "2025-11-11T01:31:36", "owner": "theskinassociate", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18109535479610490, "text": "the one lifting her 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-10T21:32:45", "owner": "__gypsylife__", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18078293606164570, "text": "They're just showing us what we'll never have (they will last for 3-4 week more and then done)", "created_at": "2025-11-10T22:02:08", "owner": "aangelvj_05", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18085955230969172, "text": "So true😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-10T23:01:56", "owner": "shipchiefff", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17915007765209080, "text": "So like 2 coke cans???", "created_at": "2025-11-10T22:59:23", "owner": "jensy.de.leon", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18082157387029165, "text": "then they start fighting and standing distanced so you gotta wait even longer", "created_at": "2025-11-11T19:46:22", "owner": "iluv_andie", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18104226625646923, "text": "make this stop", "created_at": "2025-11-11T05:54:04", "owner": "bilskyforlife", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17851129716585578, "text": "Looking like Jack and Rose and their relationship is the piece of wood holding Rose up😂", "created_at": "2025-11-11T06:43:09", "owner": "rainxsuarez", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17927547504018355, "text": "I feel like I shouldn’t be here", "created_at": "2025-11-10T16:46:01", "owner": "sarahelisejewelry", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18539934424045401, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-10T14:54:36", "owner": "_m.samiii", "likes": 233}, {"id": 18349866445166643, "text": "HAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAH LITERALLY IN LOTTE WORLD", "created_at": "2025-11-17T09:45:11", "owner": "bloomiraa", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18031665311720830, "text": "Oop, I do kind of like hug a lot in a line. I just like physical contact… but not like crazy poses or smth, just hugging or me sitting on the rain cause I have weak knees… 😭😭😭 sorryyyyy", "created_at": "2025-11-11T20:55:58", "owner": "ade._.lien", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18145443799436405, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-10T18:29:07", "owner": "yrsaclicks", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18103367089643388, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-10T23:20:30", "owner": "emersoneleanamcwhinney", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078775937152302, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-10T20:44:01", "owner": "samanthajaymes_", "likes": 20}, {"id": 18030704327539292, "text": "@hermesstolemywig 😂😂😂😂the second hand embarrassment was very real !", "created_at": "2025-11-22T05:21:22", "owner": "amyy_jyo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978379830944345, "text": "@ginebraariass