she's cooked 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T09:22:41", "owner": "xanny_paciao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096867001803960, "text": "\"the damage\".......", "created_at": "2025-12-10T09:20:34", "owner": "dandisastro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021496772611727, "text": "Why, what has happened?\nA service is being provided, no harm to any one.\nProbably saved someone from being assaulted or something more serious.", "created_at": "2025-12-10T09:18:28", "owner": "simpson.fraser", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928368100159973, "text": "📌 Key Details\nName: Bonnie Blue (real name: Tia Billinger) \nIncident Location: Bali, Indonesia (region: Badung/Pererenan) \nDate of Arrest: Around 5 December 2025 — raid and detention occurred early December 2025. \nAlleged Crime: Producing/distributing pornographic content (adult-content shoot during her “BangBus” tour), violating Indonesian anti-pornography & morality laws. \nContext: The arrest followed a raid on a rented villa/studio after public complaints. The tour allegedly involved a group of male tourists invited for what was promoted as adult-content gatherings. \n---\n🔎 What’s Happening Now\nAuthorities confiscated filming equipment, condoms, sexual-enhancement pills, USB drives, and the branded “BangBus” vehicle during the raid. \nThe group detained: 18 foreign nationals in total (Blue + 17 men), male tourists aged 19–40 (Australians & Brits). Most — including 14 Australians — have since been released without charge. \nBlue remains under investigation. Her passport has been seized; she’s been referred to immigration authorities pending further action. \nIf convicted under Indonesian law, she faces up to 15 years in prison and a fine of up to 6 billion rupiah (~ €300–540 k). \nSome legal experts believe deportation is the more probable outcome — authorities might avoid a high-profile trial. \n---\n⚠️ Why It Matters — What You Should Know\nIndonesia enforces strict laws banning the production, distribution, or public display of pornographic materials. Foreign nationals engaging in such activities risk severe legal consequences. \n“Tourism + adult content + lax visa status + moral-law environment” ≠ safe combination. High-visibility adult entertainers must assess local laws thoroughly before traveling.\nFor content-creators or promoters: this case demonstrates significant risk when local norms or laws contradict one’s regular practice — a cautionary tale for global operations", "created_at": "2025-12-10T09:08:43", "owner": "wardan7_official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094525744901466, "text": "Disgusting biatch", "created_at": "2025-12-10T09:08:17", "owner": "carneirobenjamim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972153999977424, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T09:03:46", "owner": "hares_hrafukia777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110557534539037, "text": "Stone her in public. That vile white trash.", "created_at": "2025-12-10T09:02:34", "owner": "sabinarb16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18401785066121011, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-10T09:00:15", "owner": "gemoroda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976428387952194, "text": "Dajjal !!!", "created_at": "2025-12-10T08:59:35", "owner": "guruh_himawan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987212031912909, "text": "She gonna burn in hill 🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-10T08:54:52", "owner": "borntofight79", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18307126243268304, "text": "No brain power at all in that girl", "created_at": "2025-12-10T08:54:46", "owner": "gary_071629", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080333680933806, "text": "Exe-cute her", "created_at": "2025-12-10T08:53:15", "owner": "crystal.ffmax", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18328317388209997, "text": "1 finally. Amazing. Thank you. I am sure she will be able to finish her project in prison.  2. I dont think its suzch a criminal thing she did as she didnt force anyone ao you are kind of exagerating", "created_at": "2025-12-10T08:53:07", "owner": "gemoroda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923895130049403, "text": "Inmates like this 👍🏼 ... 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-10T08:50:31", "owner": "__