{"media_id": 3769530044658842044, "shortcode": "DRQD5qSDXm8", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRQD5qSDXm8/", "taken_at": "2025-11-19T20:14:44", "caption": "One second we were peacefully admiring the mountains… and then my dog stopped cold and locked his eyes on something in the distance.\nHis whole body stiffened. Tail straight. Ears up.\nYou know that look dogs get when they sense something we can’t? Yeah. That one.\n\nMy stomach DROPPED.\nI grabbed the leash, ready to sprint, throw hands, or meet my destiny right there on the trail.\nI swear even the wind went silent.\nFor a whole two seconds, I thought we were about to be on the news.\n\nAnd then… he sneezed.\nA full-body, dramatic, allergy-season sneeze.\n\nCalm down, I’m joking.\nNothing happened.\nIt was literally the most peaceful walk ever. 🫸🏼🫷🏻🤟🏻 \n\nBut since you have already read it up to this point, how about you drop me a message with something coooool that made you happy/smile today?", "owner_username": "michalittlerunaway", "owner_id": "2864920499", "likes": 22389, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0011_DRQD5qSDXm8\\DRQD5qSDXm8_20251119_201444.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18120434677474242, "text": "The tan pants really caught me off guard 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-22T02:18:33", "owner": "mountainjuniper", "likes": 4191}, {"id": 18545160031025352, "text": "I legit thought you were not wearing pants and those were some snazzy knee socks 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:40:25", "owner": "hayley_erica", "likes": 1635}, {"id": 18111514639594054, "text": "Everything was going fine until this happened … a park ranger came up the trail and said “Ma’am, why aren’t you wearing any pants?”", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:08:41", "owner": "trippingthrutheusa", "likes": 459}, {"id": 17868869745494000, "text": "🔥👌😻", "created_at": "2025-12-07T16:36:30", "owner": "mondi___001", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18099631345759001, "text": "Uhh those pants are really confusin