428047460194, "text": "Nice", "created_at": "2025-11-25T08:17:19", "owner": "sharwanram3820", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17867557527496177, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-25T02:11:01", "owner": "zyad15198", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18094189243851186, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-24T19:03:28", "owner": "zemauto7827", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18109539829610751, "text": "I was so somewhere else... sorry...", "created_at": "2025-11-24T14:43:55", "owner": "nico_be98", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17988416174909190, "text": "🌹🌹🌹❤️🌹🌹🌹", "created_at": "2025-11-24T10:03:12", "owner": "macdrive97", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17865431433505443, "text": "Amazing 😍👏", "created_at": "2025-11-24T03:25:59", "owner": "nohar.sahu7", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18116642989561038, "text": "😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-23T08:58:42", "owner": "rebel_78_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17871974463462090, "text": "👀", "created_at": "2025-11-23T00:55:53", "owner": "theberneseorg", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17980722941776296, "text": "😂 I like the throwing hands part. NiCE DOG", "created_at": "2025-11-22T23:47:19", "owner": "shreddninja", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077438908958823, "text": "She is wearing tights btw 🤔 i know some people thought she was nude", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:50:14", "owner": "x.sp1ky98", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063808346618357, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:54:00", "owner": "ondo._.wood", "likes": 48}, {"id": 18388815040177443, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:48:14", "owner": "chloeycallaghan_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061685141212873, "text": "Ma’am I thought y’all were about to meet Sasquatch", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:55:37", "owner": "winonawarmsips", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18517080655066651, "text": "My wife, she always makes me smile, she is the coolest person ever ❤️ her insta is @andreawalderhaug", "created_at": "2025-11-21T18:20:50", "owner": "oleandthebeasts", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18145594477436866, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-21T05:56:50", "owner": "brahim.zaydi.56", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18135135907466171, "text": "❤️❤️😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-20T19:18:15", "owner": "gojo__hanzo82", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18134350462469288, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T12:33:49", "owner": "cavagnolofausto", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087619336791572, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-11-20T10:32:18", "owner": "vita.marecek", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17941123662094485, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-20T06:50:44", "owner": "fpvnomad_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17844758853613772, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-20T06:41:22", "owner": "yuri.club_haouzia", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17869166412470936, "text": "😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-20T06:31:07", "owner": "ruyjorge80", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18108524956621618, "text": "send me this post", "created_at": "2025-11-20T06:02:58", "owner": "italy__magazine", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18313954123223517, "text": "So pretty ❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-20T05:50:01", "owner": "priyesh0607", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18111315232587723, "text": "Sooooo he didn’t sneeze? lol", "created_at": "2025-11-20T02:54:42", "owner": "xhalloqueenx", "likes": 12}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3736892634305194231, "shortcode": "DPcHA1PiOj3", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DPcHA1PiOj3/", "taken_at": "2025-10-05T19:32:58", "caption": "It’s been 7 weeks since I dropped him off! OMG! \n\nThe cleaning supplies I bought him were all in their packaging🤦‍♀️\n\n#college #collegelife #momsofinstagram #funnymom #momhumor #momjokes #mommemes", "owner_username": "hannahbfisher", "owner_id": "25347587", "likes": 29145, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0012_DPcHA1PiOj3\\DPcHA1PiOj3_20251005_193258.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18079608818316086, "text": "Dont do this! You are only raising the next dependent man who makes his wife's life a burden.", "created_at": "2025-10-10T12:36:34", "owner": "misshatschiputschi", "likes": 31414}, {"id": 18069931244520061, "text": "Is your son a toddler?", "created_at": "2025-10-11T12:30:00", "owner": "_k4t4r1n4_5t_", "likes": 17069}, {"id": 17961676670999589, "text": "MAKE HIM CLEAN.", "created_at": "2025-10-21T10:04:29", "owner": "carelle_dck", "likes": 7567}, {"id": 18171665479362511, "text": "I would probably do the same 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-05T22:49:40", "owner": "hey.heather.ray", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18056690792215436, "text": "He can clean his own damn toilet.", "created_at": "2025-10-10T22:58:18", "owner": "wsueslingerland", "likes": 7270}, {"id": 18328234918238119, "text": "Next generation of man child", "created_at": "2025-10-16T05:12:13", "owner": "mariemarty_25", "likes": 7162}, {"id": 17876238102438699, "text": "his poor future wife.", "created_at": "2025-11-13T19:21:46", "owner": "e.laurac", "likes": 31}, {"id": 18074232917186609, "text": "He doesn’t do it because you never taught him.", "created_at": "2025-10-20T01:24:21", "owner": "mvr1912", "likes": 358}, {"id": 18075766274133543, "text": "His future wife is going to thank you 😂😂😂😂 not", "created_at": "2025-10-10T18:20:31", "owner": "leblanccoffee_", "likes": 3518}, {"id": 17845658163586640, "text": "My sons will be taught the importance of a clean environment and how to maintain one starting from the time they can see their surroundings- they have no choice. These things will be second nature to them- that is my job. If I find my sons choosing to live in any kind of filth I will have failed as a mother.", "created_at": "2025-11-06T04:13:07", "owner": "kcpklenk", "likes": 9}, {"id": 17998658117820781, "text": "I wouldn't be cleaning anything.", "created_at": "2025-10-09T23:27:26", "owner": "trace7678", "likes": 10739}, {"id": 18404489242186292, "text": "Yall are the issue. Make him do it. this is how they end up with two failed marriages.", "created_at": "2025-11-08T21:24:12", "owner": "wenddylu", "likes": 10}, {"id": 17958149003859060, "text": "STOP. PUT DOWN THE MOP. Your kid needs to learn how to take care of himself.", "created_at": "2025-10-11T02:15:36", "owner": "urban_ophelia", "likes": 3556}, {"id": 17876624217422388, "text": "It's because you keep doing this shit for him that he can't clean for himself. Stop", "created_at": "2025-10-17T17:36:51", "owner": "muriella_m", "likes": 652}, {"id": 17879700648412299, "text": "A grown man btw...", "created_at": "2025-10-23T11:31:15", "owner": "_sofia._.2009_", "likes": 507}, {"id": 18535202374047146, "text": "Why the hell are you cleaning? This is why so many young women are saying they are raising their boyfriends because they don't even know how to take care of themselves", "created_at": "2025-10-10T18:47:17", "owner": "susiemcusie", "likes": 3807}, {"id": 18140301310433054, "text": "Oof thanks mom your future daughter in law is sure to be thankful you’ve raised a man-baby.", "created_at": "2025-10-10T23:17:18", "owner": "kellz_bellz99", "likes": 606}, {"id": 18358760173088358, "text": "So your babying a grown man? Got it , no wonder men think this is women’s work if you do it all for them !", "created_at": "2025-10-11T12:08:37", "owner": "ecohome.17", "likes": 1311}, {"id": 17938599696095757, "text": "maybe you should teach him to do it himself? does he understand how to?", "created_at": "2025-11-04T03:41:14", "owner": "pippalottadejong", "likes": 22}, {"id": 18073733909182335, "text": "The fact that she did this, recorded it, edited it, played it and still decided to upload it... Its WILD", "created_at": "2025-10-21T03:41:11", "owner": "perdosdomo", "likes": 137}, {"id": 17927076234134163, "text": "L", "created_at": "2025-10-17T13:41:38", "owner": "kaauroo", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18190062196339695, "text": "How can men live like this 😩", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:07:41", "owner": "mykenzieocampo", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17920479222173845, "text": "My son’s school distributed cleaning kits to help students prepare for family weekend.", "created_at": "2025-10-09T13:51:35", "owner": "gfreegenius", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18075262289268768, "text": "is your son an incompetent toddler?", "created_at": "2025-11-01T10:33:49", "owner": "angelina.starrr", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18079456619107799, "text": "Teach him how to clean 🤦🏻‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-11-04T20:25:20", "owner": "ashlen.bones", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18085428956285428, "text": "Girl this is embarrassing lol", "created_at": "2025-12-02T00:44:05", "owner": "nsauerwein204", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18242890084294130, "text": "Let's normalize teaching out sons how to clean at a young age too", "created_at": "2025-10-31T08:01:01", "owner": "tlouem420", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18333982657236048, "text": "This is why my 36 year old husband doesn't clean up after himself unless I nag him.  Its ok to help your kids out but stop enabling them please.", "created_at": "2025-11-03T18:02:36", "owner": "tlkbutler", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18144540067433627, "text": "She will probably have videos in the future gossiping about her sons wife if he ever gets married", "created_at": "2025-11-04T00:47:43", "owner": "sophiegbh", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18083697673817630, "text": "This says more about you than it does him", "created_at": "2025-10-27T12:27:19", "owner": "allissacrosse", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18137498047454050, "text": "Nah i would make my son learn to clean behind himself b4 i even teach him alphabets, i wont want him to live disgustingly", "created_at": "2025-11-04T23:20:01", "owner": "luvvmayn_", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18087284281955287, "text": "We Indian kids at college do it all by ourselves. Was this video a joke or is it real. Well, I am surprised. He is not a school kid ryt? It's college right😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:33:31", "owner": "anth_onio__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18358166332089474, "text": "i hired a housekeeper to come in to my sons dorm once a week 😊", "created_at": "2025-10-11T23:15:43", "owner": "oberman05", "likes": 499}, {"id": 18048957251415080, "text": "I lived with 4 other guys in a house in college and they nicknamed me mom, cause I was always cleaning and telling others wha needed cleaning 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-05T23:58:32", "owner": "jos1990ss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072177953520113, "text": "I would say because your parents are visiting, make sure your place is spotless and get a coffee maker and ensure you can make your parents a coffee and practice hospitality. Practice gratitude since we are paying, show us your report cards, and make us a coffee THEN we will have a good time. Business and manners first.", "created_at": "2025-11-04T09:13:12", "owner": "female4720", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18060361274628287, "text": "Get him to do it and supervise took my mother a while to get my brother doing these things himself she still goes to help him tidy or clean but doesn't do it all.", "created_at": "2025-11-06T15:48:28", "owner": "akei2good", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18073421912242800, "text": "Maybe raise them right Hannah instead", "created_at": "2025-11-03T18:41:20", "owner": "marcusmeon247", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18131017276484973, "text": "Yikes", "created_at": "2025-11-11T14:15:42", "owner": "danakrobinsonn", "likes": 10}, {"id": 17902529889269831, "text": "Oh my gosh I would do the same 😂 I know that was so good to see him", "created_at": "2025-10-05T20:24:56", "owner": "wimberleyearp", "likes": 30}, {"id": 18089611630884849, "text": "I rebuke this lol 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-16T20:50:11", "owner": "ecoscleans", "likes": 20}, {"id": 18329222866208145, "text": "Adult man btw", "created_at": "2025-11-09T14:23:37", "owner": "nerdsandart", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18324341488240191, "text": "I see my future 😂😂amazing mama ❤️💕💕👏", "created_at": "2025-10-07T10:16:32", "owner": "ck1morris122", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18052543250317261, "text": "When I was a freshman in college my mom used to pick up my dirty laundry and bring it back all washed and nicely folded 😹 such a spoiled 18 year old.", "created_at": "2025-10-11T16:14:11", "owner": "rendaugherty", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17956722224881955, "text": "I’m raising my son to know and enjoy cleaning cuz this isn’t acceptable", "created_at": "2025-11-10T17:13:00", "owner": "celesteadelexo", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18085621874067478, "text": "Yup. Because he knows you will do it. STOP.", "created_at": "2025-11-12T23:02:30", "owner": "willow_whisp_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18096197695757744, "text": "Why are you taking over and not teaching him to be a fully functional adult?", "created_at": "2025-10-21T03:36:01", "owner": "missdanisanna", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18077551492908687, "text": "You are raising a manchild", "created_at": "2025-11-04T23:46:29", "owner": "m._victoria.06", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18089415445738386, "text": "Make your grown ass son clean it himself.", "created_at": "2025-11-13T16:47:39", "owner": "emetayer95", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18059804123445053, "text": "Actual video of ME in my son’s dorm room 3 weeks ago, parents weekend!!! I tried to resist, I really did, but I just had to!!!", "created_at": "2025-10-11T00:58:44", "owner": "emily.r.wilhite", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18411391348143998, "text": "Teach him", "created_at": "2025-11-10T00:49:20", "owner": "only_anah_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18083228128824013, "text": "That is so embarrassing", "created_at": "2025-10-21T05:56:19", "owner": "hxgngle_", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18114800929563865, "text": "Noooppeeee!!", "created_at": "2025-11-13T16:38:42", "owner": "ilovemyairfryer_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17848335681566070, "text": "So you don’t let him grow up. Got it.", "created_at": "2025-11-10T23:53:58", "owner": "jocmc_02", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072629507191832, "text": "Teach him how, not do it for him.", "created_at": "2025-11-10T05:34:56", "owner": "97ajf", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18047405219392718, "text": "These comments are NOT it", "created_at": "2025-11-06T19:51:45", "owner": "gabetitensky", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18058184180230647, "text": "alexa play manchild by sabrina carpenter", "created_at": "2025-10-21T01:55:10", "owner": "anjaniinajma", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18207539278313686, "text": "You hand him the tools and watch the work", "created_at": "2025-11-07T02:09:48", "owner": "rfj_32", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17896264437343872, "text": "Cmon you gotta let him clean", "created_at": "2025-11-08T12:34:29", "owner": "_jeonghaniyoo_nn", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18112821628560500, "text": "Girl…. You should be teaching him to clean after himself", "created_at": "2025-10-17T06:17:11", "owner": "tatumnorris937", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18076754186160925, "text": "Sorry, but no. This is wrong in so many aspects, girl", "created_at": "2025-10-22T06:40:16", "owner": "madlene_0111", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18078482900279316, "text": "Eeeeeew, no, you're gonna clean every space he's gonna live in? Srsly?", "created_at": "2025-10-23T06:32:04", "owner": "_alex_vorc_", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18121636807518367, "text": "why r u cleaning your precious darling’s shitter?", "created_at": "2025-11-05T00:20:01", "owner": "stevehowell500", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18342573658204191, "text": "I don’t know what I’d do. Haven’t had this experience with a daughter in college… won’t judge as I’ll have a son in that season in a decade from now. I’m going to start preparing him now 😂😂😂 thanks for sharing", "created_at": "2025-10-10T00:46:39", "owner": "hellonannydotcom", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17997952700829648, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-04T04:12:21", "owner": "miss_jenna22", "likes": 58}, {"id": 18047476733415580, "text": "Girl let HIM clean 😀", "created_at": "2025-11-06T17:45:14", "owner": "hodri.floress", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17988090917884931, "text": "Wow, so embarrassing.", "created_at": "2025-11-06T21:29:52", "owner": "parasomnia2x12", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085060924987490, "text": "This is why they don’t want to do it because we as moms do it for them. I’m not trying to shame her because I would be disturbed as a clean freak myself but at this point it’s not helping him and as many said if he gets a partner.", "created_at": "2025-11-04T23:33:45", "owner": "spencermatt7", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18093767920836022, "text": "This is NOT baddie nor boss behavior.", "created_at": "2025-11-04T02:05:48", "owner": "thtcrazyliberal", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18378036235196554, "text": "Or teach him to be a grown man that can take care of himself", "created_at": "2025-11-04T02:30:24", "owner": "adyingsymphony", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18129339892493027, "text": "Make him do it !!!", "created_at": "2025-11-04T06:04:57", "owner": "namiprado", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079680286888745, "text": "Give him the mop and supervise him doing it himself", "created_at": "2025-11-04T08:35:04", "owner": "gabardine0", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18057135032550289, "text": "As a mom of a boy, absolutely not. Teach him. Help Tidy, help restock, do not scrub his toilet.", "created_at": "2025-11-04T10:17:48", "owner": "khansenartworks", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18057901880632191, "text": "NO", "created_at": "2025-11-04T14:08:58", "owner": "thereal_yess", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082325021044270, "text": "Why would you enable him like this. Your raising a bad partner", "created_at": "2025-11-04T18:46:59", "owner": "stormy_blake", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17845539642585417, "text": "Why are you doing it", "created_at": "2025-11-04T23:34:27", "owner": "sk_.22_priv", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18133042282464669, "text": "and this where it starts yall smh", "created_at": "2025-11-05T02:04:43", "owner": "kashlocs1", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17943777369066171, "text": "That’s actually disgusting….do he not know how to clean..", "created_at": "2025-11-05T08:43:50", "owner": "privateee.enegry2.0_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17871141159450060, "text": "Can you…. Stop? You’re creating another man baby who expects a woman he’s dating to mother him and baby him.", "created_at": "2025-10-23T12:47:14", "owner": "lexi.wellss", "likes": 62}, {"id": 18072082136264498, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-05T02:13:25", "owner": "mehxrineehh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17927310495118006, "text": "the swiffer isn’t a real mop and i’m tired of people pretending like it is.", "created_at": "2025-11-04T19:04:24", "owner": "keelay.png", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18077844355885739, "text": "Another woman raising a manchild 😍", "created_at": "2025-10-21T18:51:11", "owner": "anna_crlnsouza", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18085046984481081, "text": "Babying a grown man lmaoooo", "created_at": "2025-10-22T04:11:42", "owner": "_asbtt", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18091472257832222, "text": "Oh nooo! I would be doing the same thing!", "created_at": "2025-10-06T18:40:41", "owner": "simpleandsweetblog", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17909872014250407, "text": "As a boy mom-yes", "created_at": "2025-10-30T22:54:17", "owner": "laraestewart10", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17860838649531493, "text": "Yep! That's about right!!", "created_at": "2025-10-30T23:47:59", "owner": "dawnmarie_sully", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084503021075803, "text": "the best mama award goes to you girl lol", "created_at": "2025-10-31T00:49:14", "owner": "taylor.hydrick", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17844224385594978, "text": "Hell naw", "created_at": "2025-10-28T11:53:36", "owner": "bii_ancaaaxx", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17953593698913851, "text": "And you would probably be appalled if it was your daughter.", "created_at": "2025-12-20T03:13:33", "owner": "maysallyspeak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843862948637306, "text": "Bad mom", "created_at": "2025-12-19T23:22:38", "owner": "hank232004", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18204716083320465, "text": "\"And post!\" 🥀🥀🥀", "created_at": "2025-12-19T17:03:35", "owner": "eshal_and420_others", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115156339583191, "text": "Failed mother", "created_at": "2025-12-19T13:49:19", "owner": "slk0_55", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987571458755903, "text": "Tbh nothing wrong why women crying in the comments his mom her problem", "created_at": "2025-12-19T09:43:28", "owner": "pakistanimegatron", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148357255435779, "text": "😍😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T15:10:47", "owner": "ericathetreelady", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968095860989617, "text": "Parents weekend??? Tf is that😭", "created_at": "2025-12-18T02:15:14", "owner": "05_tris", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18191051473339384, "text": "Why would you film this and put it online. I don’t get all these over exposing videos.", "created_at": "2025-12-16T21:43:45", "owner": "asliceofmylifeagk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076929748992771, "text": "So your son is straight up nasty", "created_at": "2025-12-16T19:46:47", "owner": "the_bburmaster", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950570548061782, "text": "Take off that sandal and beat the child until the room is clean.", "created_at": "2025-12-16T01:34:07", "owner": "tuscaloser", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916351891249501, "text": "Didn’t know UPS issued a dress for broads to wear!", "created_at": "2025-12-16T01:16:13", "owner": "jasonschwan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068481560128221, "text": "This is wrong. Let him live with the consequences so he can learn", "created_at": "2025-12-15T23:51:57", "owner": "sofiabel15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059467541288112, "text": "this is entirely your fault. what were you doing for the first 18 years of his life ? enabling him ? teaching him how to make every woman he meets miserable ?", "created_at": "2025-12-15T02:58:30", "owner": "avamariefh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867090217526561, "text": "Absolutely No.", "created_at": "2025-12-14T22:02:08", "owner": "chi.neloo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077861771267546, "text": "You're going to lose your parents one day. These are the moments we look back on, why not let this person enjoy having his mom in his life and stop being so judgemental because the if the roles would were reversed everyone would be saying awe how sweet. It's not even that big of a mess so it's clear he was trying the best he could to maintain it. I miss my mommy I need these memories or I might as well jump off a bridge 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-14T21:57:27", "owner": "x.yurlocal.artz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960971329009282, "text": "this is why he’ll stay single btw", "created_at": "2025-12-14T13:27:34", "owner": "nataliadillon.06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060246650271857, "text": "That's disgusting", "created_at": "2025-12-14T12:09:19", "owner": "skinless419", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18500727409076865, "text": "Wow all these commenters are so harsh. I have a son in college that I visit his apartment maybe twice a year, and yes I help him deep clean, and I teach him how I do it and he helps me. Girls get just as gross sometimes too. It’s ok to do something nice for your college kids who are learning how to live in their own, support themselves, live with others, and all the daily new decisions they have to make while studying, working and planning for their future. A little help tidying their dorm or apartment is soo appreciated and reminds them that they still have someone who will help them out when adulting gets hard. My mom still helps me do laundry or keep my kitchen clean when she comes to visit. It’s not because I can’t, it’s a service she wants to do for her daughter who doesn’t need much from her anymore . ❤️keep showing your adult kids love and care however and wherever you can.", "created_at": "2025-12-14T08:44:29", "owner": "dressedwithasmile_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884547226416632, "text": "You didn't train him when he was younger", "created_at": "2025-12-13T11:04:40", "owner": "simon.aquatic101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878021377354607, "text": "I’m sorry this a mom being a mom y’all acting like she comes up there everyday to help him clean be fr 😂😂✌🏼", "created_at": "2025-12-13T06:03:31", "owner": "h.a.i.l.e.e4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861969061549947, "text": "This is your fault.", "created_at": "2025-12-12T07:33:38", "owner": "asibongengema", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905983900289206, "text": "😂 just go to hotel let him live like a animal", "created_at": "2025-12-11T23:58:08", "owner": "tourdegaston", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026608916784511, "text": "Chose the least dirty looking room ever to this in btw 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-11T23:04:26", "owner": "d0ug1efr3sh999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870707836473100, "text": "If that's how you raising your son no wonder we have male loneliness epidemic", "created_at": "2025-12-11T19:37:11", "owner": "jilsephonie15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544284976011724, "text": "Grown man 🤡", "created_at": "2025-12-11T19:36:30", "owner": "jilsephonie15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18548895679038552, "text": "Bunch of man hating women in these comments", "created_at": "2025-12-11T17:04:56", "owner": "dillonmann1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18307362280248860, "text": "The way the mom in me wants to snatch him by the collar and make him clean it", "created_at": "2025-12-11T06:28:38", "owner": "la.reina.fantasma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090090676940513, "text": "Let him be a pig if that's how he wants to live", "created_at": "2025-12-10T19:57:34", "owner": "guffbluff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058433015309811, "text": "Nasty ass", "created_at": "2025-12-10T19:08:49", "owner": "smmglord", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049812443418621, "text": "His partner is gonna love dealing with this later in life", "created_at": "2025-12-10T15:54:32", "owner": "kiera_the_model", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842535880645050, "text": "Are we deadass.?", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:03:30", "owner": "nope_._elio_rope", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088475551948291, "text": "Ew", "created_at": "2025-12-09T07:22:48", "owner": "nidhi10._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084978467020920, "text": "I wouldn’t be surprised if this woman is a single mom. Idk her but mostly sm tend to raise their children this way.", "created_at": "2025-12-08T20:15:09", "owner": "mulandree", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091631764934838, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T12:29:48", "owner": "k_p903", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18367995010090944, "text": "Don't do that. If you do he won't learn", "created_at": "2025-12-07T22:31:21", "owner": "em.il7234", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866596768509868, "text": "gang if your over 18 n ur room is like this say goodbye", "created_at": "2025-12-07T18:20:58", "owner": "idekmanlul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861521821545465, "text": "Girl what! Make him do it!", "created_at": "2025-12-07T17:52:54", "owner": "lexcova", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18353746483201958, "text": "I moved out at 21 in my own apartment nearly 16 years ago and my apt was spotless. Every week I would clean it. Im nearly 37 now, married with kids and every Thursday is my cleaning day. You need to instill these type of habits in your children. Im doing it now with mine so they aren't dirty when they get older.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T23:41:33", "owner": "deathbyphiw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842181496645755, "text": "Erm no? Tell him to fucking clean his bathroom like an adult? And tell him if it ain’t done then he better be ready to start learning cause privileges are gonna fo", "created_at": "2025-12-06T19:49:58", "owner": "rosy_mivida", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859756273556670, "text": "Raise your children better and maybe you'll not feel the need to do this", "created_at": "2025-12-06T12:59:21", "owner": "tlnb420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081273272147495, "text": "everything i do is dirty to my larents. like tfdym it's dirty? i just scrubbed the toilet with premium toilet cleaner. although part of the reason of me cleaning is to stop my mum from snooping and finding my cigarette stash. but if i didn't know any better, I'd say mums just want any excuse for cleaning because they're bored of old age. every single woman in the comments is an old hag, even if they're young, they're an old hag in their soul.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T10:43:03", "owner": "chimera.13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106567216568885, "text": "THIS is why his dorm is like this. All on you!", "created_at": "2025-12-06T06:17:20", "owner": "jintulgaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939327205067912, "text": "Girl what", "created_at": "2025-12-06T06:09:43", "owner": "saraaaa____39", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025768907784938, "text": "The ladies that have been sleeping over don’t mind", "created_at": "2025-12-05T20:32:03", "owner": "olowniuk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066991928424763, "text": "Teach him!", "created_at": "2025-12-05T20:28:58", "owner": "i13koon33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947763628063563, "text": "Bruh cleaning his place for his is crazy shit btw 😭✌️", "created_at": "2025-12-05T17:05:52", "owner": "donaldkitzel_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026691905772879, "text": "Wait till he joins a frat 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T16:35:51", "owner": "nwoodruff_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991187502896876, "text": "Boy moms.", "created_at": "2025-12-05T15:15:35", "owner": "gffffffffffuuukkkn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093589615911524, "text": "This is called enabling", "created_at": "2025-12-05T14:41:07", "owner": "butteredbread419", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105638386651625, "text": "Damn momma thick and rich haha", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:29:48", "owner": "jeffery602928", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045302213699998, "text": "In package expiration expired but still efficient 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:17:48", "owner": "_77jr77_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948641761072191, "text": "teach him to clean?? ive had male roommates literally tell me they never learned how to clean bc mom always did it for them and then proceeded to be a not cleanly roommate", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:49:24", "owner": "iloveangelmusic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049164590429556, "text": "🙂‍↔️🙂‍↔️", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:03:00", "owner": "raymond_m.l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088387168995090, "text": "My guess is your husband beats you when he returns home from work drunk", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:36:35", "owner": "ema_aviation_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18196207273334320, "text": "You doing this for him is why that nigga dirty.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T00:24:52", "owner": "therecanonlybeone19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054550499653643, "text": "Ew", "created_at": "2025-12-03T10:18:02", "owner": "elenasinclairbackup", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875809870446784, "text": "If you can’t visit without cleaning for him, you’re a bad mother.", "created_at": "2025-12-03T04:22:43", "owner": "alicat825", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055766159330475, "text": "I was never  a slob.  Just a bunch of mommas boys", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:17:43", "owner": "andypruzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977606727952385, "text": "Anything for my mum❤️🦅", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:17:35", "owner": "kizzymakky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18421003168118684, "text": "Dawg as a man what the fuck 😭 tell him to get his shit together lol", "created_at": "2025-12-02T05:37:47", "owner": "defnotftonfed", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18316438960219625, "text": "Maybe teach them how to clean", "created_at": "2025-12-01T22:36:49", "owner": "wherearethosetakis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048031820430414, "text": "I condemn mothers like this. This right here is the source of the incompetent manbaby epidemic.", "created_at": "2025-12-01T21:52:54", "owner": "mdyslv2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148167721442070, "text": "Certified a mamas boy", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:08:07", "owner": "dyiiiiiinggg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885009817407759, "text": "So your kids didn't clean your own home before leaving to collegue? What an useless kid. Useless for himself and useless to you. He is neither providing, not even for himself nor cleaning your house to show gratitude to  his parents", "created_at": "2025-12-01T14:43:12", "owner": "glo_selfloveadvocate", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096740461885079, "text": "Boys.  Teach them young.  Otherwise the grow up thinking that \"cleaning' i just swiping away the big chunks you can see.", "created_at": "2025-12-01T11:09:04", "owner": "lyndseydavis581", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084392933013043, "text": "Yikes", "created_at": "2025-12-01T03:24:29", "owner": "vann.m19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035832581520528, "text": "honey if you don’t go in there and smack him upside the head and tell him to go clean that toilet. acting like you didn’t raise him better than that.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:04:33", "owner": "summiwrld", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988706805901232, "text": "No no no make him do it", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:03:37", "owner": "prateeksinha.02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895811725359191, "text": "Yall obvi he cleans up after himself there wasant old food and that toilet would have been 5x more dirty if that place had not been cleaned 3+ months. Now if this was a mom helping a daughter comment would have been different.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T07:27:32", "owner": "lysaa_.p", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084305975034076, "text": "You're an enabler", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:35:13", "owner": "scarshayla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903024466317006, "text": "She looks like she is in college lol", "created_at": "2025-11-29T22:08:58", "owner": "rickery_dickery_dock", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084216263086266, "text": "And I wonder why young adults are equal to children now. Parents today, wipe their ass, clean their living quarters, give them all the food, give them money, clean up the dishes from the food from their rooms. Clean their dorm rooms. Take them shopping. You guys have no expectations of your kids. Even these young adults. It’s not the kids that are a mess, it’s the parents! Really think about it.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T19:31:28", "owner": "spiral8080", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109500709539043, "text": "You have an adult son and he needs his mummy to clean his room? Do better. He should have been raised to be able to take care of this himself. Another man child who will expect his wife to cater for him.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T18:45:32", "owner": "eat.peanut.butter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109529257540986, "text": "I am also a first year in college, I’ve always did my laundry, my own shi ever since I was 12, idk why this generation is so cooked, they be playing 24/7 games and shi, people who hit the gym aren’t like this, gym teaches you about respect and having your own back", "created_at": "2025-11-29T18:08:31", "owner": "estoymozz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106011940629560, "text": "Why would you even record and upload this video? You hate him so much?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T18:04:53", "owner": "username04w5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929727358148560, "text": "Miss your son is a red flag 🚩", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:31:51", "owner": "ssadianova", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18321037087301010, "text": "Embarrassing having to clean up after a grown ass man. Tell the dirty fucks to clean their own shit up", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:25:04", "owner": "vq.sean._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064589453575543, "text": "Half men in the comments make don’t even clean their hair and just acting like they clean all shi", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:02:34", "owner": "juranjias", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920842687198222, "text": "Fuck no", "created_at": "2025-11-29T13:57:28", "owner": "vanillamilkshakezs72", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18385196875176647, "text": "You do wrong??? Stop doing stupid boys mama shit??", "created_at": "2025-11-29T13:09:27", "owner": "zhyp_hr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047621417689982, "text": "Is he mentally okay?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:28:14", "owner": "navy_thunder", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969804069982356, "text": "Never thought of doing this. Just sat there eating his chocolates and watching the Telly!", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:55:15", "owner": "missjenny1953", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931254949133246, "text": "Um no", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:25:10", "owner": "laurgraceren", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105219391649691, "text": "Bragging about having incompetent & dirty grown children isn’t a flex. They knew you were visiting & felt no need to clean up. These are the women that are to blame for shitty spouses.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:35:04", "owner": "jsoknowso", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865995541508234, "text": "You are a failed mother", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:31:13", "owner": "alkanestoamps", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18518041072071737, "text": "😭😭🥹🥹🥹 I miss this.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:56:23", "owner": "sir_yash_king", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926939107174336, "text": "Oh! Let’s not!", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:59:14", "owner": "_vin.tea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18163117714385681, "text": "Some women do their own car repairs. I do and always have. I sure as hell would not be cleaning up after my full grown child who is now living on their own. My kid will know we clean before company arrives, no matter who is it.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:42:17", "owner": "inthisskinn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883106485416778, "text": "Really sad.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:16:49", "owner": "therealandyg_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059339780253716, "text": "So you never trained your son how to clean his space or take care of himself?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:02:52", "owner": "kat._.2005_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088728466763153, "text": "i always hate it when my mom comes to see me and starts reorganizing shit or vacuuming if she spots a single dust particle. let me take care of my own living space please for the love of god", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:17:57", "owner": "vilisiltamaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065971232421931, "text": "Thank you for taking care of your kid.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:08:43", "owner": "850love8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891317974242087, "text": "My mum would be slapping me up the back of my head if i asked her to clean my shit by age 9", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:06:02", "owner": "bad_wolf_boy_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855027646571467, "text": "😟", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:44:08", "owner": "misses.abi.m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18378136765146147, "text": "I have 7 sons. The only way I would do this for them as adults is if they were disabled, gone thru something tough and it was a temporary situation. Or if he and his wife or girlfriend just had a baby and they needed help around the house. I absolutely find it gross when women baby their grown ass sons. That's how you make a manchild who refuses to grow up and puts all his chores on his wife or girlfriend.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:26:51", "owner": "steamy_purple_coffee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18321297403170797, "text": "No. Full stop..he can do it himself. He's a grown man.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:24:45", "owner": "steamy_purple_coffee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064075103388951, "text": "Why are you being THE REASON?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T09:20:50", "owner": "vedankita._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102448750665995, "text": "Yep, he just knew perfectly well that those cleaning supplies could wait for you for a few weeks. ;>", "created_at": "2025-11-26T08:58:36", "owner": "orangeade1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925619476039114, "text": "Terrible advice", "created_at": "2025-11-26T01:49:30", "owner": "rose_hola_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978431115945880, "text": "Hey! 😀\nLet’s normalise NOT filming every damn thing for content.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:03:50", "owner": "katydiniz33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082545211868593, "text": "Disgusting id never date someone who can't clean", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:36:51", "owner": "ariaintdaone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902012773328493, "text": "You failed as a mother.", "created_a