tell him I said he’s never getting any bitches with a stank ass uncleaned toilet shape up", "created_at": "2025-11-18T17:57:37", "owner": "dusttodawn__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051096044667658, "text": "You didnt teach him to clean for HIMSELF?", "created_at": "2025-11-17T21:43:10", "owner": "jiimmyneutron3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113419777507788, "text": "can u at least show him?", "created_at": "2025-11-17T06:20:13", "owner": "enyalizett", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976933155944524, "text": "This is embarrassing. Teach him how to do it", "created_at": "2025-11-17T03:37:04", "owner": "kailey_mullen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032057189743683, "text": "Girl you’re only setting his future wife up to be miserable he needs to learn to do it himself", "created_at": "2025-11-16T21:48:53", "owner": "lillyrdaily", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124224430518744, "text": "Ewwww", "created_at": "2025-11-16T16:53:14", "owner": "hannahsstillhere", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862519669519528, "text": "That face! It’s always on my face", "created_at": "2025-11-16T06:37:59", "owner": "terriholmes51", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076732828942951, "text": "I would sit my ass in his couch and just sit there until he cleans the entire apartment like god intended. He is a grown man, not a child. If he doesnt then he can live in his own filth.", "created_at": "2025-11-15T00:35:13", "owner": "rev22x20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946357086934665, "text": "no. just no.", "created_at": "2025-11-14T14:39:59", "owner": "purely.dior", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076519469187521, "text": "Should've taught him better...and if u did and he still lives in a pig pen, let him get sick from it and learn the hard way I guess", "created_at": "2025-11-14T02:41:25", "owner": "ace.in.space_610", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062387633186809, "text": "Your a dumb ass like my mom who won’t let me the fuck alone even at 33 coming over to let me dog out to piss while I’m working not taking no for a answer makes him hate ya eventually WARNING ‼️ my mother to dumb to get hint", "created_at": "2025-11-13T11:59:36", "owner": "imdallasst", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968156361983240, "text": "You’re stupid as fuck for raising an incompetent boy", "created_at": "2025-11-13T04:22:47", "owner": "ta.janit.aya_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112610713597776, "text": "If he can even clean his room at college then maybe he should not be there? Your adult son can’t even keep his space clean? That tells me he needs to work on other areas of his life before trying to be “independent” on his parents dime. Craziness", "created_at": "2025-11-12T17:24:40", "owner": "bogdan_smutko", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18300431980255676, "text": "Sorry that is very disgusting he is a grown man he should've already had chors done then continue those task when he moved out are you his mother or his maid is he a grown man or a baby", "created_at": "2025-11-12T14:58:49", "owner": "lillysunflower_143", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071212601520566, "text": "Imagine being alone and dont clean your stuff, bet she cooks for him aswell", "created_at": "2025-11-12T11:00:42", "owner": "fabiorosado95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883611907285559, "text": "Nope", "created_at": "2025-11-12T01:08:18", "owner": "kayykayyy11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18182462584345190, "text": "Proof boys stay dirty", "created_at": "2025-11-11T23:20:28", "owner": "pty_sacred", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978536745781663, "text": "Are you mentally okay", "created_at": "2025-11-11T03:00:54", "owner": "literallynotchanswife", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18371769211156449, "text": "Trash mother", "created_at": "2025-11-11T02:04:12", "owner": "spicy__ivy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077344109173188, "text": "0/10 parenting skills.", "created_at": "2025-11-10T19:33:42", "owner": "zombiecat1134", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036258059706086, "text": "Are you restarted or something? If he wants to live in filth thats on him. Stop babying grown ass men.", "created_at": "2025-11-09T12:02:43", "owner": "wheresmyskin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866472502475387