sense", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060230297197542, "text": "How do you raise a human from birth to 18 and not once embarrass them for being gross and disgusting?", "created_at": "2025-11-04T12:45:13", "owner": "flyingmohawk", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18072091496245260, "text": "Um ew", "created_at": "2025-11-04T08:05:16", "owner": "virgogyl", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18162039892387111, "text": "ew.. he can do that himself", "created_at": "2025-11-04T04:11:44", "owner": "0d.esx", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17915158410214561, "text": "Absolutely insane.", "created_at": "2025-11-04T02:48:44", "owner": "amandadesch", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18097661944773896, "text": "Failed parents", "created_at": "2025-11-03T20:56:14", "owner": "exclusively_lisamarie", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18161431969377748, "text": "I would sit on his bed and wait for him to clean the whole place. Offering dinner anywhere he wants. But on reality this would be my daughter. My son would have his room clean already.", "created_at": "2025-11-03T20:26:40", "owner": "luzvides", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085234996954171, "text": "Let him live in filth until he gets sick of it so he will actually learn how to do things for himself and not just think women all his life will tidy up after him", "created_at": "2025-11-03T20:09:02", "owner": "romychoma", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18101774956732986, "text": "Been almost a month n not deleted n I am convinced this is rage bait", "created_at": "2025-11-03T16:51:39", "owner": "lauzas_art_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896093149339402, "text": "Nope, know you've enabled him to continue to be lazy and for him to expect his wife to be his mom. If he is grown enough to have higher education he is grown enough to be a man and not a child anymore", "created_at": "2025-11-03T16:46:55", "owner": "possum_rn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930722415998875, "text": "BOOOOO does he NOT HAVE TWO HANDS AND FEET ?!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-03T15:04:22", "owner": "31iana_s00n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095473648839217, "text": "Please don’t do this. Make him learn he has to do it himself", "created_at": "2025-11-03T01:47:40", "owner": "max.drake2023", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17946237336058416, "text": "She brought her own cleaning supplies I bet 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-03T00:45:53", "owner": "princevegetassblue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18169694896372524, "text": "ManchiiiiiiIIiIiiiiiiilld.", "created_at": "2025-11-02T23:56:40", "owner": "feedmememes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040037435497353, "text": "Why do you do this? He is old enough to go to college, to drive a car, to live alone. Do not support his lazyness. Teach him once and than let go!", "created_at": "2025-11-02T21:17:43", "owner": "ja_jannot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18335741443236702, "text": "these types of women raise worthless men", "created_at": "2025-11-02T20:56:10", "owner": "realwizzard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18532047343036549, "text": "öl ya anneler ve oğulları fr", "created_at": "2025-11-02T20:21:50", "owner": "sarua_5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025463660757769, "text": "Why tho?", "created_at": "2025-11-02T16:04:16", "owner": "weatherinvoice", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071202839203677, "text": "Si when he was in your home, you failed for all this years 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-01T21:03:26", "owner": "haifa_da34", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079719674123656, "text": "This is what’s wrong with men", "created_at": "2025-11-01T18:05:10", "owner": "yourmeanestbff", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18391058323121009, "text": "All these spazoids on here assuming so much bs 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-01T16:11:03", "owner": "that_stoner_guy_life", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17860933698457015, "text": "Whose mom is that😈 the college kids asking 😂😂😂 someone getting a new dad😂", "created_at": "2025-11-01T15:50:17", "owner": "elver71369", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066080861086352, "text": "They should have taught him how to clean and not just be dirty and lazy", "created_at": "2025-10-31T20:38:48", "owner": "_xx.marchia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889251829241437, "text": "Oh no 😂