 in comments even if it’s just a reel come on guys", "created_at": "2025-10-29T16:15:56", "owner": "shaurya_sharma_09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056191790555379, "text": "this is not funny and never will be. when i got to college, none of the boys knew how to do anything. laundry, dishes, cleaning, nothing. all the girls could", "created_at": "2025-10-29T13:18:34", "owner": "sashaaaabb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938432988960197, "text": "Don’t expect him to be finding a wife then", "created_at": "2025-10-29T03:38:01", "owner": "julia_stafford_22", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084687442795633, "text": "Bro it ain’t even rlly dirty yall just must not understand how women used to be my mom cleans the house evry day without fail and she has a job and she is disgusted if it goes more than a few days without cleaning", "created_at": "2025-10-28T20:27:44", "owner": "jamiesmith174", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155390404406355, "text": "Is he 2?", "created_at": "2025-10-28T16:31:56", "owner": "the.8xu_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18160302085384860, "text": "That’s why it’s dirty in the first place", "created_at": "2025-10-28T16:03:31", "owner": "thehippiefromuranus", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18073863001981321, "text": "Ew fuck no. If he don't know how to clean on his own then let him sit in his piss😬🤷", "created_at": "2025-10-28T03:09:21", "owner": "the._.money.pit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948500752045325, "text": "Das sad ya didn’t teach ya son how to clean after himself and he’s in college 😑", "created_at": "2025-10-28T02:09:45", "owner": "ja.strgallery", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18327943432210806, "text": "the women hating in these comments are stupid af", "created_at": "2025-10-28T01:27:10", "owner": "hypersonic_threshold", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069103520371775, "text": "You are not a babysitter for your adult son tell him to clean his own shit", "created_at": "2025-10-27T17:03:17", "owner": "ugh_doll", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082761839318659, "text": "What’s wrong with a mom looking out after her son ?? You’re probably an amazing mom !", "created_at": "2025-10-27T03:21:34", "owner": "av__garcia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106399771721912, "text": "Heck no shame your son and make him clean. I’ve dated boys that don’t clean and I had to be the one to do it all. It’s so miserable", "created_at": "2025-10-27T00:01:47", "owner": "ricosweets", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18093795610655585, "text": "Why not sit back and tell him to get it clean before you leave? Doing it for him helps nothing in the long run", "created_at": "2025-10-26T16:01:28", "owner": "forgetmenot_324", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18028051076547209, "text": "You’ve failed as a parent. You’ve raised a man baby who you’ve taught to use weaponized incompetence to avoid his responsibilities.", "created_at": "2025-10-26T15:52:48", "owner": "boysforme", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983970879913134, "text": "why dont u show him how to do it Rather than just doing it for him?", "created_at": "2025-10-26T03:00:17", "owner": "allyswerld", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17916097110069556, "text": "Did you buy him diapers as well in case he doesn’t get up to go to the toilet? 🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-24T22:06:28", "owner": "rohit_shinde_03", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18093132601833356, "text": "The whole point of going away for college is to learn how to take care of yourself in a an environment literally built for that, you are robbing him of that experience and his opportunity to become his own fully fledged adult", "created_at": "2025-10-24T20:44:49", "owner": "flashandtrash", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17988827582900323, "text": "You could be teaching him still… but nah let’s just do it for him", "created_at": "2025-10-24T08:42:49", "owner": "inavacl", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17916870285198902, "text": "Ew.", "created_at": "2025-10-24T08:13:20", "owner": "remkatf", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17951443790897900, "text": "Bitch made a man child", "created_at": "2025-10-23T23:55:11", "owner": "lucydr0py", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074973413179417, "text": "Stop raising entitled ignorant boys!", "created_at": "2025-10-23T23:31:28", "owner": "claritywithkarolien", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071761166256282, "text": "We might have some products to help your son out so we can learn to do this himself 🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-23T21:50:33", "owner": "eclothusa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18292833646286266, "text": "This is one of the rare cases when I ask myself \"what is wrong with women?\"", "created_at": "2025-10-23T20:23:42", "owner": "zacieramslady", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17966559572825030, "text": "Uhh, didn’t you teach him how to clean up after himself? It’s mothers like you that turn boys into manchild husbands. 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-23T18:25:18", "owner": "missvioletlynch", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17849907072578293, "text": "🤢🤢🤢🤢🤢", "created_at": "2025-10-23T17:40:13", "owner": "yogurl153", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17965669502976142, "text": "Parenting failed successfully", "created_at": "2025-10-23T15:38:06", "owner": "kate.dnll", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842083894606487, "text": "Peinlich", "created_at": "2025-10-23T09:54:53", "owner": "tatjana.hieber", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18110503426512571, "text": "What a stupid woman. You have failed as a mother.", "created_at": "2025-10-23T05:04:15", "owner": "gaurl_dukatis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109285012583649, "text": "My mom would've left a skid mark in the toilet bowl", "created_at": "2025-10-23T02:24:18", "owner": "jonizmarjanen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026500166752201, "text": "😮😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-10-23T01:58:52", "owner": "coletteofearth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18509525236067776, "text": "This isn't cute 😬", "created_at": "2025-10-23T00:01:27", "owner": "deadlifts_andpinot", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17927543505130892, "text": "Did you not teach him to clean up after himself growing up??", "created_at": "2025-10-22T23:51:06", "owner": "star_trek_curls_etc", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17897876154300192, "text": "Nah, this ain't it. I would hop in there and make a scene. Parenting ALL of them that stay there. Clean your damn room. Youre old enough to go to college. Gross, caveman activities. Gona get bugs. 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-22T22:05:56", "owner": "_jasandkyraxo", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17862524112436677, "text": "Teach men to actually clean up after themselves on a daily basis instead of coddling them.", "created_at": "2025-10-22T21:54:58", "owner": "tranquilized999", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18048467567358031, "text": "That is a failure as a parent. It’s ok that he has his room dirty, but doing it all for him. There lies the mistake. Time management is first thing they need to learn to do when they are in college. And this goes for men and women. Cause I’ve seen some women’s dorms and damn! That is nasty.", "created_at": "2025-10-22T21:48:55", "owner": "mili_jahnsulca", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18536594896034718, "text": "🚩🚩🚩🚩 stop right now while you can still tecaxh your son a valuable lesson in respect for visitors. that apartment should be spotless when you come to visit", "created_at": "2025-10-22T21:25:05", "owner": "ariel.gasca", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18078693131129407, "text": "Grown ass man btw", "created_at": "2025-10-22T20:51:12", "owner": "gabriela.a7", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18058568720553477, "text": "Because he never had to do it home. Why would he start now ? He knows you’re going to do it for him 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-22T20:36:59", "owner": "claireloumay78", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084192913959419, "text": "what if you taught him how to clean? i married a man i thought knew how. turns out his parents didnt even teach him how to clean a fking countertop properly. YOU are contributing to useless males.", "created_at": "2025-10-22T20:21:20", "owner": "lunestaries", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18431582176099513, "text": "If you come visit your son and see mess everywhere, just sit down, drink some tea, and peer pressure him to clean it up. He's an adult too. He should be able and willing to do that. Can't imagine my parents coming to my dorm to clean up 🤦‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-10-22T19:48:49", "owner": "mothie_art", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060570179185679, "text": "It's rage bait?", "created_at": "2025-10-22T18:57:24", "owner": "nas_lmc", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17911620162228148, "text": "Respectfully, would you that for your daughter?", "created_at": "2025-10-22T17:27:38", "owner": "marinatdiazz", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17885454780264933, "text": "When women shame their own children for life skills they are responsible for teaching them…. Screams narc", "created_at": "2025-10-22T16:52:37", "owner": "jessicalloyd888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098867314705576, "text": "Do u wipe his ass too?", "created_at": "2025-10-22T16:36:39", "owner": "louiseamcg", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18106550191537995, "text": "Sorry I'm sixteen and I've been cleaning the house much less my room since I was like 8 🫩", "created_at": "2025-10-22T15:58:55", "owner": "con_bow6578", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18325771657213792, "text": "When did people get the,I can’t do things for myself update.", "created_at": "2025-10-22T15:43:36", "owner": "speedy_pete.02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095089744691752, "text": "Raising the next generation of men who are useless to their partner.", "created_at": "2025-10-22T15:38:23", "owner": "itsbethanymc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048111026662810, "text": "Failed as a mom sounds like. He couldn’t even bother to clean before you came?", "created_at": "2025-10-22T13:56:17", "owner": "iamneissaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066640301459686, "text": "This is truly embarrassing. All his life, living with his parents, you both didn't teach him basic cleaning. Now he's gonna become a burden to his wife one day. Shame on you.", "created_at": "2025-10-22T13:38:34", "owner": "selinaokafor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18323690536208976, "text": "May a son like this never find my daughter!", "created_at": "2025-10-22T11:40:21", "owner": "brookecg89", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17909982555249356, "text": "Nope.", "created_at": "2025-10-22T11:12:06", "owner": "catinkagrant", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18537549577055500, "text": "THIS is the problem with the men!!! Their enabler boy moms 🤦‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-10-22T10:26:57", "owner": "jen_leigh01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18347991988167704, "text": "FFS woman! Sit down and let him live as he wants. Just enjoy some time with him", "created_at": "2025-10-22T09:21:49", "owner": "vivelareine89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127036669492552, "text": "I can't tell if this is rage bait or not 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-22T08:38:26", "owner": "scarrimfire", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081529201976256, "text": "This is why men don't clean after themselves", "created_at": "2025-10-22T05:21:36", "owner": "vyxen20", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18093730927871319, "text": "Another parenting failure", "created_at": "2025-10-22T03:52:53", "owner": "criquellali", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18155611654402251, "text": "this is not the way", "created_at": "2025-10-22T03:02:59", "owner": "jazzma.n", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18078490889153913, "text": "DONT DO THISSSSSSS", "created_at": "2025-10-22T00:45:27", "owner": "allashley22", "likes": 12}, {"id": 17865176106475099, "text": "You are the reason why so many marriages fail. Let them live in filth, its a red a flag to the girls", "created_at": "2025-10-21T23:58:06", "owner": "tatterpotpie", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057390563627066, "text": "Stop doing this, let men live in their filthy caves until they learn how to be an adult", "created_at": "2025-10-21T23:32:49", "owner": "pokemon_mom1776", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17928700959127662, "text": "Enabler", "created_at": "2025-10-21T23:31:41", "owner": "xx.briona.xx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048736790357832, "text": "Nastiness", "created_at": "2025-10-21T22:19:42", "owner": "avril_fleurr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016660850788096, "text": "rage bait cuz hell nah", "created_at": "2025-10-21T22:15:51", "owner": "shiverburn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18433124230103435, "text": "Now we know why", "created_at": "2025-10-21T21:59:00", "owner": "itsdaisy.bloom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18292302166283946, "text": "why tf do parents not teach their sons basic skills", "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:03:32", "owner": "_katies", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17954770712889072, "text": "Show this video to every future girlfriend so they can run fast from him.", "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:00:16", "owner": "onlyamum", "likes": 22}, {"id": 18059105714442174, "text": "😂 nope", "created_at": "2025-10-21T19:30:12", "owner": "suetherose", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115920139554337, "text": "Why would he clean when he knows his mother will do it for him! congratulations on raising another incompetent useless man that can not even do the basics of life! Yayyyyyyy he’s gonna be great father and partner one day. Great job for adding another useless person into society", "created_at": "2025-10-21T19:28:50", "owner": "divinity_is_within3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061623362138745, "text": "Or you could teach your children life skills before they leave home so they can take care of themselves", "created_at": "2025-10-21T19:25:31", "owner": "poppyygreene", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18108531262524223, "text": "I was gonna advertise my app, but your son needs a miracle.", "created_at": "2025-10-21T16:20:56", "owner": "casamatesapp", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18046697303401262, "text": "STOP! you have to let him reach the break point of i cant live like this anymore on his own. He will figure it out, you are just screwing over your future daughter/son in law.", "created_at": "2025-10-21T16:04:37", "owner": "jacksonjames1789", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103751692715704, "text": "This is such a red flag!", "created_at": "2025-10-21T15:56:13", "owner": "chic_nappy237", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18115209943546543, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-21T15:35:51", "owner": "bearnailart", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18059074172406690, "text": "That's just enabling your son's behavior.", "created_at": "2025-10-21T15:30:38", "owner": "suririta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877566679422055, "text": "And in Japan kids are taught to do school duties so they learn these skills at young age", "created_at": "2025-10-21T15:25:37", "owner": "sacred_shashin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863926054489143, "text": "For those complaining about raising a man child, this happens exactly the same with women/girls. My family and I rent appartments for students, and believe it or not, the worst ones when it comes to cleaning are women. Most men clean themselves or hire someone to clean, whereas women dont clean at all and are less phrone to hire someone to clean. As a landlord I prefer renting to male students rather than females. Im currently renting to an old man who doesnt cook nor clean, but he hires someone to do all the cleaning.", "created_at": "2025-10-21T15:05:54", "owner": "jero.sa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081842468052173, "text": "Ive Seen 5 year olds being more Independent and Clean their rooms. He will end up as a narcissist searching for a mum Not a partner", "created_at": "2025-10-21T15:01:22", "owner": "mrsrobot_sounddesign", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082264157066733, "text": "I would do the same thing!!", "created_at": "2025-10-21T14:27:59", "owner": "monicaromoflores", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925530874118940, "text": "He’d definitely expect a bangmaid as a wife 💀", "created_at": "2025-10-21T13:51:05", "owner": "a22099h", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17847933639583576, "text": "If he’s at college then he’s what 18!?? He can make his own fucking bed and clean his own shit tf ?? 😭💀", "created_at": "2025-10-21T12:30:13", "owner": "emilymint1526", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043615226440920, "text": "If you have to do it it is because you didn't teach him to be an adult", "created_at": "2025-10-21T09:55:42", "owner": "bertillus", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057999587552497, "text": "Kf I was a mom I would be with my shoe on my hand watching how my son clean, and it have to be spotless or PUM the shoe is on his head 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-21T08:40:37", "owner": "cledesma21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18159820957351591, "text": "So hes a toddler, okay", "created_at": "2025-10-21T05:58:40", "owner": "_kuranyu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976406253782852, "text": "Your sons future wife is going to loathe you both one day", "created_at": "2025-10-21T05:05:04", "owner": "neonsnaut", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18189859789335785, "text": "Teach him how to do it. You are ruining it for somebody else's daughter", "created_at": "2025-10-21T05:03:42", "owner": "draupadhiraj", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18199917250317547, "text": "Can boy mom just stop raising manchild 😢😢", "created_at": "2025-10-21T04:31:30", "owner": "ghinayazid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18415931980117236, "text": "Wonder how many of these sons have sisters? \"Hey sis moms coming to visit. Can you come over and help me clean my dorm room? Dad stall mom I need to change my dorm room number.", "created_at": "2025-10-21T02:45:51", "owner": "sabreth23", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17863761186488441, "text": "Been there, can so relate", "created_at": "2025-10-21T02:28:37", "owner": "chappy_tails", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081693461000182, "text": "This should of been taught before he left for college. Hes just gonna be someones dusty ass husband who doesnt help out. Like this isnt funny.", "created_at": "2025-10-21T02:28:02", "owner": "ziutacz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18131506657475658, "text": "Mind you YOU raised them like this expecting other people to do their work", "created_at": "2025-10-21T01:57:39", "owner": "kenzii.noirr", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18084803281948024, "text": "Love moms like this college is such an adjustment and people get easily depressed with school trying to work take care of themselves etc not everyone parties", "created_at": "2025-10-11T22:51:56", "owner": "est.99k", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18485268028075549, "text": "That was me!", "created_at": "2025-10-11T22:46:41", "owner": "sswarren_mk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924188995149052, "text": "Must be a gringo thing, this would never fly with a hispanic family", "created_at": "2025-10-11T22:45:12", "owner": "emmanuel.kcpr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884447362263536, "text": "Best mom award 🏆", "created_at": "2025-10-11T22:29:45", "owner": "shaeathome", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909207061101293, "text": "Hygiene 101", "created_at": "2025-10-11T22:23:32", "owner": "krawhkhm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18529130269037061, "text": "reinforcing the stereotype only women should be responsible for cleaning", "created_at": "2025-10-11T22:06:24", "owner": "miiintttberry", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18090119812892614, "text": "It’s so scary but hoping they have great immunity when they’re done 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-11T22:04:00", "owner": "ninajk22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936378340089351, "text": "Same. The struggle is real!", "created_at": "2025-10-11T21:35:25", "owner": "andrea_kosewick_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18531461425020942, "text": "oh, fuck this", "created_at": "2025-10-11T21:27:19", "owner": "filipovichsandra", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18113454604546831, "text": "This will not be me", "created_at": "2025-10-11T21:17:47", "owner": "andreaaortiz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18145106173420758, "text": "Please don’t do this. Let him figure it out himself", "created_at": "2025-10-11T21:14:17", "owner": "lunaswan08", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17974465112946108, "text": "If he had been made to contribute to household tasks as a kid, these things would be second nature and he'd probably even be disgusted by his peers who live in filth.", "created_at": "2025-10-11T21:11:55", "owner": "racheltauriainen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067051643585164, "text": "Definitely not. As hard as it is to do, they will never learn otherwise. No shame to this mama though. Boy mom life is tough.", "created_at": "2025-10-11T20:55:12", "owner": "_aunt_stephy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17947668390045986, "text": "This is why the birth rate is declining", "created_at": "2025-10-11T20:41:19", "owner": "anniescheesybookshelf", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18064355435081295, "text": "💯 accurate", "created_at": "2025-10-11T20:38:43", "owner": "tjmylove", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862769674483932, "text": "U workin too hard for a deposit that is already gone", "created_at": "2025-10-11T20:16:26", "owner": "mo7e_obeidat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18190780276323120, "text": "How to raise a Beta Male 101.", "created_at": "2025-10-11T20:11:21", "owner": "mps7029", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965022903828608, "text": "lol been there.  Wait til spring and it’s soooo gross and dirty", "created_at": "2025-10-11T20:09:33", "owner": "123jamie_johnson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884537326262040, "text": "I about died when I saw the same hand towel from when we moved him in. He learned that day that yes, you wash the hand towel too.", "created_at": "2025-10-11T19:41:30", "owner": "shannontenkman", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18132020086474717, "text": "Don’t clean up after them. They are fully grown. If they want a female partner in the future, keep em messy and ignorant. They gotta learn the hard way and be ashamed", "created_at": "2025-10-11T19:35:30", "owner": "emily_krall", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887265901369138, "text": "Buying him cleaning supplies while visiting ✅. Cleaning for him. ❌❌❌", "created_at": "2025-10-11T19:32:33", "owner": "onesweetworld67", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18078394001017708, "text": "Tell that young man to clean his fucking toilet. No woman he brings to his dorm is going to accept a dirty ass toilet", "created_at": "2025-10-11T19:24:05", "owner": "xunknownintrovert", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18533298589042084, "text": "Rip 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-11T19:08:31", "owner": "nomethodonlymadness", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052901381289385, "text": "Haha… I used to do this at my son’s college house. 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-11T18:57:45", "owner": "brendakellerschwieterman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914868193071900, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-11T18:44:04", "owner": "tricey15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115060543533243, "text": "Teach him now to clean.", "created_at": "2025-10-11T18:36:38", "owner": "sadophilia_", "likes": 35}, {"id": 18078481646472099, "text": "Hell no  Old enough to leave home old enough to clean", "created_at": "2025-10-11T18:30:35", "owner": "sazfrench6972", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18104576230609039, "text": "No, he lazy no way! He can clean himself", "created_at": "2025-10-11T18:16:57", "owner": "dontstart32", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17901814623142255, "text": "Literally this. And a big trip to the grocery store", "created_at": "2025-10-11T18:10:38", "owner": "mommacass_in_co", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17897701398312624, "text": "Thats why Im teaching my son how to clean and its importance now...and he's 10! 🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-11T17:53:40", "owner": "jaynesamber", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18067075673055784, "text": "No. ❌", "created_at": "2025-10-11T17:13:14", "owner": "edaella127", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18063839456599615, "text": "Teach him to clean. He’s a grown man", "created_at": "2025-10-11T16:57:34", "owner": "ayalar007", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17982543959874773, "text": "My son lives in a frat house and I’d have to update my tetanus shot before doing this in their shared bathroom. Nope. 🤢", "created_at": "2025-10-11T16:30:21", "owner": "emnebben", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052543250317261, "text": "When I was a freshman in college my mom used to pick up my dirty laundry and bring it back all washed and nicely folded 😹 such a spoiled 18 year old.", "created_at": "2025-10-11T16:14:11", "owner": "rendaugherty", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18357492559095892, "text": "Yep", "created_at": "2025-10-11T16:10:10", "owner": "dhines91351", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979717317764174, "text": "Im begging all boy-moms to teach your sons to clean starting when their young! By the time they're teens, the patterns are already set in 😫", "created_at": "2025-10-11T16:08:40", "owner": "anakitadesu", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17855124702544044, "text": "Just did this!", "created_at": "2025-10-11T16:04:50", "owner": "krissystacey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111700783493144, "text": "No offense mothers, you care for your kids, but let them learn", "created_at": "2025-10-11T15:50:47", "owner": "savylyg", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18096762715707158, "text": "Unfortunately this is my daughter not my son!!", "created_at": "2025-10-11T15:49:47", "owner": "taryn_deanda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094898761750085, "text": "You raised a child and drain on society", "created_at": "2025-10-11T14:06:57", "owner": "sgt_slaughter_lll", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18108289417503932, "text": "Ugg… I just stopped going into his dorm and would meet him outside, it was gross!", "created_at": "2025-10-11T13:51:31", "owner": "susan.weaver.963", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18065794292594025, "text": "Cleaning for someone in college??? Thats rubbishhhh, you’re spoiling your child.", "created_at": "2025-10-11T13:39:41", "owner": "benita__ejikeme", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18092938375631088, "text": "NOPE.", "created_at": "2025-10-11T13:25:19", "owner": "jgarber91", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17913637170198930, "text": "you should’ve made him clean it 😂 dont enable him", "created_at": "2025-10-11T13:10:19", "owner": "its_nayhaly", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18069931244520061, "text": "Is your son a toddler?", "created_at": "2025-10-11T12:30:00", "owner": "_k4t4r1n4_5t_", "likes": 17072}, {"id": 18121404550503334, "text": "Well this is the result of how you raised him", "created_at": "2025-10-11T12:17:57", "owner": "chatter.chapters", "likes": 492}, {"id": 18358760173088358, "text": "So your babying a grown man? Got it , no wonder men think this is women’s work if you do it all for them !", "created_at": "2025-10-11T12:08:37", "owner": "ecohome.17", "likes": 1311}, {"id": 17925572838117392, "text": "@jenn.yates 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-11T11:58:54", "owner": "ngeorge3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876086254327623, "text": "I hear this from all college boy moms that I know.", "created_at": "2025-10-11T11:25:17", "owner": "jesscatperk", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081726119480949, "text": "Ummm past two days..and for my DAUGHTER 😳", "created_at": "2025-10-11T11:14:15", "owner": "barbarad1015", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080599222988794, "text": "Your kid is a loser if you have to do this fyi", "created_at": "2025-10-11T10:39:40", "owner": "tonysuckow", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17903332431266960, "text": "Just nooooooooo......", "created_at": "2025-10-11T10:10:37", "owner": "bs30776", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18388019317120292, "text": "Been there done that", "created_at": "2025-10-11T06:16:00", "owner": "big_erny_p", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18165639163332178, "text": "My son came home for fall break.  But he cleaned last weekend.", "created_at": "2025-10-11T05:07:12", "owner": "carolineparra1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17864691558412953, "text": "I will visit them and focus on how they are doing ,go shopping and eat but they mess is their responsibilities and yeah they are studying and doing homework and all of that but priorities and making plan is the key to be organized .", "created_at": "2025-10-11T05:01:15", "owner": "zobeyda809", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17974186997943771, "text": "💯🫠😵‍💫", "created_at": "2025-10-11T04:35:14", "owner": "geebella", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18132765421412254, "text": "I can believe it! Mine says they clean haha don’t think son", "created_at": "2025-10-11T03:14:39", "owner": "living_life_with_laurab", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073832027178213, "text": "My step son and my son are young. But I preach to them that they must know how to clean or their wife will get mad at them 😂 works great😂", "created_at": "2025-10-11T02:47:40", "owner": "bb.g.rae", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17909827302235215, "text": "I was a RA for the boys basketball team and let's just say we had to do a resinspection weeks later or else it was gonna be escalated.", "created_at": "2025-10-11T02:47:12", "owner": "joiagenae", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996838650836257, "text": "Absolutely not.", "created_at": "2025-10-11T02:37:18", "owner": "enrgycnsl", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17905465641123436, "text": "😂 Yes! Couldn’t help myself! 🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-11T02:31:42", "owner": "reneerajabi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067709021040562, "text": "Been there 😆🥰", "created_at": "2025-10-11T02:25:10", "owner": "hodge6596", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051135650314668, "text": "Been there with 2 college boys 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-11T02:20:00", "owner": "kbracey3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019855088595253, "text": "Why? He is a grown ass man", "created_at": "2025-10-11T02:17:19", "owner": "mangvps", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17958149003859060, "text": "STOP. PUT DOWN THE MOP. Your kid needs to learn how to take care of himself.", "created_at": "2025-10-11T02:15:36", "owner": "urban_ophelia", "likes": 3556}, {"id": 18085085386930162, "text": "I've cleaned the toilet before at the office campus house just so I could use it!  My son makes his bed and cleans the kitchen and his room up but the bathroom with 4 guys is a struggle.", "created_at": "2025-10-11T02:08:18", "owner": "jilllynndur", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944432899049959, "text": "I am so sorry for his future spouse🥲", "created_at": "2025-10-11T01:59:53", "owner": "gladyanacoronado", "likes": 27}, {"id": 18075417248160042, "text": "Been there, done that!", "created_at": "2025-10-11T01:58:07", "owner": "lortiedonna", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18020657867782400, "text": "Omg!! I just did this!! So spot on!!", "created_at": "2025-10-11T01:44:39", "owner": "devonnewalker", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18380760028182667, "text": "Hell no! Lol make his ass do it", "created_at": "2025-10-11T01:12:17", "owner": "april.losett", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18107609902586047, "text": "Wasn’t opened after four years!", "created_at": "2025-10-11T01:07:49", "owner": "randimarino123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059804123445053, "text": "Actual video of ME in my son’s dorm room 3 weeks ago, parents weekend!!! I tried to resist, I really did, but I just had to!!!", "created_at": "2025-10-11T00:58:44", "owner": "emily.r.wilhite", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18042682178443963, "text": "Make him clean it!", "created_at": "2025-10-11T00:53:58", "owner": "alimccoyroberts", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17862860859491826, "text": "@maribnola 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-11T00:48:56", "owner": "louisemariemamabear", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101087977570723, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-11T00:38:59", "owner": "tulipfan919", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853558186505071, "text": "Haha very true. That’s me too.", "created_at": "2025-10-11T00:22:05", "owner": "vtalbott22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081248071992151, "text": "No way! Do not clean up after them!", "created_at": "2025-10-11T00:11:26", "owner": "smacro70", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17899558548287061, "text": "God love you. That would be the day I would do this. I pity your son’s future partner!", "created_at": "2025-10-11T00:04:00", "owner": "marcellasliney", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18068668874195285, "text": "Stop. So pathetic.", "created_at": "2025-10-11T00:01:41", "owner": "stauffienation", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18150132568408670, "text": "Yep!", "created_at": "2025-10-10T23:37:08", "owner": "jaxiedi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014526254795697, "text": "Been there times 3! 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-10T23:25:49", "owner": "sweet_melissa__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18140301310433054, "text": "Oof thanks mom your future daughter in law is sure to be thankful you’ve raised a man-baby.", "created_at": "2025-10-10T23:17:18", "owner": "kellz_bellz99", "likes": 606}, {"id": 17983522988907247, "text": "Nothing truer! 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-10T23:12:17", "owner": "jenskiles", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082600867804438, "text": "I know 😬", "created_at": "2025-10-10T23:06:50", "owner": "leeannstroud3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948366826023588, "text": "I would do the same when I visited my daughter…..secretly clean when no one was looking.", "created_at": "2025-10-10T23:06:42", "owner": "carrfrances", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18056690792215436, "text": "He can clean his own damn toilet.", "created_at": "2025-10-10T22:58:18", "owner": "wsueslingerland", "likes": 7270}, {"id": 17895424323340564, "text": "So he gets to learn that a woman cleans up after him. Yay for his future wife!!", "created_at": "2025-10-10T22:20:10", "owner": "j_mccull_11", "likes": 458}, {"id": 17984513255861395, "text": "I would walk into my son's room and say just give me an hr., I couldn't ignore it! 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-10T21:56:04", "owner": "ritaroessler", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18112024249495533, "text": "Foolish woman. Let him stew in his filth. Needs to learn to be a man and clean up after himself.", "created_at": "2025-10-10T21:48:05", "owner": "amy27614", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18530464129003840, "text": "The struggle is REAL! I can relate", "created_at": "2025-10-10T21:47:29", "owner": "lilywiesner", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18040378205680861, "text": "Yeap", "created_at": "2025-10-10T21:12:57", "owner": "sallypalmerking", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097144819738103, "text": "Yep", "created_at": "2025-10-10T21:11:14", "owner": "hempsaid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063200759618094, "text": "wish i had this my mom would rip me a new one if she had to clean my dorm when visiting ☠️", "created_at": "2025-10-10T20:35:03", "owner": "jastheplayboy", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18057919370617931, "text": "Are you kidding me? Joe is this helping him or his future spouse? No mom back away.", "created_at": "2025-10-10T19:43:57", "owner": "kimmfleming", "likes": 14}, {"id": 17896874544322760, "text": "They never appreciate your effort. Let them learn.", "created_at": "2025-10-10T19:26:18", "owner": "jacquibasso", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18106680082590321, "text": "Me too then gave up because if he didn’t care why should I…", "created_at": "2025-10-10T19:12:27", "owner": "jackie.sawyer1", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18535202374047146, "text": "Why the hell are you cleaning? This is why so many young women are saying they are raising their boyfriends because they don't even know how to take care of themselves", "created_at": "2025-10-10T18:47:17", "owner": "susiemcusie", "likes": 3807}, {"id": 18075766274133543, "text": "His future wife is going to thank you 😂😂😂😂 not", "created_at": "2025-10-10T18:20:31", "owner": "leblanccoffee_", "likes": 3518}, {"id": 18372833002145063, "text": "😂😂😂 they truly don’t care", "created_at": "2025-10-10T18:06:32", "owner": "kamilynny94", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18106667341521077, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-10T17:17:11", "owner": "nursie53", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928863525997782, "text": "God men need to grow the f up. He needs to learn on his own. I was doing my own laundry at the age of 8. Can we please raise some independent men?? His poor wife is going to be miserable", "created_at": "2025-10-10T17:08:21", "owner": "brandon.bakerrr", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18084007951751281, "text": "I also tried! They didn’t even let me go inside 🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-10T17:07:56", "owner": "nho_cak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974533629939360, "text": "God men need to grow the f up. He needs to learn on his own. I was doing my own laundry at the age of 8. Can we please raise some independent men?? His poor wife is going to be miserable", "created_at": "2025-10-10T17:05:53", "owner": "brandon.bakerrr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18129192901470209, "text": "Nope.  That’s a do not enter ever again post drop off zone 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-10T16:51:44", "owner": "ehpetrone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18361070764081581, "text": "Your love for him shows…. But…. Sometimes they need to learn to take care of themselves.  It’s surprising what they can do if you don’t do it for them. We all parent  differently.  I was surprised to learn when our son went away for college that he could make his own eye doctor/ dentist appointment’s and take care of a fender bender all without our help.  So he can clean up his space.", "created_at": "2025-10-10T15:40:48", "owner": "zenajz", "likes": 164}, {"id": 18407617627140858, "text": "Don’t US colleges have cleaners?!", "created_at": "2025-10-10T15:06:42", "owner": "inky._.pinky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18532837576029608, "text": "And we wonder where men learn to weaponize incompetence and expect their partners to clean up after them. Enabling another generation of incompetent husbands. This only hurts him and his future partner. 🛑", "created_at": "2025-10-10T14:39:55", "owner": "lauramariehanson", "likes": 445}, {"id": 18079608818316086, "text": "Dont do this! You are only raising the next dependent man who makes his wife's life a burden.", "created_at": "2025-10-10T12:36:34", "owner": "misshatschiputschi", "likes": 31419}, {"id": 17983004012746976, "text": "Wtf", "created_at": "2025-10-10T11:23:31", "owner": "kimkayc", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18360823393084483, "text": "So you’re an enabler and your son takes advantage of you by waiting for you to visit because he knows you’ll clean and you weren’t capable of raising a full on adult that isn’t capable of cleaning and keeping their space proper? Nasty", "created_at": "2025-10-10T03:30:43", "owner": "lexsylvestre", "likes": 15}, {"id": 18399268195189540, "text": "This why I'm skipping it🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-10T02:53:53", "owner": "teresal8313", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18342573658204191, "text": "I don’t know what I’d do. Haven’t had this experience with a daughter in college… won’t judge as I’ll have a son in that season in a decade from now. I’m going to start preparing him now 😂😂😂 thanks for sharing", "created_at": "2025-10-10T00:46:39", "owner": "hellonannydotcom", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17998658117820781, "text": "I wouldn't be cleaning anything.", "created_at": "2025-10-09T23:27:26", "owner": "trace7678", "likes": 10739}, {"id": 17882392407393313, "text": "I’m glad I’m not the only one 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-09T23:19:03", "owner": "jaimekleffner", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18029670869722536, "text": "Truth!!", "created_at": "2025-10-09T18:59:27", "owner": "kriley1016", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081369613969162, "text": "Like she didnt clean his 💩💩 for 18years..", "created_at": "2025-10-09T16:27:01", "owner": "chantal386", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920479222173845, "text": "My son’s school distributed cleaning kits to help students prepare for family weekend.", "created_at": "2025-10-09T13:51:35", "owner": "gfreegenius", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18042452888678532, "text": "Been there and I had a daughter!!! I was honestly questioning how she was getting good grades if she didn’t know how to clean basic things 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-09T06:52:24", "owner": "goodtobealive35", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18405437047188349, "text": "Rotfl 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-08T14:32:10", "owner": "beccaakidd", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18002709200657608, "text": "💀💀💀💀💀", "created_at": "2025-10-08T03:57:56", "owner": "jessicavonhovenjordan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18127817134485089, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-08T03:57:51", "owner": "jessicavonhovenjordan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18324341488240191, "text": "I see my future 😂😂amazing mama ❤️💕💕👏", "created_at": "2025-10-07T10:16:32", "owner": "ck1morris122", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18104260357616191, "text": "TIME TO MAKE SOME CONTENT AND EMBARASS MY CHILD WHILE I VISIT. 🤡", "created_at": "2025-10-07T05:30:06", "owner": "iamjusthereforthelaughs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863796298413792, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-07T03:16:49", "owner": "mike_fisher5", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18064018541375466, "text": "That is absolutely the sweetest of you!!", "created_at": "2025-10-07T01:36:38", "owner": "fitandfashionwithkrista", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18110333008561118, "text": "My dorm building does biweekly cleanings of the shared space like the kitchenette and the bathroom so that stuff is cleaned like things are cleaned off toilets are scrubbed. The only space we have to keep clean ourselves is our bedrooms they don’t touch that space", "created_at": "2025-10-07T00:12:38", "owner": "mack__heighington_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18091472257832222, "text": "Oh nooo! I would be doing the same thing!", "created_at": "2025-10-06T18:40:41", "owner": "simpleandsweetblog", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18114914680549192, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T18:19:13", "owner": "christen.mahlmeister", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17972803766938893, "text": "Omgggg hahah I can only imagine", "created_at": "2025-10-06T17:23:06", "owner": "nicoleedegroff", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18065524580068541, "text": "You are the best mom ever ❤️😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T15:34:12", "owner": "sepimillerstyle", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18400713769184948, "text": "Haha 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T14:08:14", "owner": "maryanngrant_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18071980307224316, "text": "Oh lawd 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T13:58:07", "owner": "keeksnguyen", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18191228335322463, "text": "Best mama ever👏🏼👏🏼", "created_at": "2025-10-06T12:52:17", "owner": "maeg_thompson", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17933017197100433, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T11:55:20", "owner": "shaydemp", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18060188582142881, "text": "😂 you’re such a good mom!! Cleaning in your dress 👏🏼", "created_at": "2025-10-06T11:05:16", "owner": "stephlemayofficial", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18062836049616002, "text": "Omg 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T10:31:35", "owner": "carlyyyelizabeth", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18282721150274166, "text": "You are the best Mom !❤️🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-06T06:02:44", "owner": "jewel.schneider", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17962745144988420, "text": "😂😂😂, right", "created_at": "2025-10-06T02:54:38", "owner": "life_adventures_with_hope", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18101969134615696, "text": "I see my future 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T02:41:55", "owner": "midwestwifey", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18071472016972415, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T01:19:29", "owner": "intentionally_influenced", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18169797745325833, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-06T00:55:47", "owner": "madisondanielle4", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17999434628830126, "text": "Hahahah best mama", "created_at": "2025-10-06T00:55:46", "owner": "madisondanielle4", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17925933369141131, "text": "Heheh ohhh you are the best🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-05T23:52:10", "owner": "lisa123marie", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17896563756299386, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-05T23:15:50", "owner": "mackenziewhelan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080688736950098, "text": "This will be me in the future 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-05T23:00:00", "owner": "tayloreoakley", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18171665479362511, "text": "I would probably do the same 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-05T22:49:40", "owner": "hey.heather.ray", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18090365866854388, "text": "Don’t clean. Let it get disgusting. When women stop being willing to be near him, he will get it.", "created_at": "2025-10-05T21:35:42", "owner": "bloodhoundnc", "likes": 76}, {"id": 17869745430371832, "text": "Boys are icky 🤕", "created_at": "2025-10-05T21:28:08", "owner": "kaviimi", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18039083705650824, "text": "You’re the best!!", "created_at": "2025-10-05T21:00:57", "owner": "uraveragemama", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18536446234013634, "text": "This is moms everywhere 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-05T21:00:41", "owner": "uraveragemama", "likes": 12}, {"id": 18158076403385317, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-05T20:59:39", "owner": "fullpotentialk9", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18060968663384811, "text": "You’re the best-he needed you lol", "created_at": "2025-10-05T20:59:34", "owner": "ameliarose__xo", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18067514693585956, "text": "You are the best! ❤️😂", "created_at": "2025-10-05T20:55:50", "owner": "carmenorganizes", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18094496197706770, "text": "Mama is getting right to work with her purse on 😂that’s exactly what if do too 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-05T20:53:35", "owner": "iamshreeen", "likes": 13}, {"id": 17863140918476546, "text": "This was me this weekend. 2 hours!!", "created_at": "2025-10-05T20:32:21", "owner": "dianapetersdesignsjewelry", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080435639077056, "text": "Sounds about right for a college kid 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-05T20:27:21", "owner": "ashley_rosies", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17885190954382173, "text": "😂😂😂 omg lol", "created_at": "2025-10-05T20:27:15", "owner": "ashley_rosies", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17902529889269831, "text": "Oh my gosh I would do the same 😂 I know that was so good to see him", "created_at": "2025-10-05T20:24:56", "owner": "wimberleyearp", "likes": 30}, {"id": 18540346513052139, "text": "😂 hilarious!", "created_at": "2025-10-05T20:16:29", "owner": "lilliesandlashes", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17963699369987947, "text": "Did he wash his clothes n' bedding at least? 😂😭", "created_at": "2025-10-05T20:10:13", "owner": "tavious_b", "likes": 109}, {"id": 17854378425546621, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-05T20:08:57", "owner": "_katies.korner_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18078624551043815, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-05T19:41:33", "owner": "hihi1277", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17965721807968838, "text": "You are too kind! 😮", "created_at": "2025-10-05T19:39:44", "owner": "noeliasurace", "likes": 11}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["college", "collegelife", "momsofinstagram", "funnymom", "momhumor", "momjokes", "mommemes"]},
{"media_id": 3784032699984860418, "shortcode": "DSDlbElD1UC", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DSDlbElD1UC/", "taken_at": "2025-12-09T20:24:58", "caption": "Documenting for my kids #explore #vietnamese #relatable #reels #hopecore", "owner_username": "clubclari", "owner_id": "406873111", "likes": 22797, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0013_DSDlbElD1UC\\DSDlbElD1UC_20251209_202458.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18397199062125041, "text": "Hi kid's it's dad here 😂❤️❤️🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-10T05:50:11", "owner": "jpat_s3nsai97", "likes": 608}, {"id": 18066937448454094, "text": "hii kids, it’s dad here. 🙋🏻", "created_at": "2025-12-11T13:25:10", "owner": "deep.x74", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18151051636426849, "text": "Hi mom", "created_at": "2025-12-10T17:53:27", "owner": "l4u6h4tmys3lf", "likes": 12}, {"id": 17903106009315596, "text": "*no one* - the wife in all the movies before proceeding to die", "created_at": "2025-12-10T00:10:04", "owner": "fred_gauss", "likes": 1232}, {"id": 18120802642533512, "text": "pretty cool idea wish i did this when i was younger. good thing im 32 single with no kids or prospects whatsoever. 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-11T00:40:55", "owner": "siraleckushington", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18412830313141573, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-09T23:20:04", "owner": "ggxn.zz", "likes": 336}, {"id": 17996087438852879, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-10T22:36:55", "owner": "stibenromerotorres", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18062991680210807, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-11T00:05:26", "owner": "chadsfolk", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17915630079091900, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-10T21:51:44", "owner": "lyruan__", "likes": 51}, {"id": 18153114871422662, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-10T16:29:22", "owner": "ryuken_7", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18086338535069038, "text": "Hi kid's it's stepdad here 👍", "created_at": "2025-12-10T10:39:27", "owner": "juliorizkita", "likes": 62}, {"id": 18005954612671379, "