{"media_id": 3784329873401616971, "shortcode": "DSEo_g5AJpL", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DSEo_g5AJpL/", "taken_at": "2025-12-10T06:26:52", "caption": "Here’s to the immigrants ✈️\n\nNo one prepares you for how hard it is to start life from 0. Moving to a new country and leaving your family behind. Having no job, no money, and no network. Trying to navigate how to get through all the paperwork. The endless obstacles and trials for trying to make life worth how hard you’re working. \n\nBut what no one can tell you is what it teaches you. It teaches you to always find a way. To not look for opportunities but to create them. You fight harder than everyone else for a good job because being able to earn money is a blessing when most people won’t hire you. And every day is a battle between how much you miss home but how much you want to stay here and make the most of what you have. \n\nBeing an immigrant from Australia my experience looks a lot different from most, but I can’t emphasise the struggles I faced on my own journey enough. Getting into college was a dream that seemed unreachable. Getting my first job that payed me $10 an hour was one of the best feelings in the world. Finally having enough money for a car after having to get everywhere by my bike and sometime wasting money on uber. All these struggles were blessings in disguise and I wouldn’t change them for the world ❤️\n\n#immigration #discipline #consistency #growth", "owner_username": "ellabeattie.fit", "owner_id": "508270754", "likes": 193888, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0014_DSEo_g5AJpL\\DSEo_g5AJpL_20251210_062652.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18087096154968163, "text": "They dont want these Jobs, they want to work as Doctors and Engineers without getting a degree", "created_at": "2025-12-11T14:14:33", "owner": "holaitsbasit", "likes": 44080}, {"id": 18052277159671954, "text": "Love you 🤍", "created_at": "2025-12-11T13:03:00", "owner": "urboykimi", "likes": 181}, {"id": 18095751226890945, "text": "What's your qualifications.?😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T11:20:57", "owner": "4rbaz._", "likes": 835}, {"id": 17938782126070011, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-11T07:25:16", "owner": "hayajump", "likes": 65}, {"id": 18012168767814885, "text": "Respect for all the people who are working these jobs and still surviving and studying as immigrants. Good days are coming.", "created_at": "2025-12-12T01:32:28", "owner": "the_hikerguy18", "likes": 7604}, {"id": 18136841587473338, "text": "So proud of you👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-11T09:39:51", "owner": "_skyee_11", "likes": 141}, {"id": 18088688380953322, "text": "Preach! We are not here to take jobs, but we are here to be assets in a country where our services are needed", "created_at": "2025-12-12T04:00:37", "owner": "aaron.the.rn", "likes": 163}, {"id": 18544851139065302, "text": "No one is an immigrant on stolen land 🤷‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-12-12T00:29:37", "owner": "bum4._.life", "likes": 5198}, {"id": 18100265854789306, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-12T22:00:15", "owner": "jon_jon679", "likes": 2335}, {"id": 17934480318122905, "text": "Locals are lazy 🤷🏽‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-12-11T18:03:22", "owner": "mahir.ibn.masud", "likes": 90}, {"id": 18067416860136540, "text": "True", "created_at": "2025-12-13T03:51:20", "owner": "lilmaniac666", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18104297929670022, "text": "Better days are coming for you all in Jesus name", "created_at": "2025-12-16T05:28:18", "owner": "_na.kai", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18073432757047570, "text": "You are literally the first one I saw that actually understands the problems and all that hard work it takes to start from literally 0 as an immigrant! \nHuge respect girl, jesus bless you ! ❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-12T07:59:35", "owner": "_itsz_ishika_", "likes": 20}, {"id": 18068951273110940, "text": "This 🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-11T18:06:49", "owner": "arushii_nagpal", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18088946272777132, "text": "So true 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T07:11:39", "owner": "fmistry_72", "likes": 89}, {"id": 18084598850030823, "text": "They don’t want to take our jobs. 😅", "created_at": "2025-12-11T12:23:21", "owner": "izzys.rojo", "likes": 237}, {"id": 17885954652410644, "text": "Imagine someone with no money, no language, and no family taking your job in your own country. How poor. 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-14T22:44:24", "owner": "2dosacero", "likes": 24}, {"id": 18087100808081646, "text": "I don’t see any Native Dutch applying in the company where I work, is a cleaning company", "created_at": "2025-12-12T16:02:06", "owner": "danivalent1702", "likes": 156}, {"id": 18025518776788294, "text": "“Inmigrants are taking our jobs” yet you won’t do the job they usually do", "created_at": "2025-12-14T00:05:11", "owner": "iosono.adri_", "likes": 31}, {"id": 17849459094609986, "text": "Me working as a electrician 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-12T17:29:05", "owner": "celiagiov", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17993925203900544, "text": "Problem is not immigration, problem is free handouts that ruin the economy!", "created_at": "2025-12-11T16:39:32", "owner": "doctorlienard", "likes": 139}, {"id": 18098520925832572, "text": "A total stranger with no family, no house, no connection getting job in your country then buddy you are the problem", "created_at": "2025-12-13T07:10:59", "owner": "nekoo._.paws", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18048436319446455, "text": "They can't cuz they preferred smoking meth and panhandle", "created_at": "2025-12-11T04:25:17", "owner": "katemlap12", "likes": 733}, {"id": 18079614848170407, "text": "If you lose your job to someone who made more efforts to be there and still faces the reality of being away from your family in a place so different from home and still fols you up you're the issue, he did his job and you're chugging beer wondering when you'll be an engineer with a total of 2 hours of studying per week", "created_at": "2025-12-14T15:38:41", "owner": "emaissour", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17990078075911570, "text": "Jobs is so 2006,  in 2025 it’s you’re stealing our house’s", "created_at": "2025-12-11T08:33:38", "owner": "tommybreen902017", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18555009319000778, "text": "Immigrants means Indians not you guys. You all are safe 🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-11T20:44:57", "owner": "nitin.bhatiaa", "likes": 527}, {"id": 17963802656863454, "text": "I bet you They cannot even do half of us…reason they need to get paid without working honestly no hate but this is the truth accept it or not", "created_at": "2025-12-11T22:04:56", "owner": "kaur_siim", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17906935422142131, "text": "They steal jobs because they have nowhere else to go, so the boss will always hire an immigrant who will work 14 hours a day instead of a local.", "created_at": "2025-12-14T03:23:33", "owner": "pedro.barszcz", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18497107303076028, "text": "Immigrants do the work that natives don't want to do.", "created_at": "2025-12-16T13:07:57", "owner": "bangtan.srs", "likes": 14}, {"id": 18372475444081289, "text": "you are white no hate for you😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T06:58:06", "owner": "amitneymar7", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18082994300472753, "text": "You are white, hate is not for you", "created_at": "2025-12-11T03:59:30", "owner": "___karandeepsingh___", "likes": 35}, {"id": 18099787105704035, "text": "Imagine failing to even get this job and blaming immigrants where’s this kind of jobs already they have scarcity to fill", "created_at": "2025-12-10T08:57:15", "owner": "versed.vision", "likes": 14175}, {"id": 18095128858702210, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-11T09:39:04", "owner": "jakethedog163", "likes": 2037}, {"id": 18076456340004687, "text": "“Immigrants are stealing our jobs” is the kind of excuse people use when they can’t face their own lack of effort. Think about it: an immigrant leaves their entire life behind, learns a new language from scratch, adapts to a completely different culture, starts at the bottom with no connections, no comfort zone, no safety net and still works hard enough to become more qualified for the same job you had every advantage for. If someone who arrived here not knowing the language can outlearn you, outwork you, outperform you, and outqualify you… the job wasn’t stolen. It was earned. The real question isn’t why immigrants get the job. It’s why someone who already had the language, the culture, the resources, the network and the head start still didn’t.", "created_at": "2025-12-11T23:44:53", "owner": "buselemanguristan", "likes": 5593}, {"id": 17929008543156703, "text": "No the immigrants are pushing down wages wake up lol", "created_at": "2025-12-11T18:09:11", "owner": "ivar.mentz", "likes": 15}, {"id": 18075532394249321, "text": "\"Immigrants are taking our jobs\" they they arent, you just don have any skills and you live with your parents 😍", "created_at": "2025-12-11T21:35:49", "owner": "i__hate__the__jews__", "likes": 30}, {"id": 17848403667616865, "text": "They just don't want to work like immigrants, but they aren't smart enough to be managers. So all they do is become unemployed and blame immigrants for all their problems.", "created_at": "2025-12-19T06:05:38", "owner": "ishumanitystillalivee", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18056624417320579, "text": "This is what I always thought, if you have the skills and expertise to do the job your country will not chose those immigrants to take over your “supposed” job. But people is nerdy enough to understand that.", "created_at": "2025-12-12T02:39:26", "owner": "shndrnncy", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18081314336137238, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-12T12:05:43", "owner": "prachii16__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085192417863104, "text": "Inspired.", "created_at": "2025-12-16T06:04:49", "owner": "xinan20._.04", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17919961890227057, "text": "Yeah, not like all Americans have or do work jobs like this already!!!", "created_at": "2025-12-13T05:41:00", "owner": "fadedcornbread", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085139708090078, "text": "I guarantee that they drove your wage down tho 😂 \n\nRemember only giant corporations benefit from immigration", "created_at": "2025-12-13T21:13:45", "owner": "just_fishing_bro", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17861853852549542, "text": "❤️✨", "created_at": "2025-12-12T00:48:43", "owner": "vinaychahal.22", "likes": 14}, {"id": 18338578336236556, "text": "Maybe white people could find a job if they didn’t spend their entire day being racist online", "created_at": "2025-12-13T19:36:04", "owner": "rvz.04", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18064835126447039, "text": "@mliezelp @innaaeh", "created_at": "2025-12-14T16:28:28", "owner": "ninalouve__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967216443843711, "text": "@juliicioso", "created_at": "2025-12-11T13:27:27", "owner": "_k.rivalsa", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18084540032018762, "text": "I think y’all shouldn’t be taking TEENAGERS jobs. But ok", "created_at": "2025-12-14T03:53:02", "owner": "itsjojo.dudes.14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903769003391100, "text": "Appreciating👏", "created_at": "2025-12-12T13:00:13", "owner": "_gursingh01", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18137085949474080, "text": "Acting like no locals work in these industries too. Girl", "created_at": "2025-12-11T16:53:57", "owner": "heytheresillyduck", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18079330985213016, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-12-11T20:24:17", "owner": "__shot__gun", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18033731735732043, "text": "Deport🇮🇳", "created_at": "2025-12-13T15:57:14", "owner": "radheshukla906", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18091159444750160, "text": "I can't imagine the smell 🇮🇳", "created_at": "2025-12-13T15:57:04", "owner": "radheshukla906", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076203635596338, "text": "Deport 🇮🇳", "created_at": "2025-12-13T15:56:57", "owner": "radheshukla906", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079291741946641, "text": "same here", "created_at": "2025-12-11T08:15:28", "owner": "bagusseikatsu", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18066402794532608, "text": "Ask them where they work so you can come and take that job too", "created_at": "2025-12-13T09:30:54", "owner": "fyv1207", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17906825235291205, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-11T04:56:18", "owner": "nahal.lexnoir", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18100599787695095, "text": "PLEASE❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-11T04:56:23", "owner": "nahal.lexnoir", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18040774946509923, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T04:26:08", "owner": "michael_rhuben", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17990979197913229, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-11T23:11:49", "owner": "the_junior_ferns", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18074017460461493, "text": "Fishing for validation", "created_at": "2025-12-11T06:18:00", "owner": "minibaobaopanda", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18084422507109034, "text": "Proud of you bro🙌🏼", "created_at": "2025-12-11T23:12:06", "owner": "the_junior_ferns", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095722642894757, "text": "They won’t work them until the business pay a “livable wage”😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T23:42:06", "owner": "gil_6_7", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18153661390413749, "text": "Well Well feeding some Grass to uneducateds😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T09:48:03", "owner": "tejaindiana", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18052129043663886, "text": "Thank you for this post. I have been living in the States, and I always treat all local U.S. citizens with respect and kindness. I am very grateful to be here and to live with my honor.\nSometimes I meet very valuable and kind people, and it makes me truly thankful to be in this country. And sometimes, unfortunately, I meet such different people that it makes me really sad, because I experience racism. But these things also happen in my own country — there are good people and very bad people as well, so I’m used to it.\nI just wanted to say these things. We are humans, and we are trying to work and build a life in faraway countries with our honor and dignity. 🙌🙌🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-11T19:11:46", "owner": "sahinmuenes", "likes": 9}, {"id": 17990342087739810, "text": "FR-", "created_at": "2025-12-10T09:21:53", "owner": "michaels.kingdom", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18144223822394887, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-12T00:24:15", "owner": "itzashleychoco", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070423316103600, "text": "Then get a job💔", "created_at": "2025-12-20T04:14:46", "owner": "i.feel_everything_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092187950490735, "text": "And also they are complaining they don't do anything", "created_at": "2025-12-19T21:14:42", "owner": "m.jachimczakk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900968449346863, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-19T20:58:55", "owner": "lisa_matvieievaa_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116796493505074, "text": "Cool!", "created_at": "2025-12-19T19:30:45", "owner": "satvinder__singh05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887548630280653, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-19T14:44:21", "owner": "samyamakolin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955619005018464, "text": "Dawg don't they want us to take their jobs 🥀😭", "created_at": "2025-12-19T14:29:14", "owner": "_akiandbasilplushie_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088918459975687, "text": "Right😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-19T14:04:52", "owner": "roland.dd__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870756424496092, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-19T13:15:26", "owner": "mxdeep970", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086138591109956, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-19T11:13:20", "owner": "nilimanabanitasen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086434793079391, "text": "🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-19T09:57:06", "owner": "preet237788", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100819018810344, "text": "And this shit got 19.4K followers ,,", "created_at": "2025-12-19T09:37:11", "owner": "dhaliwal7615", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050620847689220, "text": "Even in healthcare 😂 but honestly there's laziness in them. So why not? 🤷‍♀️ They are hiring 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-19T09:05:35", "owner": "itsmailafort", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18393808489135641, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-19T07:28:40", "owner": "mr.r.cali", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065804204182222, "text": "Legittt 💯", "created_at": "2025-12-19T06:10:04", "owner": "sauravv.shresthaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18354559579163626, "text": "US forgets that it was built by immigrants and still is. Take them out and all your tech and wall street can't do anything with all that money and programmers. . . The basic will remain ALWAYS. And people who work those basic jobs will always be crucial. Doctors, sanitation workers, retail workers, trade practitioners, FARMERS! Piss them off and no technology or money will save you", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:43:43", "owner": "_yellow_capsicum_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18441359596096312, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:24:14", "owner": "ankit_believe_usa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054008378354843, "text": "I did delivery for Amazon during winter time, 99% or staff are immigrants because Canadien don’t want do this job, they are always hiring so I tell them if they want work they can take it lol", "created_at": "2025-12-19T01:21:58", "owner": "brugobi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128879512503698, "text": "We need mass white migration", "created_at": "2025-12-19T01:16:14", "owner": "wolf.315962", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943524694066038, "text": "Leaving Australia for.... The USA?  Yeah.... Wouldn't advise un less youre rich af", "created_at": "2025-12-19T00:00:32", "owner": "wittypunhere", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082068245124690, "text": "Immigrants 😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T19:17:13", "owner": "fartuun7769", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982213365933498, "text": "Los Latinos llegamos a este país con ganas de aportar, con sueños y propósitos, y llevando siempre con nosotros nuestros valores de fe, familia y trabajo duro. ❤️‍🩹", "created_at": "2025-12-18T19:13:05", "owner": "elfuturoeslatino", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063423050232724, "text": "Bravo 👏", "created_at": "2025-12-18T17:33:36", "owner": "iamaabidar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052166492380578, "text": "💯", "created_at": "2025-12-18T16:38:39", "owner": "sachin_jassal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847786120604228, "text": "Bodrios unidos", "created_at": "2025-12-18T16:35:06", "owner": "ramirez_11xd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090770179752146, "text": "They can't because only immigrants are ready to work for slave wages", "created_at": "2025-12-18T16:27:25", "owner": "grrz110102", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136988884466388, "text": "Facts.🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-18T16:14:13", "owner": "akmalhayitboyev", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072219797621882, "text": "May be I steal u 😂❤", "created_at": "2025-12-18T15:19:55", "owner": "rohanthakur626", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547274191060902, "text": "Why I still find it racist lol the amount of immigrants who come are either very rich or very educated and qualified. And every higher position I see is immigrants doing the highest paid jobs. I see white people mostly doing these jobs.", "created_at": "2025-12-18T14:40:59", "owner": "tanzeelakh_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18423552805118885, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-18T11:15:52", "owner": "skkywalker1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085097147034911, "text": "That's why America keep saying if we don't hire people from India then, there will be another Microsoft in India. 🇮🇳", "created_at": "2025-12-18T10:24:26", "owner": "harshdeora_17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109624975722762, "text": "Sorry guys", "created_at": "2025-12-18T09:14:16", "owner": "dewiwdw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089597362985500, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-18T06:52:50", "owner": "chirag_makk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050224556406384, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-12-18T02:41:26", "owner": "soul__of__dream77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18551694043008239, "text": "PERIOD!!", "created_at": "2025-12-18T01:08:26", "owner": "k1lld4fl3sh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107836405726394, "text": "I find it odd talking about immigrants when you as an US Citizen(Besides a very small minority) are all immigrants wether from Europe, Africa or Asia", "created_at": "2025-12-18T00:45:32", "owner": "tiagojsf46", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029871002564518, "text": "Thing is you undercut the worth of our society. Canadians, Americans etc would do those jobs but multinational corporations bring you all in to drive our quality of life down and make us live in a way we arent accustomed to. We dont have 8 in a 2 bedroom house and live 4 generations together", "created_at": "2025-12-17T20:37:53", "owner": "justin506403", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966481528003632, "text": "They want EBT’s no jobs.", "created_at": "2025-12-17T18:16:38", "owner": "marsupial001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951525504924579, "text": "You can do that job as a legal immigrant also", "created_at": "2025-12-17T17:19:26", "owner": "j__mckane", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862325068477405, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-17T16:27:27", "owner": "juraybrd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100421323747686, "text": "They steal the jobs you can't get because of your sex offender records", "created_at": "2025-12-17T15:40:07", "owner": "rep_stann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928634470158659, "text": "They can't if thy could they would already have applied rather than talking shit on internet", "created_at": "2025-12-17T13:36:02", "owner": "dr.shivangi_rajpoot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066911813166851, "text": "First time? Look at Indonesia 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-17T12:14:28", "owner": "vnas_ix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050995367400449, "text": "Best ❤️🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-17T12:05:06", "owner": "manwiththeturban", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063479387632161, "text": "Jobs can't be stolen😂 they just need requirements", "created_at": "2025-12-17T11:11:12", "owner": "moon__huntress", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060466805284368, "text": "For the imigrants who coudn't make a their own shi8tholes from which u come to be better stfu.", "created_at": "2025-12-17T08:42:16", "owner": "raresoniciuc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096580186859056, "text": "Honestly immigrants are inspiring. You inspired me. I’ve been planning to move to Australia and I would like to know how did you manage to move to FL like what was the very first step or how did you actually get there if you don’t mind me asking", "created_at": "2025-12-17T06:27:59", "owner": "lexwerld", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545248483001572, "text": "❤️🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-17T06:19:07", "owner": "thinura_dinuwan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963816750863199, "text": "Yea they are . 1000% I’m a white American in south Florida . Most mechanic shops around here only hire bilingual workers or Spanish speaking only . It’s actually really difficult here as a white English only male . Not to say I haven’t gotten jobs but I definitely understand the racial bias of me not getting some jobs in Miami", "created_at": "2025-12-17T01:53:59", "owner": "christ.opherzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137206774470928, "text": "They've stole qualifications too😆", "created_at": "2025-12-17T01:20:59", "owner": "_prajzwal_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121599187481089, "text": "Worked these jobs as a fresh immigrant. Later, I became an attorney and started taking AMERICAN ONLY jobs 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-16T23:56:25", "owner": "varikette", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862622503543625, "text": "Thanks 🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-16T22:13:06", "owner": "________sherik_______", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053755130666918, "text": "Crazy thing called being hired", "created_at": "2025-12-16T20:12:25", "owner": "cigaretteflavored_water", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923769865054153, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-12-16T19:31:16", "owner": "walidazouzi99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088951585953566, "text": "The inmigrants do the job who nobody wants to do", "created_at": "2025-12-16T18:52:52", "owner": "lolaa_showgirl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18149065369381542, "text": "They not like us", "created_at": "2025-12-16T17:21:45", "owner": "vini.lucass", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918195289227324, "text": "Me working at the liquor store and some people be like “I could’ve made a much better employee” I’m like bro where’s your resume", "created_at": "2025-12-16T16:25:34", "owner": "_ricokambo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18153245806419649, "text": "If an immigrant, without knowing English, without family or contacts, \"steals\" your jobs,  Perhaps you are not qualified enough", "created_at": "2025-12-16T14:57:36", "owner": "nanaisth_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975251571959881, "text": "❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-16T13:55:48", "owner": "elaionearth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868726507501302, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-16T13:53:31", "owner": "thapaa_saurab", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969881370986732, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-16T10:01:40", "owner": "ssaenzprince", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081084104176767, "text": "Song name?", "created_at": "2025-12-16T08:56:30", "owner": "naka_1852", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843466210652005, "text": "As an immigrant, im so sorry, but our employers preffered “immigrant workers” than locals. We just came here abroad to find a new opportunity.", "created_at": "2025-12-16T06:53:08", "owner": "boo.ang04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110970037545244, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-12-16T06:15:16", "owner": "owb_jero", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923263996057506, "text": "Some white teen would've used that position as a means to get by.", "created_at": "2025-12-16T05:42:05", "owner": "luna997111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103330825666377, "text": "Preach", "created_at": "2025-12-16T05:09:10", "owner": "lv.zayan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927977446171905, "text": "There is such horrible staff shortages at my work, I would love to take a day off but instead I have to work 3 peoples shifts every day 😢😂", "created_at": "2025-12-16T04:41:56", "owner": "__seth____________", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099786283813118, "text": "W e love immigrants. Its illegal aliens we want to get rid of. Welcome.", "created_at": "2025-12-16T03:19:19", "owner": "joshuaportnof", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942869115961677, "text": "No. Immigrants take all the jobs that americans don't want.", "created_at": "2025-12-16T02:43:54", "owner": "dgarb.jxxn_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928614460171750, "text": "I would but no Hablo Ingles😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-15T20:52:09", "owner": "first2fightboxingclub", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18323387035173907, "text": "These people litterally think white people dont work", "created_at": "2025-12-15T20:52:08", "owner": "jake69492", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18162547480396624, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-15T19:12:54", "owner": "acmilan92829", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18323757919169785, "text": "It’s crazy to see someone who didn’t even finish high school talking about engineers and doctors and scientists… from another countries and blaming them for taking over jobs? 😂 bro go study and come work", "created_at": "2025-12-15T19:09:32", "owner": "isl.bous", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073477484593973, "text": "This post deserves to be shared over and over.", "created_at": "2025-12-15T18:50:58", "owner": "gracetulad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861339850553020, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-12-15T18:17:49", "owner": "ielenaalvarez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867487102513172, "text": "Immigrants are indians not whites", "created_at": "2025-12-15T16:00:12", "owner": "christ_is_lord_only", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18277826764304073, "text": "Brooo they don’t want to work, and say that immigrants r stealing their jobs 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-15T14:05:14", "owner": "kaio_cruz01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063407687200409, "text": "Exactly👏👏👏 quickly now. Come and get it.", "created_at": "2025-12-15T10:37:07", "owner": "erosrose18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126435817516576, "text": "If you think like if some Mexican who can't speak proper English have no friends or any family connections is stealing your job then you need to work hard on yourself", "created_at": "2025-12-15T09:38:52", "owner": "duke_of_lahore", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087168107048887, "text": "Actually you are the real immigrants, noone is local in America", "created_at": "2025-12-15T09:13:08", "owner": "abdulloh.liv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931389664016394, "text": "🫡", "created_at": "2025-12-15T08:59:00", "owner": "__raghav__1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103965901670690, "text": "Since the people like this, that make us have to make America great again", "created_at": "2025-12-15T07:25:58", "owner": "mcchikin_michael", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058230074315846, "text": "Unskilled immigrants working at low wage jobs so that the natives can exploit them are good immigrants.\n\nBut Indian immigrants who didn't study in your ivy leagues, and worked hard for high paying jobs and not getting exploited are bad immigrants.", "created_at": "2025-12-15T05:47:19", "owner": "11gkg09", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087023291046350, "text": "They can't last a day in these farms 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-15T04:53:42", "owner": "b_behishty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545395591027326, "text": "🖐🏻 people should also know that some companies hire immigrants and threaten their visa or threaten to deport them so they can under pay or otherwise horrible mistreat them. That happens OFTEN in this country. I've witnessed it. I've reported it. There are not enough legal protections for immigrants. Not at all. And it's wrong, especially for people who are willing to get licensed and work. They should have the right to do that without being mistreated by anyone.", "created_at": "2025-12-15T04:34:08", "owner": "servicedoghawaii21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072982199599407, "text": "❤️❤️🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-15T02:37:52", "owner": "thapaaa_gaurav", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062780936226767, "text": "Brown people stole all the \"I'm too white for this shit\" jobs away from white people", "created_at": "2025-12-15T02:32:29", "owner": "k3busu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18383584663197161, "text": "🙌🙌❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-15T02:03:57", "owner": "lazy_poet610", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926787544177389, "text": "No, but they live off welfare paid by your taxes. Also thats why your rent is so high…", "created_at": "2025-12-14T23:31:27", "owner": "aivarassutkus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984810618920238, "text": "They're literally building robots and I'd rather have the robots", "created_at": "2025-12-14T22:58:43", "owner": "nukluxklan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003018575836251, "text": "Gladly", "created_at": "2025-12-14T21:25:17", "owner": "oli_verleonard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083020159893784, "text": "So your illegal?", "created_at": "2025-12-14T19:48:35", "owner": "kingtoad4ever", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074199596029345, "text": "America lost all hope when they deported the Korean American veteran who was awarded the Purple Hearts award. Who would fight for a country that throws away wartime heroes like they’re damaged goods?", "created_at": "2025-12-14T18:49:56", "owner": "celine_poh_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18131846275501007, "text": "Took or doing", "created_at": "2025-12-14T18:14:26", "owner": "p1yuhx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904164892163652, "text": "mind you they came in and work the bare minimum wage (7.25 since 09) while working the most physically demanding jobs like farming , construction , and housekeeping . meanwhile most americans won’t pick an apple tree for 7.25 and hour and would constantly complain .", "created_at": "2025-12-14T17:55:54", "owner": "wh.ynotyounmetho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137068342476063, "text": "At my previous job, one before my current one, I first got reduced hours without a reason to then get get told I’d no longer work there due them to no longer needing me, I still speak to workers from that job and they told me a new none English speaker started the day after I “left” \n\nIf that isn’t my job being stole then idk what you call it", "created_at": "2025-12-14T17:28:22", "owner": "damien96carr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994256910895533, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-14T17:27:57", "owner": "skibidisigam67", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094588168903328, "text": "thanks for this fact check content 👏", "created_at": "2025-12-14T17:22:15", "owner": "dzekrok_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995394924714411, "text": "Keep hustling ❤️ 🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-14T16:58:59", "owner": "abishekgurung____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851156449567436, "text": "Another dude asf found out 🤡🤡🤡🤡", "created_at": "2025-12-14T16:29:54", "owner": "mr.good_btch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18344321839229008, "text": "Most of them want just want the money, not the work", "created_at": "2025-12-14T15:22:04", "owner": "anne_aethereia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081823556334785, "text": "The moment you leave your home, your life is your responsibility.\nYet we still separate ourselves by race and nationality, proving how easily we follow imposed rules instead of trusting our own judgment.", "created_at": "2025-12-14T15:18:10", "owner": "her_hidden.diary", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18414977944184712, "text": "Inmigrants are actually taking the jobs they don't want AND THEY STILL COMPLAIN", "created_at": "2025-12-14T15:05:13", "owner": "brunellagarciaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951586362922075, "text": "\"Immigrants are taking our jobs\" maybe they are bit more qualified than u", "created_at": "2025-12-14T14:31:54", "owner": "reems_rizz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088498753819800, "text": "This🙌🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-14T14:16:49", "owner": "lifeon.plate", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058635671310114, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-12-14T14:09:04", "owner": "lovely_hanjrah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935918746105618, "text": "Okay I will call 🧊", "created_at": "2025-12-14T13:35:16", "owner": "akhs__88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902626141326333, "text": "Imagine falling behind from people in YOUR LOCALITY. You ain't getting any right to blame, it's your place, you're supposed to shine there", "created_at": "2025-12-14T12:57:15", "owner": "monarch.sauvik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944510359084173, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-14T12:33:28", "owner": "blueptenopus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18432688216109756, "text": "Please take my washing dishes job too 😂 and taking care of customers in souvenir shop. I wanna see how long can you stay there. Lol", "created_at": "2025-12-14T12:16:36", "owner": "meilanyelizabeth135", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068397176380597, "text": "If you in your 1st world country loose a job battle to a 3rd world country guys, you are definitely doing something wrong 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-14T11:47:46", "owner": "all_x_are_under_st._reel_chuck", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062397065557194, "text": "2 months working as a berries picker, i never seen even one local picking berries, this job need no interview tho, they should come😅", "created_at": "2025-12-14T11:11:51", "owner": "elizfajarai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916913872235321, "text": "They Only Spread Hate", "created_at": "2025-12-14T11:04:34", "owner": "im_rahul618", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874155361460225, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-14T10:46:44", "owner": "vinnytribst", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060427928639313, "text": "How can  they be that big of a loser when a person came from a third world country(according to them)had to degree doesn't have home,doesn't have money still gets job but they dont😂", "created_at": "2025-12-14T10:04:21", "owner": "a._.s.a._.d_13_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085452470085189, "text": "Honestly the immigrants aren't the problem, the race is for people. Otherwise Whites in Australia and US would be required to move back as well 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-14T08:56:57", "owner": "foodieinawhoodie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545751343003765, "text": "You work the jobs that are SO bad  that if they where NOT filled my illegals those jobs would be better paid,more resources used", "created_at": "2025-12-14T08:49:27", "owner": "life_of_luk3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304923733249269, "text": "This is stolen land 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-14T07:35:41", "owner": "pty_sacred", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117956413566749, "text": "the immigrants they think stole their jobs are paid lower but work harder, multitasker, and the job like that they dont want to take it but still immigrants are still blamed.", "created_at": "2025-12-14T07:10:32", "owner": "mass.bro_m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545330758063286, "text": "So Is AI an immigrant?", "created_at": "2025-12-14T06:14:18", "owner": "eeplanc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050850314678689, "text": "They have no qualifications for anything and want good jobs", "created_at": "2025-12-14T05:49:03", "owner": "fullycorrectbeing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982175880940829, "text": "I have seen with my own eyes these local co workers sitting gossiping and complaining about work pay and benefits not being enough for them, while clients are out waiting and those ‘immigrants’ workers were helping the clients.\nI do know a lot of hardworking locals too, and they are my friends. \nSo just the lazy peeps better not blame anyone for their own laziness", "created_at": "2025-12-14T04:35:53", "owner": "cestlilynguyen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088237261946422, "text": "They want job without having any degree or qualifications😂", "created_at": "2025-12-14T03:34:56", "owner": "_jaiswal__adarsh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910180852266875, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-14T02:55:47", "owner": "toniotostino", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18548278648042698, "text": "Of they do this then how they will get money from Centerlink??😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-14T02:53:45", "owner": "ash_deswal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084619841327609, "text": "exactly bae🙌🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-14T02:53:08", "owner": "ash_deswal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065585006622481, "text": "Give me shit welding construction sea oil rig detailer  car work shop + painting working on any electronics stores I will take it", "created_at": "2025-12-14T01:53:23", "owner": "its___mexy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013845443804533, "text": "Ok", "created_at": "2025-12-14T01:38:24", "owner": "c_sivakasi_reddy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099377368795095, "text": "....a country so first class that no one wants to do dirty jobs hahahaha what a joke and now people who are in deep need works to such going lengths to earn honest jobs. Who are guilty, them or you???", "created_at": "2025-12-14T01:37:30", "owner": "lou_sha_bel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951597684922565, "text": "I met a British immigrant few months back. He migrated to Australia 30 years ago(i forgot exact date). Back then narrative was British were stealing our jobs.", "created_at": "2025-12-13T23:40:01", "owner": "shres009", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128139244502796, "text": "If an immigrant with no family support,  lack of language skills, and education level is able to steal your job, then you are a lazy stupid fuck . They aren't the problem its you..", "created_at": "2025-12-13T23:21:12", "owner": "z30825205", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865918735528969, "text": "🔥🔥❤️👏👏love it yessss", "created_at": "2025-12-13T22:35:45", "owner": "bkfamily2018", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927978385170404, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-13T22:31:46", "owner": "thais.vernon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085241849021244, "text": "Get out on them 95° fields for 5$ an hour maga, show what you voted for!❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-13T22:09:31", "owner": "fvckintha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148030795427532, "text": "🫶🏼", "created_at": "2025-12-13T22:07:46", "owner": "mr.yoca", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846898075607412, "text": "\"They're taking our jobs!\" Jobs that you don't ever apply for?🤨", "created_at": "2025-12-13T21:51:02", "owner": "dawnofplumeria", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116475634566491, "text": "Hell no, you can pay illegals less than minimum wage and withhold their pay when you feel like it, what they gonna do, grass them selves up for working illegally 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-13T20:51:51", "owner": "chris_b_10101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842965402641676, "text": "Correction immigrants are fine just Muslims that ruin it", "created_at": "2025-12-13T20:30:18", "owner": "frojack", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846912058606224, "text": "If an immigrant can move here, don't know native language , have no connections, no family, friends..and still is able to “steal your job” then maybe you’re an unqualified silly little idiot", "created_at": "2025-12-13T19:37:59", "owner": "ritikgupta_0305", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18049242527428394, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-13T19:33:52", "owner": "chillkarmoiz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862041526477718, "text": "Stop undercutting americans.", "created_at": "2025-12-13T19:30:01", "owner": "pennsylvaniagunrights", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17981534075780203, "text": "Immigrants aren't stealing any jobs. Employers are the ones choosing them over you.", "created_at": "2025-12-13T19:13:18", "owner": "boxxxc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926185231162942, "text": "immigrants create jobs not stealing any shit", "created_at": "2025-12-13T18:30:06", "owner": "bratone1_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18103316554678954, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T18:18:53", "owner": "jaylowbabe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842891173645628, "text": "I don't think you understand. You won't get any more work and they will do it for less money than you.", "created_at": "2025-12-13T18:01:27", "owner": "bohemian_venom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924444025194149, "text": "Where I live teens can’t even get jobs because of them", "created_at": "2025-12-13T17:59:42", "owner": "sweetlemons_04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088408663980506, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T17:58:53", "owner": "exparisii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137510296461969, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-13T17:44:54", "owner": "mr_avvi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903664633331834, "text": "Trust me in Canada it's 10x worse than ur stupid country you can't get any basic job as a teen anymore unless you do co-op at school", "created_at": "2025-12-13T16:56:40", "owner": "nr.stackzzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077443969982580, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-13T16:44:46", "owner": "rahul._.kp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062877965562204, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-13T16:43:00", "owner": "he.lin_777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067994651428759, "text": "Im sending love !!!🙌🏾🙌🏾🙌🏾🙌🏾🙌🏾🙌🏾❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️👏courage", "created_at": "2025-12-13T16:37:33", "owner": "shelby_xv1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126187138515500, "text": "Thing is . They woulnt hire me cuz i would ask a decent wage. While imigrants usually accept minimum wages or even less . Sooo there you go", "created_at": "2025-12-13T15:55:45", "owner": "shadowthedog666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101146165616156, "text": "I work as a security in central rome.Italy, and you're not gonna believe me.My country never find italian people who want to do the job.It's literally f****** sitting in the car for twelve hours.You can do it 8 hours it's always the immigrant even working for a hundred dollars a week.They don't go and say, oh, we need health insurance.We need fourteen payments a year.We need pay vacations, blah, blah type s***, just stop complaining and get the f*** up", "created_at": "2025-12-13T14:49:39", "owner": "its_ahmad_65", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100617181701674, "text": "You are not muslims or muslim immigrants, so you are safe 🏌🏽", "created_at": "2025-12-13T14:44:33", "owner": "thebang.li", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085260781865531, "text": "The worst part is knowing you have potential in your own country, that you have postgraduate studies and a bachelor's degree, and not being able to get a suitable job because of your English. But for now, we'll make do with what we have.", "created_at": "2025-12-13T14:43:47", "owner": "joliveramanda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017286155630878, "text": "They don't want immigrants but they don't work on constructions or anything that requires physical work! They are funny after!😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-13T14:35:49", "owner": "todd.8_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072494990458467, "text": "no hay inmigrantes en un país robado", "created_at": "2025-12-13T14:34:51", "owner": "nooctivago", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855882127579792, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T14:33:21", "owner": "manisran_647", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959060017011027, "text": "Yeah bro, alright. Have you ever considered upgrading your skills so you could take the place instead? \n\nOops, you were too busy complaining what the govt. should do, instead of actually knowing the world is competitive, more than the skill based Call of Duty match.", "created_at": "2025-12-13T14:16:09", "owner": "v12natural", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079183481601487, "text": "Exactly! When i worked as delivery and car washign in germany. I said the same! STOP YAPPING AND GET MY JOB THEN.", "created_at": "2025-12-13T13:59:29", "owner": "asid.abd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009520811813997, "text": "You’re why women shouldn’t vote. Suicidal compassion and ignorance of white genocide", "created_at": "2025-12-13T13:54:17", "owner": "topgoy420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304717966264565, "text": "When you come legal there is nothing locals can do except be better than them", "created_at": "2025-12-13T13:22:41", "owner": "puleesha_kuru", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903991378165850, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-13T12:43:20", "owner": "rahmahassen1234", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18305635675271072, "text": "So u telling me a ur country company gonna leave u, u speak they company lenguage and u are educated and they gonna choose a inmigrant that deosnt speak they leanguage", "created_at": "2025-12-13T12:39:45", "owner": "the_ismail_em", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930985360145880, "text": "Great msg 👍", "created_at": "2025-12-13T12:28:49", "owner": "jaswant_sudda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968895672833099, "text": "We referring to southern Asians", "created_at": "2025-12-13T11:48:56", "owner": "microwavedfly16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089766067982766, "text": "Right answer, wrong person", "created_at": "2025-12-13T11:38:02", "owner": "sandeep_0378", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954357901022043, "text": "Exactly", "created_at": "2025-12-13T11:16:28", "owner": "valhkyuu.jpg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928548280156973, "text": "Dude I wish they were stealing jobs. Nowadays they just steal. (Of course not everyone)", "created_at": "2025-12-13T10:48:07", "owner": "ilfede.07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088604005956677, "text": "👏❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-13T10:20:59", "owner": "anandhu_v_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18554167501008318, "text": "Bravoooooo 👏", "created_at": "2025-12-13T10:12:48", "owner": "mimo_el_saadaoui_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104550493664405, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-13T09:52:02", "owner": "milankc_010897", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113449483592643, "text": "Good work , hopefully others will follow", "created_at": "2025-12-13T09:29:34", "owner": "deepak.bhardwaj.961", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18183464710359246, "text": "Just go back to your country, damnit, immigrants only make things difficult for local residents, spend tax money on aid every month, commit crimes, and most of them come just to join liberal campaign demonstrations without wanting to work, go back to your country, ask the government and president in your country to open job vacancies,", "created_at": "2025-12-13T09:06:56", "owner": "r98497rrr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103826815682046, "text": "Well done! Proud of you!! I came to the UK as an international student. Did my studies sincerely. Worked part time during term time. Full time during breaks. Took whatever worked was offered. Factories, tills, cleaning toilets, feeding farm animals, etc. These jobs are tough but available. Eventually landed a corporate job of my dream. I am more humble and grounded than proud about who I am as my journey was enriching and I learned a lot on the way. Still learning. Uncontrolled immigration is a problem, but at the same time it is a fact that western countries will not survive without immigrants", "created_at": "2025-12-13T09:00:29", "owner": "karlosxix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089040572000568, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T08:20:27", "owner": "tajsingh904", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18333558271215155, "text": "locals are poor 😂 in their own land hahaahahah nobs 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-13T07:23:21", "owner": "hawaldar_muthiya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072809921525720, "text": "Don't worry you are safe. They are only pissed when the immigrants are not white", "created_at": "2025-12-13T07:13:00", "owner": "kirkigga", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18545081128051958, "text": "The same people making that comment don’t care about AI taking our jobs 😬🤨", "created_at": "2025-12-13T07:05:39", "owner": "slab_blab", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18400186540125364, "text": "❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-13T06:49:29", "owner": "sanket_parshivnikar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904271374297596, "text": "I think u r not  Aboriginal Australians , go back Britain and Europe where your ancestors came from", "created_at": "2025-12-13T06:12:47", "owner": "harsher_maan99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082083167153734, "text": "👏🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-13T06:04:28", "owner": "hiteshree_2604", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932328607118879, "text": "Accusing an immigrant for stealing a job is just an excuse for laziness and hate", "created_at": "2025-12-13T05:14:49", "owner": "reggyyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091491718936109, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-13T04:49:31", "owner": "11.susmita_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077798033466835, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-13T04:33:55", "owner": "is350_harie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18249628567294604, "text": "Just stop glorifying skill issues 🥀", "created_at": "2025-12-13T04:18:32", "owner": "dev.tomar09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995503416715828, "text": "Their not taking anyone's job Americans r lazy their r a certain few who r not but most r", "created_at": "2025-12-13T04:00:33", "owner": "santa_muerte580", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857045029574404, "text": "That's kind of funny cuz literally this is the jobs that white people don't want to do because if you think about it if you think about it like this like a food pyramid on the work industry pyramid who's on the top and who's on the bottom white people don't want to do the bottom jobs they want to be the ones on the top controlling the bottom jobs nobody's stealing jobs from you you just want to be on the top controlling the bottom", "created_at": "2025-12-13T03:48:14", "owner": "dark._romance.3557", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951336648916601, "text": "I'm pretty sure not a single white person/republican here in the US has ever thought you're an immigrant. For them the only illegals and immigrants are POC", "created_at": "2025-12-13T03:23:51", "owner": "antonietavillegasss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081694049159518, "text": "You stole hearts 😍", "created_at": "2025-12-13T03:10:38", "owner": "mansiii_thikekar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985843173916396, "text": "and its alwayss the redneckk inbred trump supporters that never went to college 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-13T03:10:04", "owner": "sion.aim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18436799926107398, "text": "You DUMB FUCKIN BITCH the reason why immigrants are hired to work those jobs is because employers know they can underpay them. There's a reason why some people want more immigrants: cheap labor force with no rights. Pay people proper wages and a lot of natives would do those same jobs. DUMB BITCH", "created_at": "2025-12-13T03:02:33", "owner": "franklisciandro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102687070808615, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-13T02:38:56", "owner": "thevisasgirl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147775285428780, "text": "This IS the truth of most country's immigration policies. They hire us for jobs we are obviously qualified for... And also jobs the locals are too proud to do.", "created_at": "2025-12-13T02:09:54", "owner": "doggo.in.the.hills", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895613980225891, "text": "You are white as shit", "created_at": "2025-12-13T02:03:14", "owner": "brockster4.6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146805382453752, "text": "Soon i am coming for that too", "created_at": "2025-12-13T01:38:46", "owner": "donald_trumpp_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044513657693277, "text": "👏❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-13T01:06:14", "owner": "nimeka97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102277309684206, "text": "❤️❤️‍🩹", "created_at": "2025-12-13T01:00:03", "owner": "pariss_san", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004566368828531, "text": "Dont they get it? YOU ARE NOT QUALIFIED SO THE JOBS ARE BEING OUTSOURCED", "created_at": "2025-12-13T00:54:39", "owner": "slim_jong_uuh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061918886246735, "text": "They're applying don't worry", "created_at": "2025-12-13T00:51:36", "owner": "vinyldiariesfm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18172932541373102, "text": "Local youth is too busy getting high under bridges, living on streets in a tent living off of benefits and using it for their addiction.", "created_at": "2025-12-13T00:44:46", "owner": "bappidyboop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882849373423773, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-13T00:36:58", "owner": "yours_mahip", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096018130868466, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-13T00:26:54", "owner": "arlynandcaleb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18372353587155416, "text": "Such retarded shit. If the migrant has it and is under hiting u. Tegn what just kill the migrant say this job is mine", "created_at": "2025-12-13T00:20:03", "owner": "janteigensen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090193522756997, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-13T00:01:43", "owner": "gillxmatrix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18370617424094082, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-12T23:51:58", "owner": "amana_212_yes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18236783371306942, "text": "Also people dont understand that immigrants like any people who was born in a country create MORE jobs because we all buying food, renting housing, using public transportation and etc", "created_at": "2025-12-12T23:40:37", "owner": "3eee_boy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18246194788289159, "text": "🙌👏👏❤️🥹", "created_at": "2025-12-12T23:38:54", "owner": "sunshinealvrz11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080768326919599, "text": "❤️❤️🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-12T23:20:50", "owner": "_vinay_sagu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118132219491657, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-12-12T23:15:43", "owner": "gaby_cartaya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18550558813015403, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-12T22:35:41", "owner": "blue_swallowtailbutterfly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910726216270232, "text": "I wouldnt mind to get you", "created_at": "2025-12-12T21:49:28", "owner": "myo_samuels", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012310709808691, "text": "I'm an immigrant and this has nothing to do with immigrants it's an invasion of a subhuman species in the name of islam looking to eradicate western civilization.", "created_at": "2025-12-12T20:44:31", "owner": "alexjaupi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111380458609491, "text": "✅", "created_at": "2025-12-12T20:02:02", "owner": "raquel_sot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087103894998243, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-12T19:56:51", "owner": "wyld_westie_nc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18372600943159231, "text": "NO ONE IS AN IMMIGRANT ON STOLEN LAND! LETS SAY IT LITTLE BIT LOUD FOR THE PEOPLE IN THE BACK 🇲🇽", "created_at": "2025-12-12T19:55:20", "owner": "marias.o9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108060424724132, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-12T19:54:03", "owner": "gtametalwork", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099321238751874, "text": "I could not agree more 💪", "created_at": "2025-12-12T19:50:00", "owner": "audrey.dng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037053506720942, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-12T19:49:32", "owner": "hey.gurjot_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079844839914091, "text": "FOR REAL!!! ❤️❤️👏", "created_at": "2025-12-12T19:45:12", "owner": "tracy._ha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094906417716395, "text": "It's a shame for you then😂", "created_at": "2025-12-12T19:28:07", "owner": "meraal0.1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18436376332109354, "text": "🫶🏻🫶🏻😝", "created_at": "2025-12-12T19:26:55", "owner": "is.mo.1.1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097322044889973, "text": "And who did them before you got here ? Someone must have? Fuck off....oh wow I cant iron a bedsheets? Useless. Oh I can throw out a trash bag in a compactor? Want a cookie ? Fuck off.", "created_at": "2025-12-12T18:59:48", "owner": "bptypagurl44", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979075191949230, "text": "You dont understand the problem. The problem is that job are low paid because someone will take. They need to raise the paid. But you are here so ceo are happy to keep low paid ;)", "created_at": "2025-12-12T18:46:25", "owner": "max_mercier06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125408830519570, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-12T18:44:04", "owner": "randeepkahlon1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903468433314295, "text": "come work under the sun full 8 hours, building the same house where you wife is cheating on you", "created_at": "2025-12-12T18:27:32", "owner": "asap.tape_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065187374438041, "text": "Stealing what job? Construction? Carpentry? Nurse? Cook?", "created_at": "2025-12-12T17:42:57", "owner": "bndct.cnt.sleep", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117480448574267, "text": "This video reminded me of when I was student in London and working hard as well. While paying thousands on uni! Now they tell us get out!!! It’s insane how they judge us without even trying to understand!", "created_at": "2025-12-12T17:26:35", "owner": "zaraaa777333", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18516156442070762, "text": "Proud of you! Hope you will succeed in life more!!! <3", "created_at": "2025-12-12T17:20:11", "owner": "_bedbugg_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859631359558367, "text": "❤️❤️🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-12T17:06:40", "owner": "dank_sigma_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062591921219668, "text": "No one on earth should have to compete with the entire globe for a job in their own country. The whole \"hustle harder bro\" is capitalist nonsense.", "created_at": "2025-12-12T16:15:14", "owner": "pressley6_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540179209053675, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-12T16:10:02", "owner": "nisibakes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077112658986243, "text": "lol true, i have done some works that if i tell my parents i am easily homeless", "created_at": "2025-12-12T16:09:56", "owner": "pxrth.shxrmx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091293425313631, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-12T16:04:25", "owner": "liesminaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874720663458697, "text": "“And probably will be for life” is soo fitting here", "created_at": "2025-12-12T15:42:08", "owner": "s.tkayy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075233366256392, "text": "No hate but we don't force you guys to stay at home or. Lock your doors. Comon guys came outside and compete with us fair and square. Don't blame us.  Earn qualifications like us", "created_at": "2025-12-12T15:40:50", "owner": "_himanshu_raj2007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067372211150845, "text": "You forgot the word,\" illegal\"", "created_at": "2025-12-12T15:11:55", "owner": "ichibanjohn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18551250559040943, "text": "Locals love benefits", "created_at": "2025-12-12T15:09:02", "owner": "vikasjalalkuncha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134886994488740, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-12-12T15:06:57", "owner": "nitin_sharma_records", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059099444281107, "text": "“Immigrants are stealing our jobs!!” No Emily, they worked for 3 degrees while you peaked in Highschool and the others are doing what none of you want to do", "created_at": "2025-12-12T14:53:21", "owner": "iqratatouille", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092735695734802, "text": "lots of love and respect❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-12T14:43:00", "owner": "nxoor_____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087496226048751, "text": "If the immigrants are taking your jobs then you are not qualified enough.", "created_at": "2025-12-12T14:39:18", "owner": "_aayush._46", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114179440608741, "text": "Exacly just made 9 hours of cleaning today for my hotel company don’t have any brits there", "created_at": "2025-12-12T14:26:45", "owner": "domiciano9011", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18140908105458887, "text": "Why are you non whites begging so hard to live among white people", "created_at": "2025-12-12T14:15:22", "owner": "yurii_eu01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121166038539610, "text": "They stealing from the Europeans? They can go back", "created_at": "2025-12-12T14:02:09", "owner": "whoisdisreally", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092884054927784, "text": "...", "created_at": "2025-12-12T13:57:14", "owner": "kamla_saleem_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065537543440340, "text": "No seriously. The backbone of our country is immigrants and it always has been (since it was colonized). Its literally how our country was founded. Most wht people don’t want to do these jobs and yet complain about them being “stolen”. Gtfoh", "created_at": "2025-12-12T13:52:17", "owner": "marigoldmeadowhomestead", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857403646569143, "text": "Stealing our job😂if they can steal ur job by being in a very difficult situation then u are not qualified for that job in the first place", "created_at": "2025-12-12T13:39:48", "owner": "foozhan_8888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026291939589676, "text": "The problem was never immigrants darling, im son of immigrants who came legally, its about coming the correct way", "created_at": "2025-12-12T12:52:09", "owner": "nahwaybee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091206943938816, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-12T12:35:32", "owner": "____nisam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087347198073201, "text": "If you treat jobseeking as competition then you need to be capable to compete. If you are not, then its not the fault of people whos capable of it", "created_at": "2025-12-12T12:25:00", "owner": "shelike.daisy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18548558992011244, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-12T12:13:40", "owner": "onlyamantsekhon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080122753915953, "text": "👏🙌proud with you!fucking EU poor mind people", "created_at": "2025-12-12T12:02:38", "owner": "oilsmillers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969450777985769, "text": "Girl 🫡", "created_at": "2025-12-12T11:52:39", "owner": "imhksingh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18200252155324321, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-12T11:51:54", "owner": "garimathakur2018", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901086901184310, "text": "Thanks ❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-12T11:08:48", "owner": "soa_sam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18392347366182847, "text": "Stealing a continent, Still on Top🧑🏻‍💻👹🫵🏻", "created_at": "2025-12-12T11:07:45", "owner": "khamindersingh95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088960102796408, "text": "Management has actively been recorded denying whither kids saying they will just be lazy I call the past generation lazy for giving up on us as a generation like go get a job nobodys gonna wanna train you to do", "created_at": "2025-12-12T10:58:15", "owner": "yyc.penguin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304938658267519, "text": "where do you work? which country? i'll come!", "created_at": "2025-12-12T10:56:07", "owner": "chreeztho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098687218656366, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-12-12T10:55:08", "owner": "amy_aswathy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085515848078677, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-12T10:28:42", "owner": "karenarrej_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080136271941462, "text": "Study hard come steal ours too", "created_at": "2025-12-12T10:18:01", "owner": "yohgirl5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076862615463427, "text": "Companies are replacing people with AI yet blame immigrants for people getting fired !", "created_at": "2025-12-12T10:13:57", "owner": "a98j0724", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045535184702104, "text": "They arent leaving family behind. They are sending dollars back home to build their houses. They get ebt and free healthcare. They are also getting ss numbers to collect retirement while they retire in their own countries. Paid under the table to evade ice. Wake tf up.", "created_at": "2025-12-12T08:10:17", "owner": "a.r.mcmanus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006991808666765, "text": "Here too! Like the ones who were called “citizen and born here” are choosy to work. Smh", "created_at": "2025-12-12T08:01:50", "owner": "m_crisvpacis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18353009452207175, "text": "🙌❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-12T07:41:47", "owner": "kaurpreet57__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842748973646138, "text": "❤️❤️🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-12T06:57:20", "owner": "_deol47_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075285137263261, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-12T06:24:53", "owner": "sarahdelevige789", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108026086715695, "text": "They just talk expect working", "created_at": "2025-12-12T06:22:08", "owner": "it.s_puneet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910647979263820, "text": "I'll steal yr heart too 😍 😘", "created_at": "2025-12-12T06:10:27", "owner": "pre.ttybig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057981851660996, "text": "Girl slay!👏", "created_at": "2025-12-12T06:08:46", "owner": "alwenankhan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106208818642166, "text": "ICE WHERE U AT I CALL THE $2,000", "created_at": "2025-12-12T06:05:25", "owner": "matanhooper22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085946417106025, "text": "Are you illegal then?", "created_at": "2025-12-12T06:04:59", "owner": "matanhooper22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18177650440324088, "text": "Illegal aliens take away opportunities from legal immigrants <——- this here", "created_at": "2025-12-12T06:03:44", "owner": "nightfins230", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953018053025346, "text": "Do it in your own country. Also you are just throwing trash away.", "created_at": "2025-12-12T06:02:54", "owner": "milchamario", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933544927136123, "text": "Ha ha true 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-12T05:57:22", "owner": "love_saini_99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076485440350664, "text": "So sad 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-12T05:57:05", "owner": "_.kanishhkk._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092613646901922, "text": "🙌❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-12T05:56:12", "owner": "allahuddiankhilji", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111096094716610, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-12T05:54:56", "owner": "_bomb_aayyeeee_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067250423139801, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-12T05:51:34", "owner": "qandeelbotham", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929736163079628, "text": "No job is smaller.", "created_at": "2025-12-12T05:42:55", "owner": "itssmeyaas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18185341807349216, "text": "Immigrant work only for surviving", "created_at": "2025-12-12T05:41:04", "owner": "andi_nino_wirawan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148041388440912, "text": "They take all qualifications 😡", "created_at": "2025-12-12T05:39:20", "owner": "birr1kann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032373734756236, "text": "Kalau di Indo banyak TKA China kiriman Jokowow wkwk", "created_at": "2025-12-12T05:39:14", "owner": "itsmuhsuryarizal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18342127087228978, "text": "For me personally it was never about yall having the jobs it was about literally taking a piss on our laws and telling people its ok to.just ignore our countries laws.  I get life is hard and shit but if you come here legally I will literally buy you a beer.", "created_at": "2025-12-12T05:35:47", "owner": "phantom_kingdom5456", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858006934510907, "text": "You’re a real one for this 🫶", "created_at": "2025-12-12T05:34:57", "owner": "manavwasson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047600798698105, "text": "If we remove sarcasm from this video, this is the actual job that you are qualified to do💁", "created_at": "2025-12-12T05:29:25", "owner": "shamik1313", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065065910631438, "text": "Taking away their jobs ❌ local people skill issue ✅", "created_at": "2025-12-12T05:11:54", "owner": "_arkeofilo_0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075643487213847, "text": "These uneducated with no qualification are saying that well educated immigrants took their job 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-12T05:09:58", "owner": "_arkeofilo_0", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17898289428199340, "text": "Good one !!", "created_at": "2025-12-12T05:08:43", "owner": "sahil___sachdeva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079227152266401, "text": "Lib whore die", "created_at": "2025-12-12T05:06:33", "owner": "jfk80879", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072773507605461, "text": "Well said 🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-12T05:05:48", "owner": "fairy_elliy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864232009453521, "text": "They want immigrant jobs only if it pays $100 an hour 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-12T05:04:04", "owner": "tommy_aparicio_mdcclxxvi_5.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935466067132170, "text": "🔥🙌❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-12T04:54:08", "owner": "that_mohitrajput", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090069901763796, "text": "And you forgot to mention that they get paid a shitty salary for a 8 + work shift…", "created_at": "2025-12-12T04:53:29", "owner": "andrea_alf.aro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876238843451395, "text": "Immigrants ofc stealing jobs cz they work hard asf with harsh rules and no complaints 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-12T04:38:46", "owner": "anywaysiamabdullah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064976816548051, "text": "Illegal immigrant", "created_at": "2025-12-12T04:28:18", "owner": "togu.pasrib", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973500759968556, "text": "What's the point of moving to another country when your own country suffers 😂you develop your country not others.", "created_at": "2025-12-12T04:26:04", "owner": "latenightideology", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088473637986124, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-12T04:23:09", "owner": "bebika.__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088529462491400, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-12T04:21:33", "owner": "abnercoronado.jpg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086777471079267, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-12T04:17:52", "owner": "ravviii_shah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932313793118734, "text": "Sadly, in California, where I live, the illegals are actually taking the jobs we need. You may not believe me and that's perfectly fine but I've seen illegals be truckers, people in healthcare, like doctors and nurses, and even regular cashiers.", "created_at": "2025-12-12T04:11:01", "owner": "licklllmaballs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092289373920655, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-12T04:00:24", "owner": "samrachana_thapa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18415786855143247, "text": "It's not about jobs. It's about not going through the process for legal citizenship. It slaps the face of those people who went through the legal process", "created_at": "2025-12-12T03:57:56", "owner": "chrisinsocalif", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075022010521217, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-12T03:53:46", "owner": "yoenie_ryu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854287627590229, "text": "they hate us cz they aint us", "created_at": "2025-12-12T03:37:26", "owner": "doz1s_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061098593269269, "text": "That's the thing they don't want to do basic jobs but straight want top posts without any skill. Oh I'm sorry I got my medical degree when I was 22 and my PG degree when 24. What you were doing till 24? Then they say \"I was exploring the world and possibilities\". Yeah now explore the reality of jobs.", "created_at": "2025-12-12T03:27:30", "owner": "dr_peace_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047829326461741, "text": "Why u ironing", "created_at": "2025-12-12T03:21:58", "owner": "tongari732", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864178192456708, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-12-12T03:14:56", "owner": "jaskarn.jawanda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091462985309107, "text": "❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-12T03:08:03", "owner": "shrutii_deyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18548316568027882, "text": "Yes everyone studied master's phd doctors engeneers thn how will you get the job 200 years back your people are also immigrants", "created_at": "2025-12-12T02:59:08", "owner": "sureshboyar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147910714438655, "text": "Let me correct this on one thing you aren't an illegal so your post is fully invalid also illegal immigrants do steal all the jobs because they work for under minimum wage so people would rather pay twice less and get twice as much work so they slave your family they slave away your mom's and dads congrats you are encouraging industrial slavery", "created_at": "2025-12-12T02:59:08", "owner": "crab05king05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105853978579693, "text": "Ai is gonna take our jobs", "created_at": "2025-12-12T02:58:37", "owner": "cringe_paradise", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872488450488411, "text": "@icegov", "created_at": "2025-12-12T02:48:46", "owner": "quin_.ab", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107340997651369, "text": "If you say that immigrants are taking jobs,go get your f pants and do the job they do, you Europeans are Lazy as F", "created_at": "2025-12-12T02:47:58", "owner": "ronaldcmejia23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050239214410868, "text": "No offense but when they’re talking about immigrants, they’re talking about brown people. We’re the intended audience. Others, yes can be immigrants from other countries and can be deported but brown people are the ones being severely targeted, affected, and harassed. Etc but yes I understand your point too!", "created_at": "2025-12-12T02:46:04", "owner": "jaythemexican", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958182987891791, "text": "FOR REAAAAL!! Are they willing to? Bet nah👏👏👏 you’re fire girl🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-12T02:25:01", "owner": "berightb4ck", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104968681676679, "text": "The homeless should start working for a home", "created_at": "2025-12-12T02:18:22", "owner": "jah.ear_143", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18193641619333610, "text": "One of the loveliest post👏", "created_at": "2025-12-12T02:10:51", "owner": "sthamanesh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070441388607287, "text": "For real! Do it!", "created_at": "2025-12-12T02:09:42", "owner": "lauc_999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080096444167549, "text": "Does anyone understand this?", "created_at": "2025-12-12T02:09:38", "owner": "riderchallenger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18168525964376464, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-12T02:07:24", "owner": "maklok_limbu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889629769259798, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-12T01:44:36", "owner": "xristtinavassev_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18551596939046915, "text": "You keep working for cheaper than what they should pay that's the problem", "created_at": "2025-12-12T01:37:32", "owner": "himynameisethanhunter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053600855669370, "text": "Smart lady", "created_at": "2025-12-12T01:27:38", "owner": "solitaryssv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18321944470174061, "text": "Simple as this, get off your ass and do your jobs, and we won’t be here, don’t act like we come here to relax, it’s from one chore to another, we’re only allowed here because there’s work non of yall entitled arse are willing to do", "created_at": "2025-12-12T01:23:14", "owner": "onvibe_ig", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18049040261439123, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-12T01:20:57", "owner": "maniipawan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18413295976136864, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-12T01:12:37", "owner": "padutchgrandma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894791446364096, "text": "🔥🙌👏", "created_at": "2025-12-12T01:02:14", "owner": "dimmy_64", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083443684886209, "text": "You don't think not immigrants clean tables and throw out trash? Seriously though, you really think anybody is concerned about legal immigrants?", "created_at": "2025-12-12T00:56:59", "owner": "calm2chaos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18234167437305531, "text": "*******illegal immigrants", "created_at": "2025-12-12T00:55:18", "owner": "nonerain_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099997732768338, "text": "They won’t 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-12T00:32:23", "owner": "aigvv__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921451084208926, "text": "You motivated today to kick start my gym after work as an international student ….", "created_at": "2025-12-12T00:23:17", "owner": "fuckingfax", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052695431364099, "text": "Shed really rather have no way to pay her bills than do the work we all go through, these people can vote and are why voting should require IQ tests", "created_at": "2025-12-12T00:21:12", "owner": "hayden__nunn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865346398447503, "text": "🥹❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-12T00:18:51", "owner": "nirajsharma_pb31", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096449887859319, "text": "Some ppl other from you just lazy and have no respect. U are doing great", "created_at": "2025-12-12T00:17:55", "owner": "spicegirl142", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081167972144539, "text": "Immigrants❎indians ✅", "created_at": "2025-12-12T00:13:45", "owner": "anakin_skyw12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850767049604113, "text": "👍", "created_at": "2025-12-12T00:13:16", "owner": "harwinders.01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114421945580126, "text": "Respect from the North🇨🇦", "created_at": "2025-12-12T00:12:38", "owner": "bikeymikey748", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901542364181184, "text": "More power to you 🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-12T00:05:23", "owner": "_.sakuragirl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851062627601303, "text": "OR come get it if you have a doctorate degree!", "created_at": "2025-12-11T23:59:07", "owner": "heyitspegah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18132162865494610, "text": "are there any job vacancies left for Indonesians?", "created_at": "2025-12-11T23:51:07", "owner": "iqbaal.ottok15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867135487509567, "text": "👏❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-11T23:48:40", "owner": "amarjeet_ferozpuria", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843881218633709, "text": "You are not immigrants", "created_at": "2025-12-11T23:40:46", "owner": "tiramissu_45", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918795928229508, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-11T23:32:01", "owner": "lucasdragani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053065943659356, "text": "🙌❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-11T23:29:38", "owner": "the_mahlaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069679109603435, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-11T23:24:47", "owner": "noman.php", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064693109563863, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-11T23:17:14", "owner": "hahah.ras", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988786950913537, "text": "They took our qualification too 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T23:08:08", "owner": "vibeswall", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013872491805496, "text": "You are even immigrant.", "created_at": "2025-12-11T23:04:28", "owner": "otabek_bayramaliyev_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934158912997709, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-11T23:04:02", "owner": "dancalderonjr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096017719873423, "text": "❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-11T23:02:46", "owner": "jaspreet__singh98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18153836485423028, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-11T22:57:45", "owner": "marcodispensa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904202302319976, "text": "loveeee loveee", "created_at": "2025-12-11T22:37:11", "owner": "gaajoo99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023308973602305, "text": "Immigrants are 100% taking jobs from Canadian students, youth, and our elderly. That's a fact backed up by not only data but seen through the eyes of Canadians.", "created_at": "2025-12-11T22:36:05", "owner": "bryandouglaspaul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18298417528283625, "text": "More power to you gurl xx ❤️🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-11T22:31:01", "owner": "singh__satvinder", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088506475962054, "text": "Finally someone said 🙌❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-11T22:13:41", "owner": "saurabhkapadia.27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049375781426472, "text": "\"Stealing our jobs\" \"stealing all the benefits\" pick a struggle, :)))", "created_at": "2025-12-11T21:59:14", "owner": "_anonymouse_20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120584752528274, "text": "Immigrants don’t steal their jobs. They only steal their confidence to do the jobs they despise.", "created_at": "2025-12-11T21:55:54", "owner": "phillipisvegan", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18108341293713079, "text": "GUYS GUYS LOOK I HAVE A JOB ahh post", "created_at": "2025-12-11T21:55:32", "owner": "canadian_boi_69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948286579075019, "text": "I don’t want slave money immigrants were needed because nobody’s willing to work cheap hours thanks for helping capitalism enjoy slaving for no purpose when all the prices raise", "created_at": "2025-12-11T21:54:56", "owner": "canadian_boi_69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18371925844081373, "text": "🔥🔥🔥😍", "created_at": "2025-12-11T21:52:41", "owner": "shubhuumm4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18412854469191502, "text": "If someone who has no acquaintances, no references...dealing with financial issues, limited working rights, no favours, language barriers etc is stealing your job, you better drown in that... there's a reason you've never seen a Junkie immigrant.", "created_at": "2025-12-11T21:43:21", "owner": "abraaaaaaaarrr", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18102511489742824, "text": "Exactly", "created_at": "2025-12-11T21:29:46", "owner": "cjac.k2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079443293334876, "text": "They don’t this job 😂 so picky", "created_at": "2025-12-11T21:26:07", "owner": "muhammad_raynaldi06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091837897936618, "text": "Maybe if the government stops putting them first for FREE and with BENEFITS we would be able to.", "created_at": "2025-12-11T21:23:28", "owner": "yasmin._coco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976109130955053, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-11T21:17:29", "owner": "josh.acsta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18130522771497913, "text": "The illegal aliens do it for cash under the table for way less than u", "created_at": "2025-12-11T21:17:03", "owner": "scottywrm88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540638218015493, "text": "-:are they took you’re teeth as well ?\n—Yes  they are", "created_at": "2025-12-11T21:04:10", "owner": "alan_m0l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126841471459942, "text": "The Immigrants are what make America unless everyone wants to publicly admit you live on stolen land", "created_at": "2025-12-11T21:03:29", "owner": "cuicacalli_advisor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057159386323573, "text": "You’re white, they are absolutely not talking about you. Average white American will rather choose you over a brown person who pay $100k just in taxes every year. It’s the truth and no one needs to be offended, it’s not a new behaviour, just the same for the past 600 years or so.", "created_at": "2025-12-11T21:03:16", "owner": "shubham_dadhichi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105813508723365, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-12-11T21:02:49", "owner": "marielyes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999877263842692, "text": "Maybe we don’t have to pay cheaper wages and the companies can pay a fair wage. Imagine that liberals", "created_at": "2025-12-11T21:01:01", "owner": "bluucan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052646789343502, "text": "❤️🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-11T20:58:07", "owner": "zanique__k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103817092679675, "text": "It's interesting how Trump blames all of America's problems on immigrants, but then deportations started, and the news reported that jobs were at an all-time low, with millions of Americans struggling to find work due to a lack of labor.", "created_at": "2025-12-11T20:48:30", "owner": "marias.l18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18407779921141860, "text": "I would go down on you anytime", "created_at": "2025-12-11T20:47:09", "owner": "ultraviolenceo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18337253833227098, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-11T20:44:54", "owner": "_abid_hussain____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847952011595018, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T20:36:18", "owner": "fahadofr2bees", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073135676458758, "text": "You’re stealing the youths jobs…. They have way less qualifications than you adult people do.", "created_at": "2025-12-11T20:23:52", "owner": "the.funky.homosapien", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004725980827728, "text": "White monkey terrorist", "created_at": "2025-12-11T20:03:49", "owner": "xaemuskelon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999912258838886, "text": "Is she implying she's an immigrant?? She's white. We all know immigrants are brown", "created_at": "2025-12-11T20:00:55", "owner": "salvi139", "likes": 10}, {"id": 17875620951451056, "text": "it'll get better🫂🫂proud if u❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-11T19:54:37", "owner": "maede_nojoumi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067621019612144, "text": "Tell me you don't know how supply and demand works without telling me you don't know how supply and demand works. You don't have a right to our country. We have no obligations to help foreigners. Its the audacity. We have more legal immigration than any other country.", "created_at": "2025-12-11T19:49:03", "owner": "greenwood.ian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090149416764222, "text": "Respect!", "created_at": "2025-12-11T19:30:54", "owner": "karam_s.h_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999907071698830, "text": "🙌🙌🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-11T19:20:44", "owner": "ketkihedau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066620633156399, "text": "Go girl! 🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-11T19:15:52", "owner": "vryyyyynnn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919952596209144, "text": "Amen", "created_at": "2025-12-11T19:00:19", "owner": "eu_nco_vet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060809906268218, "text": "The more immigrants in the country the more immigrants you need to look after them🙄🙄 simple maths my dear.", "created_at": "2025-12-11T18:57:59", "owner": "annatample25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114397297604988, "text": "Facts", "created_at": "2025-12-11T18:49:14", "owner": "its_taa_naa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033945410531126, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-11T18:48:31", "owner": "mizanur_rahman_97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082142924323638, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T18:36:20", "owner": "victormans3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842487673655187, "text": "Well well well your ancestors stole entire Continent illegally, atleast they are coming legally 🤷🏻‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-12-11T18:36:07", "owner": "suryalokesha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074005019596069, "text": "Context. People don’t like H1 Visas and illegal immigrants. Both take jobs from Americans. H1 Visas holders almost always lie about their qualifications and somehow get a 100K a year tech job. So no we don’t like fraudulent or illegal immigrants. So ignoring both and just saying immigrants is intellectually dishonest. Only liberals have to lie like this.", "created_at": "2025-12-11T18:28:46", "owner": "harambememorialpages", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888592540400486, "text": "you can 💪🏻", "created_at": "2025-12-11T18:08:26", "owner": "nyty.x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084802831861076, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-11T18:05:41", "owner": "aasthahair", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870107371473630, "text": "Germans would be happy if illegal syrian/ afghan invaders would work", "created_at": "2025-12-11T18:05:25", "owner": "adaaam017", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088134215075805, "text": "Usa love immigrants 😍", "created_at": "2025-12-11T18:03:39", "owner": "2thepoms", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066389054631298, "text": "Just saying, the white card still works", "created_at": "2025-12-11T18:02:34", "owner": "littlelittlemydear", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085333268512338, "text": "😂😂😂😂they can't do that....but you can do what they do better", "created_at": "2025-12-11T17:53:04", "owner": "wamuclicksphotography", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067249418435474, "text": "Honestly, if I owned a business, immigrants would be the best to hire for low skilled positions. You don’t have to pay as much and they’re less likely to complain. It makes sense business wise to hire low skilled immigrants for the jobs no one wants. This is why we should make work visas easier to get", "created_at": "2025-12-11T17:42:15", "owner": "cj_celt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18162034186398027, "text": "Like there’s no way you would feel threatened by an immigrant… If so, then you clearly are not doing enough! Because they start at absolutely nothing with no privileges.", "created_at": "2025-12-11T17:38:53", "owner": "juliav120211", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115702450601154, "text": "You’re white so you don’t count", "created_at": "2025-12-11T17:35:01", "owner": "neweraofdistruction", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054960548335522, "text": "Yes i need 3 guys to work here", "created_at": "2025-12-11T17:29:04", "owner": "aron_dav4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18337357540224223, "text": "Queen you slayed it", "created_at": "2025-12-11T17:27:09", "owner": "termixsuraj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103996507677014, "text": "Your immigration is not the same as these asylums immigration, there is no comparison or similarities so step down from your pedestal preaching and clean the dishes", "created_at": "2025-12-11T17:19:29", "owner": "emerick.ross", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107072824653257, "text": "From farms, to factories, to running their own businesses, h1b1 visas, how can you ignore the fact that they in fact displacing the native born citizen… largely only anchor babies and liberal women can’t see these facts", "created_at": "2025-12-11T17:16:47", "owner": "winslow224", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031519088553543, "text": "😂😂😂🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-11T17:13:23", "owner": "_preet_multani4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18131315245498136, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-11T17:11:26", "owner": "asthetics_by_fafi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18401362423123423, "text": "Illegal or legal immigrants?", "created_at": "2025-12-11T16:52:28", "owner": "eltrochada", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113095210593039, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-12-11T16:40:19", "owner": "user.2286", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915665299246385, "text": "Illegal immigrants that is", "created_at": "2025-12-11T16:27:45", "owner": "_panda_251", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944380939079610, "text": "right? like girl you want some tacos? you can buy me out rn but don’t cry to me when you fail", "created_at": "2025-12-11T16:08:48", "owner": "the_leafy_king", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957955912040170, "text": "Brilliant 👏", "created_at": "2025-12-11T16:07:14", "owner": "irresistiblesun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917105857228578, "text": "Do hotels actually iron their beds ?", "created_at": "2025-12-11T16:01:49", "owner": "diego_r_d_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075469637262529, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-11T15:52:16", "owner": "unicorn.9804432", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093229177912927, "text": "You don't look the type of Immigrants they hate bro 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T15:51:28", "owner": "pao97_pao98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923253379053433, "text": "Considering the European American types are the og thieves, I welcome the new arrivals.", "created_at": "2025-12-11T15:43:39", "owner": "real_hams_of_regina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990436419900106, "text": "You look like a gringa anyways", "created_at": "2025-12-11T15:36:54", "owner": "gad21dan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077982461463795, "text": "When you are illegal and work for Slave Wages…\nThat’s the problem!!!", "created_at": "2025-12-11T15:22:35", "owner": "what_now71", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543529807036773, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T15:14:55", "owner": "luisthemanforyou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999486474699867, "text": "The point is tis fçker Don wanna work and then just cry while shîttin in their pants, overdosed 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T14:59:17", "owner": "ragingmonk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030237098767250, "text": "They want everything ready made, that's why they can't get ur job", "created_at": "2025-12-11T13:36:16", "owner": "harry_pottehhh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009066761656387, "text": "Please come and get it and show the current results", "created_at": "2025-12-11T13:24:10", "owner": "hiran_fernando", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080968523278814, "text": "Exactly, EXACTLY", "created_at": "2025-12-11T13:22:34", "owner": "niacarver_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002666330683564, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-12-11T13:02:52", "owner": "urboykimi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066491258407958, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏 stepped backwards in life had too for life balance and some one said to me the other day I couldn’t do that job …. Yeh I no lazy ass …. And then say this like wild !!!!! I will do any job to provide", "created_at": "2025-12-11T12:39:08", "owner": "r.rebeccajane", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17966453663995253, "text": "👏👏👏👏❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-11T11:12:34", "owner": "behrad_ramiti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102739402739899, "text": "❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-11T11:02:37", "owner": "_kaur_20000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080321198145635, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-11T10:52:51", "owner": "annyxme21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101251369751159, "text": "Yeah u tell em girl...tell these spoiled westerns", "created_at": "2025-12-11T10:10:22", "owner": "truth56081", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107335042654058, "text": "✌🏻✨", "created_at": "2025-12-11T09:58:58", "owner": "ravixmusic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970323996991734, "text": "💯", "created_at": "2025-12-11T09:53:30", "owner": "solinehoussein", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907617748269031, "text": "It's not them it's the boss", "created_at": "2025-12-11T09:37:45", "owner": "y4d5jtsjtsjyts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914803528250124, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T08:38:45", "owner": "mrs.zafar21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080610418923739, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-11T07:15:40", "owner": "tashaaaable", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874407274457194, "text": "🙌👏", "created_at": "2025-12-11T05:24:21", "owner": "6072_sameer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066872867151729, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-11T04:55:09", "owner": "andre.j.harry", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["immigration", "discipline", "consistency", "growth"]},
{"media_id": 3786538031096392911, "shortcode": "DSMfEcAAezP", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DSMfEcAAezP/", "taken_at": "2025-12-13T07:22:41", "caption": "#冷知識 #長知識", "owner_username": "nishizhen996", "owner_id": "77618151974", "likes": 3018, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0015_DSMfEcAAezP\\DSMfEcAAezP_20251213_072241.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18166390624384845, "text": "抖音一響父母白養\n紅書一翻兒女遭殃", "created_at": "2025-12-14T22:49:50", "owner": "chungweijen", "likes": 86}, {"id": 18100082578699170, "text": "「正常人」 本來就是一個很高的評價", "created_at": "2025-12-13T15:46:10", "owner": "mr_holmes8", "likes": 335}, {"id": 18059665316291341, "text": "不是正常人變少了，是醫學進步了，更容易發現他們比起所謂的「正常人」不同，古代沒有人被確診癌症，是否代表古代醫學技術更厲害？古代人比起現代更健康？當然不是，只是無法診斷出來，不是沒有。還有以前的教學方式不一樣，所謂不正常的學生都會被暴力對待，導致佢變成所謂的正常，只要你做了一些老師不喜歡的事，你就會被打，你當然會很乖啦，但這是不是正常的教育方式呀？當然不是啦，這樣的教育方式，只會令人患上心理疾病。其實不是以前的人很正常，只是以前的人很相同而已", "created_at": "2025-12-13T20:30:06", "owner": "come_on_wolves", "likes": 93}, {"id": 18344610925230951, "text": "聽過某片的片主超靠杯形容「正常人的存在比獨角獸的存在還稀有」😂", "created_at": "2025-12-14T04:04:23", "owner": "an_irisheyes", "likes": 45}, {"id": 18060889496257500, "text": "因為他們的父母就不是正常人😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-15T08:51:48", "owner": "linzerxl7370", "likes": 14}, {"id": 17926994637175360, "text": "真的，我3岁的弟有自闭症😢", "created_at": "2025-12-13T16:55:34", "owner": "tengyi_xie", "likes": 12}, {"id": 18071626910091186, "text": "後面說得對，保胎變高了，後續溫室花朵也是一個環節，一點磕碰 還是手動做事都不能。", "created_at": "2025-12-17T14:45:10", "owner": "wesin001", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17862537885542358, "text": "塑化劑吃多了，地溝油吃多了。放心以後 下一代老師也不正常了", "created_at": "2025-12-15T14:33:31", "owner": "taiwanmingzhou", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17892369771384972, "text": "剛逛完脆就超有體會，最近的男學生觸肩事件，還可以一堆超大杯在那邊無限上綱，我都快不知道什麼才是正常人了", "created_at": "2025-12-14T04:38:41", "owner": "boruyo486", "likes": 20}, {"id": 18149453314389805, "text": "老師叫咩就做咩～嗰啲先叫做唔正常😂我哋係人喎⋯唔係狗喎", "created_at": "2025-12-15T02:28:56", "owner": "man._.yy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963562179865870, "text": "自然界中强壮的胎儿都能活下来 弱小的则是死亡 而保胎技术越来越进步 强行把那些该自然淘汰掉的胎儿给保下来了 有时候是真的不知道这算幸运还是不幸", "created_at": "2025-12-16T12:15:25", "owner": "briefgoryap_awa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18107501002639106, "text": "你看看之前的課本和現在的課本呢", "created_at": "2025-12-19T03:41:36", "owner": "ym.g0114", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071860361366411, "text": "看看現在的小粉紅就知道了", "created_at": "2025-12-15T10:14:37", "owner": "custer_foss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086702833997842, "text": "我小时候被怀疑过有自闭症(()", "created_at": "2025-12-16T13:42:19", "owner": "gagacai_30", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905316277298082, "text": "達爾文該發力了", "created_at": "2025-12-14T23:54:05", "owner": "ice_cream_anan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074835995200479, "text": "你可唔可以同我解釋咩叫正常人咩叫唔正常人正常人嘅定義係咩唔正常嘅人定義係咩😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-16T12:04:50", "owner": "08_hin1021", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105422947594949, "text": "疫苗", "created_at": "2025-12-16T04:37:26", "owner": "southkong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976732461955795, "text": "手機", "created_at": "2025-12-14T11:23:29", "owner": "tsz0_0517", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18095234473899002, "text": "現在像我這種正常人很少見了", "created_at": "2025-12-17T08:44:43", "owner": "star._.0813_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855998173579904, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-12-13T17:50:24", "owner": "ciel4943", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968855952994777, "text": "@st___026", "created_at": "2025-12-14T07:22:20", "owner": "ji394__.nanakusanazuna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871842595399103, "text": "你不健康你生的小孩多半要很努力才能健康 以前人 早上看太陽 就出門工作了。沒燈晚上就睡了 該吃吃也不吃垃圾食物。", "created_at": "2025-12-16T01:28:01", "owner": "roland.chang.585", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095414800895864, "text": "普通和理所當然是什麼", "created_at": "2025-12-19T11:04:44", "owner": "luffyliu0317", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893300470380376, "text": "拜托，只有中国这样好吗。普通人没有特供水和特供食物", "created_at": "2025-12-15T06:05:35", "owner": "jimenyinquan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18173850877372566, "text": "正常人🙋", "created_at": "2025-12-14T00:39:52", "owner": "jeton_photography", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001646207835132, "text": "不是一代不如一代 是以前根本不知道那個是智障 因為大家都一樣", "created_at": "2025-12-14T11:59:12", "owner": "y.i.06__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145358386401550, "text": "哪些不聪明又领不到残疾补助的都被打死了", "created_at": "2025-12-16T23:21:56", "owner": "jkye2000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106932568642354, "text": "當大家都不正常，他們會覺得目前的正常人是不正常的", "created_at": "2025-12-16T01:21:28", "owner": "eason_4270", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088318160000584, "text": "因為正常人都不結婚生小朋友，咁生出嚟嗰啲人係咩人？", "created_at": "2025-12-16T01:09:00", "owner": "kentkitng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906537454293568, "text": "智 障烏托邦要成真了", "created_at": "2025-12-15T04:33:34", "owner": "railjt257", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051980252378527, "text": "因为过去那群人早就被这个社会搞死了，或者连门都出不了，沙雕装瞎呢在这，看不到就不存在呢是吧。", "created_at": "2025-12-15T04:07:29", "owner": "dong_higashi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097032862876559, "text": "感覺自閉症越來越多了", "created_at": "2025-12-14T06:37:11", "owner": "choukabuwaizhenjun", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18065913443426923, "text": "因為正常人不生 只有腦子進水的整天忙著配種", "created_at": "2025-12-14T05:38:43", "owner": "endless30678", "likes": 8}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["冷知識", "長知識"]},
{"media_id": 3782587373008216283, "shortcode": "DR-cyy8CGDb", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DR-cyy8CGDb/", "taken_at": "2025-12-07T20:32:55", "caption": "“In the midst of winter, I found there was, within me, an invincible summer. And that makes me happy. For it says that no matter how hard the world pushes against me, within me, there’s something stronger – something better, pushing right back.”", "owner_username": "barbara.olegovna", "owner_id": "4772803365", "likes": -1, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphSidecar", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0016_DR-cyy8CGDb\\DR-cyy8CGDb_20251207_203255_1.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0016_DR-cyy8CGDb\\DR-cyy8CGDb_20251207_203255_10.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0016_DR-cyy8CGDb\\DR-cyy8CGDb_20251207_203255_11.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0016_DR-cyy8CGDb\\DR-cyy8CGDb_20251207_203255_12.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0016_DR-cyy8CGDb\\DR-cyy8CGDb_20251207_203255_13.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0016_DR-cyy8CGDb\\DR-cyy8CGDb_20251207_203255_14.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0016_DR-cyy8CGDb\\DR-cyy8CGDb_20251207_203255_15.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0016_DR-cyy8CGDb\\DR-cyy8CGDb_20251207_203255_2.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0016_DR-cyy8CGDb\\DR-cyy8CGDb_20251207_203255_3.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0016_DR-cyy8CGDb\\DR-cyy8CGDb_20251207_203255_4.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0016_DR-cyy8CGDb\\DR-cyy8CGDb_20251207_203255_5.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0016_DR-cyy8CGDb\\DR-cyy8CGDb_20251207_203255_6.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0016_DR-cyy8CGDb\\DR-cyy8CGDb_20251207_203255_7.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0016_DR-cyy8CGDb\\DR-cyy8CGDb_20251207_203255_8.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0016_DR-cyy8CGDb\\DR-cyy8CGDb_20251207_203255_9.jpg"}], "comments": [{"id": 17932471086128770, "text": "безупречна! ❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-07T20:46:46", "owner": "ulianche_ek.k", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18007986674660437, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-12-08T05:39:02", "owner": "melanypolean", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079203689232158, "text": "Королева ♥️", "created_at": "2025-12-07T20:39:14", "owner": "violettaashm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906595450144434, "text": "Queen ❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-08T07:21:32", "owner": "tikhonphoto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084698573098990, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-09T14:46:59", "owner": "ali.jafareii19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104428771670374, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-12-08T15:37:07", "owner": "jgilormad_art", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101388766756127, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-14T07:58:02", "owner": "iamfaraz.z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848600575584441, "text": "😍😍😍😍❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-10T13:03:55", "owner": "eldelatia_tj_sd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052210775359504, "text": "Happy birthday 🎂 🎉", "created_at": "2025-12-08T13:16:34", "owner": "ric_govea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903129346303947, "text": "💙✨️💋💕💔🌹😘😘Preciosa 🔥🔥😍😍", "created_at": "2025-12-08T13:25:26", "owner": "pablohernanolmo6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049097132426465, "text": "HBD 🥳🎂✨🎈🎉", "created_at": "2025-12-08T05:32:16", "owner": "slyt2323", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094611655893845, "text": "Amazing!🐰🥕🥬❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-09T01:28:22", "owner": "hasederbayern", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085114538043727, "text": "klass", "created_at": "2025-12-08T21:05:21", "owner": "stoneisland4life", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041846234503474, "text": "In the towerr", "created_at": "2025-12-11T07:05:51", "owner": "edric_ricaud", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089387687291801, "text": "Who is that person on the third picture ?", "created_at": "2025-12-15T21:04:16", "owner": "thani_yxy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972943626813862, "text": "\"You are such a detail that... it is not for everyone to be both strong and beautiful.\"\n\n«Когда некоторые люди входят, энергия окружающей среды меняется... вы именно такой. Даже твоя сила дает тебе покой».", "created_at": "2025-12-07T20:53:55", "owner": "kiziltasbrk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866903647514692, "text": "How many islands does Jeffrey Epstein has got ?", "created_at": "2025-12-08T13:52:52", "owner": "maysam_mirzakhalili", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3782820606568944987, "shortcode": "DR_R0ynkdVb", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DR_R0ynkdVb/", "taken_at": "2025-12-08T04:17:18", "caption": "別瞎猜了兄弟們 #大母龍", "owner_username": "gton9765644", "owner_id": "76133816351", "likes": 3274, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0017_DR_R0ynkdVb\\DR_R0ynkdVb_20251208_041718.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": "17889353964259691", "text": "想看😍", "created_at": "2025-12-08T13:08:23", "owner": "zhfutanhmi", "likes": 3}, {"id": "18340371466224742", "text": "想看", "created_at": "2025-12-09T10:36:39", "owner": "kabuto0925", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18295049341282446", "text": "千字文🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-08T16:45:35", "owner": "hanchenian", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18071651990075292", "text": "大母龍屁股上紋百家姓😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T15:45:47", "owner": "wanguun19880716", "likes": 27}, {"id": "18076135529251233", "text": "❤️❤️😍", "created_at": "2025-12-18T14:34:33", "owner": "cesaralfonzo2009", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18548801038060139", "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-08T22:15:24", "owner": "liudidi2talk", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18079056503240194", "text": "可以看  但你先把鏡頭關了😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T13:40:19", "owner": "wei_zen1202", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18075734042264645", "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T04:49:55", "owner": "eric.e38", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18112138426612072", "text": "海外直播找主播，日结", "created_at": "2025-12-13T02:25:39", "owner": "wangqi1651", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["大母龍"]},
{"media_id": 3786698924069803805, "shortcode": "DSNDpvQiNcd", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DSNDpvQiNcd/", "taken_at": "2025-12-13T12:42:10", "caption": "life’s better now 😌", "owner_username": "rubyysecretx", "owner_id": "77444173579", "likes": 26141, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0018_DSNDpvQiNcd\\DSNDpvQiNcd_20251213_124210.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17969885318975803, "text": "Parents proud ? 😁 Don't lie", "created_at": "2025-12-14T07:32:32", "owner": "emi.e31", "likes": 1716}, {"id": 17993824301889482, "text": "Congratulations for selling your dignity", "created_at": "2025-12-14T04:00:46", "owner": "mattmillard97", "likes": 2754}, {"id": 17889333681393113, "text": "🔥🔥🔥😍", "created_at": "2025-12-14T16:50:32", "owner": "1962geronimo", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17843502948636910, "text": "🤦", "created_at": "2025-12-14T05:11:02", "owner": "maxwellshowler", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18157704517406829, "text": "If parents are proud; they're also on OF😂", "created_at": "2025-12-14T11:54:42", "owner": "xshanz.07", "likes": 334}, {"id": 17991989705856587, "text": "Parents are crying where did we make the mistake now", "created_at": "2025-12-14T11:30:35", "owner": "kev_antonie", "likes": 61}, {"id": 18152236444425250, "text": "Yikes", "created_at": "2025-12-14T05:06:24", "owner": "daniel.orchy10", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17897359674358411, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-14T19:10:09", "owner": "sean312367", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17892791100381298, "text": "Exclusive content has arrived on the website💬", "created_at": "2025-12-15T20:41:46", "owner": "yourmommyyyhere", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18102319558762442, "text": "NOTHING TO BE PROUD OF MOMMY", "created_at": "2025-12-14T15:26:35", "owner": "mike282609", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17941075512099340, "text": "Don’t lie your parents are not proud 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-14T16:35:58", "owner": "marcel_h16_", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18022897463795583, "text": "❤️❤️😍", "created_at": "2025-12-14T18:00:09", "owner": "neha__baddie", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080592322919317, "text": "Parents aren't proud 😮", "created_at": "2025-12-13T18:49:01", "owner": "southdowns2024", "likes": 679}, {"id": 18031902449757372, "text": "DAAAAAM", "created_at": "2025-12-15T03:23:39", "owner": "m_navarro99", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18121936996540811, "text": "🚫", "created_at": "2025-12-14T06:42:57", "owner": "erniebc1982", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18075489551205268, "text": "Wowww", "created_at": "2025-12-15T08:11:18", "owner": "aahtitiya", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087401495287209, "text": "every american girl once they turn 18- “i don’t want to struggle and work my way up so im gonna sell my body online” type shit 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-14T12:12:15", "owner": "_alexander558", "likes": 23}, {"id": 17869560618483523, "text": "Aged 20 years", "created_at": "2025-12-14T13:02:40", "owner": "tarantulahawk79", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17891795931390079, "text": "Didn’t even give life a try yet 💀", "created_at": "2025-12-14T23:04:30", "owner": "rdizz.03", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18301610926286391, "text": "Only two of those last 5 are correct and parents being proud still is not one of them", "created_at": "2025-12-14T17:29:47", "owner": "mik5263", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18351514354201901, "text": "Not proud anymore girl", "created_at": "2025-12-14T12:26:28", "owner": "stanolishe", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17846927109605667, "text": "That's a shame", "created_at": "2025-12-14T02:15:02", "owner": "dr.options.phd", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18162109324394653, "text": "Of course her parents are proud. She obviously doesn’t have great parents. Lmaoooooo 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-14T16:17:27", "owner": "corseto8756", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18546478237025615, "text": "Spoiled goods as they saying goes", "created_at": "2025-12-14T16:48:33", "owner": "graydanofficial", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079289990271936, "text": "R", "created_at": "2025-12-14T03:17:01", "owner": "_aryendra_09", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18185491303352758,