4633180, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T22:13:07", "owner": "jack_walter75", "likes": 30}, {"id": 18100726216808810, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T07:41:14", "owner": "emir.inannn", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18051374108380491, "text": "I need 😍", "created_at": "2025-12-06T18:28:11", "owner": "shre.yacutiebaby", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18317883637217448, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T23:22:14", "owner": "ryanpeabody5", "likes": 21}, {"id": 17874396942378461, "text": "😍😍", "created_at": "2025-12-05T16:37:34", "owner": "neha__baddie", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17900078634341385, "text": "Сильная и независимая женщина, зависимая только от мужчин и их внимания, а так полностью независимая", "created_at": "2025-12-10T08:35:50", "owner": "sergeymalov1999_1000", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18073687742262802, "text": "1 John 4:8 (KJV):\n\"He that loveth not knoweth not God; for God is love.\"\nThe Bible was written over 1,500 to 1,600 years by different authors who were separated by significant distances and time.\nMatthew 19:26 and Mark 10:27 teach us that there are no limits to God's power, and what is impossible for humans is possible through Him.\nMatthew 24:13 (KJV):\n\"But he that shall endure unto the end, the same shall be saved.\"\nJesus loves you. God bless you. The Lord and Savior died on the cross, conquered death, and rose three days later for all—to cleanse and wash us clean of sin and to give us a chance at eternal life in paradise. Pray in Jesus' name, Amen. 🙏❤️\nDo you believe in God? Give God a chance. Seek God wholeheartedly and you will find Him. Give God a chance—give the Bible a chance. It is proven, God is proven. Be open-minded. God loves you, I love you. Pray in Jesus' name, Amen! 🙏❤️\nIt’s been proven; you just have to open your heart and mind to it and accept it. The Bible is coming to truth more and more every day—prophecies being fulfilled, creation explained, and the origins of time and matter showing that something outside of them had to create them. The Bible says it is possible with God. Other things are already proven true or are coming true, and the Bible has been historically confirmed. It’s right there.\nDo not use the Lord’s name in vain. Anyone who uses the Lord’s name in vain will not go guiltless. God loves you. Jesus Christ is Lord and Savior. Pray in Jesus' name, Amen! 🙏❤️\nRemember that people without the holy spirit are gonna have a hard time understanding the bible and it says that in scripture too. most of the times they read it not for an understanding but to pick out all they see wrong with it.\n1 Corinthians 2:14 (NIV):\n\"The person without the Spirit does not accept the things that come from the Spirit of God but considers them foolishness, and cannot understand them because they are discerned only through the Spirit.\"", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:05:25", "owner": "new_born2448", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087548776799056, "text": "I don’t understand the jokes abt triangle", "created_at": "2025-12-06T05:56:21", "owner": "aki_aki_akashow", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18107358052649279, "text": "@dejan_stnrvc „Erfahrungen sammeln“", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:21:34", "owner": "patrick_labitzke", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18100492087782723, "text": "these are the men we’re marrying", "created_at": "2025-12-07T02:14:38", "owner": "stoopid_hero", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18514449148069205, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T03:37:04", "owner": "erhm21tk", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17929069596172767, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-12-05T18:42:27", "owner": "markoshoshkitsh", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18212094397310976, "text": "😵‍💫😵‍💫", "created_at": "2025-12-06T09:16:54", "owner": "pvtt_divyaa05", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18074932133224014, "text": "Pobre padre😢", "created_at": "2025-12-06T13:01:54", "owner": "luciaaperez06", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17929880049018152, "text": "🫦👅👅", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:03:35", "owner": "ritika.kaur0", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18066187238157562, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-06T06: