{"media_id": 3781957413621644826, "shortcode": "DR8Njrikr4a", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DR8Njrikr4a/", "taken_at": "2025-12-06T23:41:40", "caption": "1.\tI spent nine nights alone in a hotel room, trying to convince myself I wasn’t as lonely as I felt.\n\t2.\tI went on nine different dates — nine different men — hoping one of them would make me forget how empty everything had become.\n\t3.\tNight 1 was sweet, but he only talked about his ex.\nNight 2 was fun, but he disappeared the next morning.\n\t4.\tBy Night 3, I started pretending I was okay… smiling, laughing, acting like the girl who “has it all under control.”\n\t5.\tNight 4 told me I was “too emotional,”\nNight 5 told me I was “too quiet.”\nNight 6 told me I was “too much.”\n\t6.\tNight 7 didn’t even look at me — he scrolled on his phone while I talked.\n\t7.\tNight 8 said he “loved my energy”… then asked if I had any friends for him too.\n\t8.\tAnd Night 9… the one I thought might finally be different… left without saying goodbye.\n\t9.\tI went back to my hotel bed every night, wiping my makeup off and telling myself it was fine — that tomorrow would be better.\n\t10.\tBut the truth is… every new date made me feel smaller, cheaper, easier to replace.\n\t11.\tBy the end of the trip, I realized I wasn’t searching for love — I was just trying to fill a silence that kept getting louder.\n\t12.\tAnd that’s why I cried in that hotel room — not because of them, but because I finally admitted how lonely I really was.\n\nIf you want to talk to me or just make me feel less alone tonight… my link is in bio. 💗\n.\n.\n.\n#foryou #fyp #foryoupage💙 #foryoupage #foryourpage #lmao #funny #fypage #fypシ #viral #explore #explorer #explorerpage #reels", "owner_username": "louniiiiia", "owner_id": "530265823", "likes": 20925, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0021_DR8Njrikr4a\\DR8Njrikr4a_20251206_234140.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18076993604336918, "text": "So you cried so loudly that the cops got called?  How did it end with cop cars?  What else happened?", "created_at": "2025-12-09T15:50:51", "owner": "normjr37", "likes": 629}, {"id": 18118499647560111, "text": "Hope you ok ik how u feel", "created_at": "2025-12-07T04:18:50", "owner": "d1nooz", "likes": 34}, {"id": 17842527048648761, "text": "I know yo daddy's proud", "created_at": "2025-12-09T14:18:11", "owner": "wesley_z3", "likes": 299}, {"id": 18062692640219461, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-12-09T14:29:30", "owner": "elenakiii_mou", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17921680461193706, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-07T17:58:21", "owner": "ofpr.goty", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18050523578391268, "text": "But why the cops where there? I read all of the text", "created_at": "2025-12-09T22:40:33", "owner": "koebi_tboy_tg", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17953615077044193, "text": "It got stuck or something 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T04:10:44", "owner": "janeharime", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18106801510638043, "text": "What did you expect?", "created_at": "2025-12-07T11:31:54", "owner": "aristotle83", "likes": 135}, {"id": 17993518616907794, "text": "Hang in there buddy", "created_at": "2025-12-09T17:14:30", "owner": "rajxx14369", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080882774173394, "text": "You are for the streets know your place", "created_at": "2025-12-08T18:40:20", "owner": "lord_zhommel", "likes": 1814}, {"id": 18096370228845882, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-10T09:39:57", "owner": "vipulsharmaaaa", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18100605856742334, "text": "Lithium works better", "created_at": "2025-12-10T04:17:59", "owner": "al_ee_thia", "likes": 9}, {"id": 17960648427007918, "text": "Someone's wife found out", "created_at": "2025-12-08T05:10:01", "owner": "mike41cad8", "likes": 13}, {"id": 17865772812527372, "text": "I suggest you find a better thing", "created_at": "2025-12-09T19:13:45", "owner": "bruh.every.where", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18114918175573569, "text": "4 men, 5 nights, 1 pizzeria", "created_at":