t": "you wanted that, makes sense", "created_at": "2025-12-16T22:55:04", "owner": "ferfira_340", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938455588101132, "text": "0", "created_at": "2025-12-16T22:03:49", "owner": "pradeesh_kulal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18298148557257282, "text": "Shut the fuck up you bop", "created_at": "2025-12-16T13:56:02", "owner": "vawzenceo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105369976814015, "text": "Yet you have an OF???", "created_at": "2025-12-16T07:21:33", "owner": "yabbo__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974013450969101, "text": "Jesus can help with the loneliness.", "created_at": "2025-12-16T03:35:19", "owner": "cgalloway86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956535088023454, "text": "Hoe", "created_at": "2025-12-15T18:26:16", "owner": "ste_hmar_7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18371423647083893, "text": "Who cares about hoe's ?", "created_at": "2025-12-15T05:56:36", "owner": "m_tt_k_23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010951544812501, "text": "Dear women, this phase will NEVER make u feel better. Will only ensure that when u meet a real man he wont see a future with u", "created_at": "2025-12-15T03:09:05", "owner": "ghostfacegreco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913886719250503, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-15T01:23:49", "owner": "helloimsqydd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068735732121749, "text": "Poor dad:((", "created_at": "2025-12-15T00:46:46", "owner": "clinsquaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18431018338109483, "text": "We're a bunch of lonely peoples. U'll find your lonely one one days", "created_at": "2025-12-15T00:38:19", "owner": "sebdemontreal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992565036730528, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-14T19:14:50", "owner": "masc.ari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106740991654797, "text": "Nahhh wth, absolutely no shame.", "created_at": "2025-12-14T00:48:20", "owner": "faithoverfearvx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147449800440374, "text": "This is not freedom. This is moral collapse.\n\nAnyone who chooses to publicly sexualize and display their body is, by that choice, destroying their own social and human value—no matter how much people try to sugarcoat it with pretty words.\n\nReality is simple and undeniable:\nA person is valued by how much they protect themselves, not by how much they expose.\nA body offered to everyone becomes a consumed object, not something respected or desired.\nThe men who pay, watch, or applaud do not respect you—even if they pretend otherwise.\nNo serious relationship, no genuine respect, and no lasting bond is built on public sexual exposure.\n\nThis is a psychological and social fact:\nWhat is given away freely is treated as worthless.\n\nA woman who opens her body to strangers, imitates pornographic behavior, and sells her intimacy for money or attention is not expressing power or confidence. She is expressing inner emptiness, ignorance of long-term consequences, or submission to a dirty market that uses her and discards her.\n\nThe real danger is this:\nThis behavior destroys the meaning of femininity, kills modesty (which is a society’s safety valve), and turns sexuality from a human bond into animalistic display.\n\nAnimals mate to survive.\nThis is stripping oneself to be consumed.\nThat is worse.\n\nThe conclusion—without diplomacy:\nA modest woman has value, even if media ignores her.\nAn exposed woman has followers, not social dignity.\nThe difference between them is not superficial—it is fundamental.\n\nIf this message offends, that does not make it false...\nThe problem is not the one who sees the decay,\nbut a world that rewards vulgarity and silences truth.", "created_at": "2025-12-13T22:22:32", "owner": "laith67667", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17908299033274565, "text": "Hello, i speak Spanish, maybe we could talk 😢", "created_at": "2025-12-13T21:57:45", "owner": "felix.darnirok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064516610533944, "text": "I’ll take that this never happened for $500", "created_at": "2025-12-13T04:36:44", "owner": "delgadowiscovitch978", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917807083216444, "text": "BWAHAHAHHAHAHAHAH", "created_at": "2025-12-1