likes": 0}, {"id": 17879173437439212, "text": "Stayed for the dire straits music button —— >", "created_at": "2025-12-10T14:12:53", "owner": "georgeahtat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057868214309812, "text": "Dont do onlyfans no one will look at you like an object bruh", "created_at": "2025-12-10T13:11:23", "owner": "desiree_garcia5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089253835785067, "text": "so you wanna talk with ppl cuz they pay to talk to you, atp just give up on relationships", "created_at": "2025-12-10T12:25:49", "owner": "lexa_sasha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066711524436577, "text": "9 guys in 9 nights you definitely for the streets", "created_at": "2025-12-10T12:21:11", "owner": "don_loo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008921648816926, "text": "Is she a minor?", "created_at": "2025-12-10T11:37:10", "owner": "_iwassan_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986030784913250, "text": "What a rat, you wrote everything only to promote your of, what a wh0r3", "created_at": "2025-12-10T10:20:09", "owner": "salgas__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052844006354085, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-10T09:59:28", "owner": "theodor.__1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089851175303986, "text": "Yeah its no fifrent for men", "created_at": "2025-12-10T09:30:33", "owner": "shadowder3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111698506614427, "text": "Damn bro that was fire🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-10T09:30:22", "owner": "sher.ek12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085097801105650, "text": "So u wanna feel not alone but only way for people to talk to u is to buy ur stupid only fans to tip just talk to u", "created_at": "2025-12-10T08:53:37", "owner": "_monster_chocness_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974076840804153, "text": "So you just basically had 💦 with 9 different guys", "created_at": "2025-12-10T08:46:52", "owner": "milankhadka____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086666161987221, "text": "omgg", "created_at": "2025-12-10T08:25:57", "owner": "olivialove66_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895416889222360, "text": "Dont talk about lonely if you do OF that what make you lonely yes get alot of money yet the true prize is lonelyness  who ever come and pays you had 1 reason only instead doing OF focus on changing your life style get a real job chase your dream or whatever true man will come around and confess dont give up on life just keep moving forward is not that hard doing OF and make sx with everyman you meet is stupid to expect them to talk about how much they love you or whatever for real dont down grade yourself go find a better life dont be stupid dont wasted my time reading about your bullshit with a man that you meet while you make OF shit", "created_at": "2025-12-10T08:05:50", "owner": "feelslost._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082856429110575, "text": "On today's episode of shit that never happened", "created_at": "2025-12-10T07:49:41", "owner": "srtona.562", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18505727023078498, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-10T07:46:50", "owner": "random_user_to_die", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088422518484050, "text": "Sex gc in bio", "created_at": "2025-12-10T07:46:37", "owner": "mikazukiaugus_xd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947223355069488, "text": "I don’t blame the guys I blame u , u put urself in a that position.", "created_at": "2025-12-10T07:19:24", "owner": "_dope.y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945838072080783, "text": "We get it, you have an OF. Do something productive", "created_at": "2025-12-10T07:13:00", "owner": "brenden_2e", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082323572144839, "text": "Proud dad left the chat. And you", "created_at": "2025-12-10T07:12:18", "owner": "simone_cortesi_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18548160376063621, "text": "@louniiiiia acid bath, shot, sliced…not dying but feeling the pain. The worse you do, the worse it will be. Also, 3 billion of your kind to be killed soon. Trash.", "created_at": "2025-12-10T07:08:54", "owner": "serpmk0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18424394944112971, "text": "why u didnt date your male actor?", "created_at": "2025-12-10T06:58:20", "owner": "apajapknya_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986576871919758, "text": "Bruh wasn't this about a man not liking you have only fans the lying is insane", "created_at": "2025-12-10T06:52:00", "owner": "ceryim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981133365777705, "text": "🔥🙌hi", "created_at": "2025-12-10T06:48:31", "owner": "dougthedogtrainer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18432985588109231, "text": "Bro u got of who cares about ur personality", "created_at": "2025-12-10T06:34:21", "owner": "sadayev.eden", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077932915965975, "text": "How people are subscribing to her, if she doesn't even look that good, her face look like a boy not a girl", "created_at": "2025-12-10T06:32:42", "owner": "shadow_avak1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080328467332556, "text": "I fucked 9 dudes and it made me feel empty. Pay money to see my asshole on OF to make me feel less empty.", "created_at": "2025-12-10T06:24:02", "owner": "wishingonabeard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971338854974442, "text": "Hoe", "created_at": "2025-12-10T05:58:49", "owner": "nomad_the_human", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087565313049793, "text": "Bonny black?", "created_at": "2025-12-10T05:52:59", "owner": "cruijsm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148661269427555, "text": "The caption still doesn't explain the police cars?", "created_at": "2025-12-10T05:39:57", "owner": "lukelawson1221", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890569090388910, "text": "You need God. I’ve been in a very similar situation as you. I was lost and going from girl to girl looking for someone to fill a hole in my heart. One day at a church camp it hit me. I didn’t need a person. I needed God. I made the best decision of my life that night and got baptized the next day. I’ve been happier than I ever have after that. It’s been around 4 years since then and I’m so much better than I used to be. You probably won’t see this but hopefully it reaches the right people. I will be praying for you.", "created_at": "2025-12-10T05:38:25", "owner": "htxjperk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146078077439650, "text": "A Lock that is opened by 9 different keys isnt a Good Lock.